<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Oknayene Ibo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Oknayene Ibo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Oknayene Ibo</para>
  <para style="mt">Oknayene Ibo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">God siragl mere taragl mudu ere yomere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Okna kaima ibo, God kamun mina ibo ya dumo makan ere yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Ere yogo, makan erme yomere yekre, wau kaima yogwa. Makandigle nigl kau sugo, mim wai di yogwa. Yegl eruko, God Murubuglomo nigl tebe winabo di wan moglkwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Earth out of nothing" file="HK Creation of Heavens and Earth.tif" size="span" copy="HK British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="1.2">Makan gaba erme yomere yekre, wau kaima yogwa</figure><verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Ana God ere mogl, Abuglage sinabiwe dugo, abuglage sugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Abuglage sugo, God kanugwa i, wakai yogo, kanugwa. Kandre, abuglage sinabuka ege i pere ede, mim erabuka ege i pere ede, erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Ana abuglage sugwa ege i we, etne we dugwa. Te, mim erukwa ege i we, eduer we dugwa. Ana min padre, tagugwa ege i, ege keremoknaye yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Ana ege namba 2 i we, God ere mogl, Nigl makandigle moglkwa ikra i pere pere edenagle dugwa. Nigl tau makandigle pai moran, tau mitna ibo morabuka. Ana suna i we, agai ta yenabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />God dugo, ye dumere pai yugwa. God agai ikra ere yogo, nigl tau makan mitna moglko, nigl tau agai i ere yomara mitna ibo moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Ana agai i we, God kamun mitna we dugwa. Ana min padre, tagugwa ege i, ege namba 2 yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Ana ege namba 3 i we, God ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Nigl makan mina moglkwa ikra we, ede pi dumo swara ta morabiwe dugwa. Nigl dumo swara ta moran, nigl moglkrabara i we, makan gaba yenabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Dugo, ye dumere pai yugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Ana agai nigl moglkrumara i we, God makan gaba we dugwa. Te, nigl ede pi agai swara ta moglmara i we, mudi nigl we dugwa. Ana God makan gaba ya mudi nigl kanugwa i, wakai yogo, kanugwa.<verse eid="GEN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Ana God ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Makan mina ede ya kugl kan kane kane wi si, parenaiglmiwe dugwa. Kugl mogo koraiglkwa, keglbi, ede ama mogo keglbi, mogono atne panabuka. Ana kugl ya ede mogo keglbi, mogo i ama wi si, parimere yegl keme pare, mogo kogl, eraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. Dugo, ye dumere pai yugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Makan mina kugl kan kane kane mogo koraiglkwa pariko, te ede kane kane mogo koraiglkwa pariko, mogono i ama wi si parimere yegl keme pare mogo kogl erikwa. Eriko, God kanugwa i, wakai yogo, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Ana min padre, tagugwa ege i, ege namba 3 yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Ana ege namba 4 i we, God ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Kamun mitna ibo, taragl tau pai, abuglage sinaiglmiwe dugwa. Abuglage sibi, etne i pere ede, eduer i pere ede, eraiglkwa. Ersre, ye ama taragl kane kane i nogugl edenaiglkwa. Ege kor ya bugla yugu kor yenabuka igne i nogugl ede, kamun sinabuka egemo mo ade denabuka egemo ama i nogugl ede, yegl eraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />Yegl ersre, taragl i ama abuglage si ede makan mina edinaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. Dugo, ye dumere pai yugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />God taragl suo abuglage podo sinabredi ere yedre, kugl kuri ama ere yogwa. Ana taragl suo abuglage podo sinabrika pre ere yogwa i we, ade etne abuglage podo kaima sinabedi ere yedre, te, ba eduer abuglage kebra dagl sinabedi ere yogwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Sun, Moon and Stars" file="FM 003 Sun, Moon, Earth_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="1.16">God ade, ba, ya kugl kuri ere yogwa</figure> <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Ere yedre, God ye ade, ba, ya kugl kuri ere yogwa i, kamun mitna ibo ere paduglkwa. Abuglage si ede makan mina edenaiglkwa pre ya te, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />etne ya eduer sugl moraiglkwa pre ya te, etne i pere ede, eduer i pere ede eraiglkwa pre kamun mitna ibo ere paduglkwa. Ere kodidre, God taragl ere yogwa kanugwa i, wakai yogo, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Ana min padre, tagugwa ege i, ege namba 4 yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Ana ege namba 5 i we, God ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Nigle taragl kane kane, mere kide moraiglmiwe dugwa. Nigl mina meglbi, kua ama kamun mitna pru di wan moraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Ana God taragl podo kide nigle meglkwa ya buglo bagle kane kane ere yedre, kua ama kane kane ere yogwa. Ere yedre, taragl swara swarade yene pere pere meglmere mere gagro pere pere kuraiglkwa ere yogwa. Ere yogwa, meglko, God kanugwa i, wakai meglko, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Kandre, God ogo kade ake mina ede, taragl nigle meglkwa i di wakai yei togwa, Ene gagro mere kulo! Kiglbi, nigle taragl mere kide moraiglmiwe dugwa. Didre, ye ama Kua mere moraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Ana min padre, tagugwa ege i, ege namba 5 yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Ana ege namba 6 i we, God ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Taragl kane kane makan mina moraiglmiwe dugwa. Agl bugla kane kane ya te, dua kabu kane kane ya te, taragl kebra kane kane makan mina wan moraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. Dugo, ye dumere pai yugwa, <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />God dua kabu kane kane ere yedre, agl bugla ere yedre, taragl kebra kane kane makan mina wan moraiglmedi ere yogwa. Ere yogwa i, taragl swara swarade yene pere pere meglmere mere gagro pere pere kuraiglkwa ere yogwa. Ere yogwa, meglko, God kanugwa i, wakai meglko, kanugwa.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Ana God ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Nono yoba beke yenamniwe dugwa. Yoba nono munere moraiglmedi beke yenamga. Beke yomun, ye dumo makan mudu ya taragl pra pra makan mina wan meglkwa i, bitno mere mogl, sugl moraiglkwa. Ye buglo bagle ki sugl moglsre, kua ki sugl moglsre, agl bugla ya taragl pra pra makan mina wan meglkwa i ama sugl moglsre, yegl eraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Ana God yoba beke yogwa. Yene moglmere moraiglmedi beke yogwa. Yagl ya abu beke yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />God yoba beke yedre, ogo kade ake mina ede, di wakai yei togwa, Ene gak mere kide kuglsro! Mere kide kiur, yoba mere meglbi, ene yoba dumo pere pere pi mogl, dumo makan mudu sugl moraiglkwa. Ana buglo bagle ya te, kua ya te, taragl pra pra makan mina wan meglkwa i, na ene yoba ye bitno mere yegl ediga. Ene ye bitno mere mogl, sugl moraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Yegl didre, ye ere mogl, ka yegl di togwa, Ene priro! Ede ya kugl kan mogo keglkwa dumo pra pra paigwa. Paigwa i, ene yoba nenaiglkwa pre na ene teiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Didre, Ana dua kabu ya kua ya taragl pra pra makan mina wan meglkwa i we, kugl kan ya ede yaudo ki nenaiglkwa pre na ama ere yei teiwe di, yegl dugwa. Dugo, ye dumere pai yugwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Ana God taragl mudu ere yei kodugwa kanugwa i, mudu wakai kaima yogo, kanugwa. Ana min padre, tagugwa ege i, ege namba 6 yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Ana yegl keme God taragl mudu ere yei kodugwa. Ye kamun mina ibo ya te, dumo makan ya te, taragl mudu kamun mina ibo paigwa ya maginagle meglkwa ya paigwa i, ere yei kodugwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Ana God kogonmo ere u, ege namba 6 mina ere kodidre, ege namba 7 i we, ye wakan moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Wakan moglsre, ege namba 7 i pere ede, Ege kade ta yenabiwe dugwa. Ye ege namba 7 wakan moglkwa pre yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">God dumo wakaile Iden ere yogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Yawe God kamun mina ibo ya dumo makan ere yogwa igne, siragl taragl plau dugwa yegl pre paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Ana Yawe God kamun mina ibo ya dumo makan ere yogwa igne, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />ede ya kugl kan wi si, parekrikwa. Yawe God kamun dedekruko, yoba ama taragl tau ere yarabuka ta moglkrukwa. Yegl pre ede ya kugl kan wi si parekrikwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Ana ege i, kamun sikrukwa ba nigl tau makan atne moglkwa ake tomunugo, makan pra pra kugl togwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Ana okuo Yawe God ere mogl, makan gaba idre, yoba yagl ta bekugwa. Bekidre, God dra mur pu dinan, yoba kor morabedi yogwa i, yagl i guma mina pu dugo, dra mur ede pi yagl bekugwa i, guma mina ede yugugl ogo, yagl i u yoba moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Ana Yawe God ere mogl, dumo ta wakaile yenabedi ede ya ki ere yaglkwa. Dumo i, ade umara yogwa, kagie Iden we digwa. Ye ere yaglsre, yoba yagl ta bekugwa ikra i pi suna edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Ana dumo i we, Yawe God ede kane kane yaglkwa. Tau i we, yoba wakai kanaiglkwa pre yaglkwa. Te, tau i we, mogo keglbi, yoba uro nedre, wakai praiglkwa pre yaglkwa. Ana dumo suna i we, ede suo ama yaglkwa pabrika. Ta i we, yoba mogomo uro nebi, aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa. Te, ta i we, yoba mogomo uro nebi, mabuno wakai ya mabuno kide pre pogl sinaiglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Ana dumo Iden suna i we, nigl ta ugwa. Nigl i ede ya kugl kan ki yegl Iden paigwa i nigl togwa. Tedre, ede pi Iden meda ogwa. Iden meda pidre, nigl i pasi ede, bage 4-pela ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Nigl ta i we, kagie Pison we digwa. Nigl Pison i we, ede kantri ta Apila we dimara pidre, geke bake ede ogwa. Ana kantri Apila we digwa i we, gol paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Gol Apila paugwa i wakai paugo, ana ede ta ama paugwa, nuglo demene wakai erukwa. Ede i paugo, kobuglo wakai ta ama paugwa, mige podo boglkwa. Kobuglo i kagie kanilian we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Ana nigl namba 2 i we, Gihon we digwa. Nigl Gihon ede pi kantri Kus we dimara pidre, geke bake ede ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Ana nigl namba 3 i we, kagie Taikris we digwa. Nigl Taikris ede pi kantri Asiria we digwa yomara bina ade umara koglo kana ogwa. Ana nigl namba 4 i we, kagie Yupretis we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Ana Yawe God ere mogl, yoba yagl ta bekugwa ikra i pi dumo Iden suna edugwa. Yagl kogon ersre, dumo sugl morabuka pre i pi suna edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Edidre, Yawe God ere mogl, yagl ka giglede yegl di togwa, Ene we, ede pra pra dumo wakaile paigwa mogo keglkwa i, uro nenatnga. <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />Uro nenatnga ba ede swara ta paugwa, yoba mogomo uro nebi, mabuno wakai ya mabuno kide pre pogl sinaiglkwa i, ede i keme mogomo uro nekro! Ene ta uro nen, ege i ene kaima goratniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Ana Yawe God ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Yagl yene swara moglkwa kuno erekrukwa pre na yoba kunamo ta ye ake ple dinabuka ama bekenagle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Ana okna Yawe God makan gaba idre, agl bugla ya dua kabu kwi bekidre, kua bekidre, yegl erukwa. Ana ye taragl pra pra bekugwa meglkwa yu, yagl moglmara edugwa. Yagl taragl swara swarade siragl kagno yei tenabuka pragledi prisre, ye moglmara edugwa. Edugo, yagl taragl swara swarade kagno yei togwa, kagno i aimadi pai moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Ye agl bugla ya, kua ya, dua kabu ki kagno swara swarade yei togwa, ba ye yoba kunamo ta ye ake ple dinabuka ta moglkrukwa.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Ana yagl ye yoba kunamo ta moglkruko, Yawe God ere mogl, yagl ugl du panabedi eruko, ye ugl du paugwa. Ugl du paugo, God dagigle yobuglo swara ta gudu idre, aglke kun yomara si kegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Si kegl didre, ye dagigle yobuglo ikra wagle abu ta bekidre, yu, yagl moglmara edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Edugo, yagl yegl dugwa, Erme we, yoba i na moglmere moglkwa. God na yobra ya mienana idre, ye yobuglo ya miemo bekugwa. Na yagl yobra ya mienana idre, ye bekugwa pre na abu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yagl ye abu yene moglmere moglmedi kandre, kagie abu we dugwa. Ka Hibru mina, yagl ya abu kagno swara mere yegl paugwa. Ye yagl Ish we didre, abu Isha we didre, erikwa.</char></note> we dinagle di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Ana mabuno yegl paugwa pre yagl nem mam kide kodidre, ye ebie bogl si dakagl morabrika. Miur, ogono nagino swara kaima mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Ana yagl abu suo ikra kugugl gagl edekre, yokoko miurka. Yokoko miurka ba agai goglkribrika.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Adam ya Ewa God Kamo Sedibrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Ana Yawe God dua kabu ya ki kane kane ere yogwa meglkwa. Meglko, toki ta moglkwa. Toki i, ye swara nomane podo paugwa. Ana toki u, abu yegl di prukwa, God kaima ene di te, ede pra pra dumo wakaile paigwa i mogono uro nekriro dumo? toki yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Di pruko, abu di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ede dumo wakaile paigwa i, mogono uro nenabuglka. <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />Ba ede swara ta dumo suna paugwa. Ede i pre, God yegl di norukwa, Ene gogl dinabriwa. Ede i mogomo uro nekre, edemo akekre, eriro! dume di, abu yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Dugo, toki ye di te, Ene ta goglkrabre dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />God prukwa i, i ta uro nebr, ene nomane podo inabrika. God nomane podo pamere idre, mabuno kide wakai akie pre pogl si dinabrika pre dume dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Ana abu ere mogl, ede ikra mogomo koglkwa kandre, yegl di prukwa, Ede mogo i wakai kaniga. Yoba uro nebi, dogon erabuka. Na ama uro nebo, nomane podo inagle di prukwa. Prisre, mogomo tau uro nedre, ye wie magigl moglkwa ama tau togo, nogwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Nogo, yagl abu suo ye nomane idre, nono yokoko mugledi pribrika. Prisre, ede fik we digwa yaudo tau bro idre, taragl kaur mere ya kodai mere si bogl, ere pribrika.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Ana min paugwa igne i we, Yawe God dumo wakaile suna makandigle wan moglkwa, pribrika. Prisre, Yawe God no kan dinabedi ede paimara teke pabrika. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Ana Yawe God ere mogl, yagl Adam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Adam mabuno ta paugwa, mabuno yagl.</char></note> we digwa i agle di prukwa, Ene aglo motne? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Dugo, Adam di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ene dumo wakaile wan motnga prisre, kudugl goglsre, teke paiga. Na yokoko moglka pre kudugl gole dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Ana God ere mogl, yagl di pre, Ira ene yokoko motnedi di tome? Na ede mogo swara ta uro nekro diga ikra uro neno? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Di pruko, yagl yegl dugwa, Ene abu no akie morabredi beke natnga i, ye ede mogo uro naruko, na neiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Dugo, Yawe God ere mogl, abu di pre, Ene siragl pre etne? dugwa. Dugo, abu di ikne ede, Toki na bakagl naruko, neiwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">God yagl abu ya toki di kide yei togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Ana Yawe God ere mogl, toki yegl di togwa, Ene yegl etnga pre yubun podo inatnga. Agl bugla ya dua kabu mere meglmara ene swara yubun podo inatnga. Ene dan mina keme wandre, makan kugane nedre, yegl keme aimadi moratnga. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Yegl motn, na ama yubun yegl ene teiga, ene ya abu kuda ikne ikne morabrika. Kuda ikne ikne miur, ene gawanma ya ye gawamo ama kuda ikne ikne moraiglkwa. Meglbi, ye gawamo ene bitn egre kogl sinabuka. Sinan, ene kagle beye karatniwe di, toki di kide yei togwa.<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Ana abu we, God ere mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Na yubun yegl ene teiga, gak kuratnga igne, giugl podo prisre, kuratnga. Yegl panabuka ba ene win aimadi wakai kan pai moratnga. Pai motn, ye ama ene bitn mere mogl, ene sugl morabe di, abu yegl di togwa.<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Ana yagl we, God ere mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Ene ebin kamo prisre, ede mogo ta uru nekro diga nenga. Ene yegl etnga pre, na makan gaba ere kide ere teiga. Ene aimadi makan mina kogon podo ersre, kaya mokna i nenatnga. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Ana kaya mokna ere yaratnara kugl kide ya kugl kan kagigle boglkwa wi si panabuka. Wi si panabuka ba kaya mokna ama bogl panan, i nenatnga. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Ene kogon podo ersre, pitn boglsre, kaya mokna i nenatnga. Yegl keme aimadi ere mogl, gogln, ogn gagn ede ikne u, makan gaba wagle enabuka. Na makan gaba idre, ene bekiga pre ene gogln ede ikne makan gaba wagle enatniwe di, yagl yegl di togwa.<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Ana Adam ere mogl, ye ebie kagie Ewa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Ewa mabuno ta paugwa, mabuno meglkwa mere paugwa.</char></note> yei togwa. Yoba mudu okuo moraiglkwa ye gawama keme moraiglkwa pre kagie Ewa we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Ana Yawe God ere mogl, agl bugla ta si gogl, nagie kugl yaursre, kugugl gagl mere Adam ebie bogl ede togwa.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">God ye Adam ya Ewa di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Ana Yawe God ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Yagl abu suo i we, ye etne u nono munere miurka pai dumiwe dugwa. Ye mabuno wakai ya mabuno kide akie pre pogl sibrika pre erme ede ta paugwa, yoba mogomo uro nebi aimadi kor moraiglkwa ikra, yagl abu uro nedre, aimadi kor mogl dinabriwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Yegl pre Yawe God ye yagl dumo Iden di meda edugwa. Ye okna makan gaba idre, yagl bekugwa. Ana erme yagl makan gaba i mina kogon ersre, kaya mokna ere yarabuka pre God ye di meda edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Ana ye yagl abu di meda edidre, angelo giglede meglkwa tau dumo Iden ade umara koglo kana kan moraiglmedi edugwa. Edidre, bainet ta ama edugwa. Bainet i, doga mere dedre, kur kur si pai moglkwa. Angelo i ya bainet i, yoba ede ikra pamara ede ikne u dinaiglmedi God ye konbauna sugl kan moraiglmedi edugwa.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kein ya Abel ye Yawe God tawa tebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Ana Adam ya Ewa ere mogl, bogl swara pabriko, Ewa dane paugo, ye yagl gak ta kugl yogwa. Kugl yedre, ye yegl dugwa, Yawe na ake ple di naruko, yagl gak ta kule di, yegl dugwa. Didre, yagl gak i kagie Kein we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Ana okuo, ye yagl gak ta ama kuglsre, kagie Abel we dugwa. Ana yagl gak suo i kade miurka igne i we, Abel sipsip ere kuglkwa yagle moglko, Kein kaya mokna ere yaglkwa yagle moglko, eribrika.<figure style="fig" alt="Cain and Abel making sacrifices" file="C008 bw OT-biggerAltars.tif" size="span" copy="Ethnos360" ref="4.2" /><verse eid="GEN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Ana okuo Kein kaya mokna ere yaglkwa bogl paugo, Kein tau si i pi Yawe tawa togwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Togo, Abel sipsip nagigle ta si goglsre, togidre, wam bogl idre, i pi tawa togwa. Sipsip nagigle i, mam nagigle komono paugwa. Tawa togo, Yawe ye Abel erukwa wakai kandre, Abel tawa togwa kan yugwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />Kan yugwa ba ye Kein erukwa kide kandre, Kein tawa togwa kan ikrukwa. Kan ikruko, Kein dem podo kubruko, guma dra u kide ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, Kein yegl di prukwa, Ene we, siragl eruko den kubutne? Ene guman dran siragl pre u kide ome? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Didre, ye ama yegl di togwa, Ene kuno ta etn, na ene wakai kanaglka. Ba ene kuno ta erekitn we, tadaglme ene sinabuka. Tadaglme i, agl bugla are mere yugun dramugl moglsre, ene sinagledi ere moglkwa. Tadaglme ene sidre, ene sugl moragledi erukwa, ba ene mane dinatnga pamiwe di, God yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Ana Kein ere mogl, ye agigle Abel yegl di togwa, Nono ede kugl wai wai yomara obuglo! dugwa. Dugo, ye ede pi kugl wai wai yomara wan miurko, Kein ere mogl, ye agigle si goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, Kein di prukwa, Ene agitn Abel aglo moglme? dugwa. Kein di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ta kankrika. Ene na agra sugl moglkwa yagle moglmedi pitno? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Dugo, God ere mogl, Ene siragl etne? dugwa. Ene agitn si goglnga, ye bormaimo ede makan mina ogwa. Bormaimo i we, i yoba mere mogl, siragl etnga i, na te ikne edenaglka mere, yegl di narukwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11-12" />Erme we, ene mabuno kide ta etnga pre yubun podo ta inatnga. Ene agitn si goglnga boromaimo ede makan mina ogwa. Ogwa pre ene makan mina kogon ta erekratnga. Eratnga, ba ene kogon ta etn, kaya mokna wakai ta boglkrabuka. Yegl eran, ene dumonen ta yekran, ene wanwan kua moratniwe di, yegl di kide yei togwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Ana Kein ere mogl, Yawe yegl di togwa, Ene yubun podo kaima natnga. Na inaglka kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Na kaya mokna ere yaraglba mane dinga. Na ama si pi eglke edinga pre ene motnara ta moglkraglka. Na makana ta yekran, wanwan kua moglbo, yoba ta na tegigl yebi, na na si goraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Dugo, Yawe di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ta manabuka. Ene yubun podo teiga ba yoba ta ene si geglbi, yubun podo kide kaima inaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. Didre, ye ere mogl, yoba Kein kandre, si gogl dinaiglmedi ogo gagie mina muno ere paduglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Ana Kein Yawe moglmara kide kodidre, ede pi dumo makan ta Not we dimara moglkwa. Dumo makan Not<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, dumo kagie Not mabuno ta paugwa, yoko wan moglkwa mere paugwa.</char></note> we digwa i, dumo Iden ade umara koglo ibo kra yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kein gawama kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Ana Kein ere mogl, ye ebie bogl, bogl swara pabriko, ye ebie yagl gak ta kugl yogwa, kagie Enok we dugwa. Kugl yogo, Kein dumo ta bru yedre, dumo i ye wam kagie yei te, dumo Enok we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Okuo, Enok ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Irat we dugwa. Ana okuo Irat ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Mehujael we dugwa. Okuo Mehujael ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Metusael we dugwa. Okuo Metusael ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Lamek we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Ana yagl Lamek i we, ye abu suo yugwa. Abu ta i we, kagie Ada we digwa. Ana ta i we, kagie Sila we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ana Ada yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Jabal we digwa. Ana Jabal i we, ye komono kana sel yugu ki padre, kau ya ki ere kuglko, okuo yoba mere erumere yegl erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Jabal agigle ta moglkwa, kagie Jubal we digwa. Ana Jubal i we, ye komono kana pumige ya taragl gita mere ki yegl sugo, okuo yoba mere sumere yegl sigwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Abu Sila ama yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Tubalkein we digwa. Ana Tubalkein i we, ye ain ya taragl ain mere yegl ta yogwa kagie bras we digwa idre, kogon taragl ya ki bekugwa. Tubalkein abauglo ta moglkwa, kagie Nama we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Ana yagl Lamek i we, ye ere mogl, ebie suo yegl di togwa, Ada ya Sila, na ebina suo, na ka ta dinaglka ene priro. Kumugl gak ta na sugwa boglka pre na ere mogl, ye si goglkra. <verse eid="GEN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Na ye si goglka ba yoba ere mogl, na ta sikraiglkwa. Yoba ta Kein si goran, yubun podo kaima inabuka. Ana na we, yoba ta na si goran, yubun podo kide kaima inabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ewa yagl gak kor ta kuglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Ana Adam ya Ewa aglke kor dagl bogl swara pabriko, Ewa ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Set yei togwa. I siragl pre Ewa yegl dugwa, Na wana Kein ye agigle Abel si goglkwa. Si goglkwa pre erme God gak kor ta narukwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Set mabuno paugwa, narukwa.</char></note>. Gak kor ta narukwa i, Abel agaimo inabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Ana okuo, Set yagl gak ta kuglsre, kagie Enos we dugwa. Enos moglkwa igne, yoba ere mogl, mabuno bogl Yawe agle di prisre, kamage ere tedre, erikwa.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Adam gawama kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Adam ya ye gawoma kano paugwa. Ka komono we, God yoba beke yogwa igne ikra, yene moglmere moraiglmedi beke yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Yagl ya abu beke yedre, taragl okuo plau dinabuka u wakai enabedi di wakai yei tedre, kagno yoba we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Ana Adam bugla yugu 130 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Set we dugwa. Yagl gak i, nem moglmere mere kuno moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Adam yagl gak Set kuglsre, okuo bugla yugu 800 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 800 ta mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Ana Adam bugla yugu nogwa i swara ede, 930 nedre, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Ana Set bugla yugu 105 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Enos we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Ye Enos kuglsre, okuo bugla yugu 807 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 807 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Ana Set bugla yugu nogwa i swara ede, 912 nedre, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Ana Enos bugla yugu 90 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Kenan we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Ye Kenan kuglsre, okuo bugla yugu 815 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 815 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Ana Enos bugla yugu nogwa i swara ede, 905 nedre, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Ana Kenan bugla yugu 70 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Mahalalel we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Ye Mahalalel kuglsre, okuo bugla yugu 840 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 840 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Ana Kenan bugla yugu nogwa i swara ede, 910 nedre, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Ana Mahalalel bugla yugu 65 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Jaret we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Ye Jaret kuglsre, okuo bugla yugu 830 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 830 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Ana Mahalalel bugla yugu nogwa i swara ede, 895 nedre, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Ana Jaret bugla yugu 162 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Enok we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Ye Enok kuglsre, okuo bugla yugu 800 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 800 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Ana Jaret bugla yugu nogwa i swara ede, 962 nedre, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Ana Enok bugla yugu 65 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Metusela we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Ye Metusela kuglsre, okuo bugla yugu 300 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Igne i, ye God bogl deno muduno swara yedre, boma daguma miurka. Bugla yugu 300 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Ana Enok bugla yugu nogwa i swara ede, 365 nogwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Igne i ye God bogl boma daguma miurko, God ye gagie kia bogl i ede ogo, ye imem daglkwa, yoba ye kankrikwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Ana Metusela bugla yugu 187 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Lamek we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Ye Lamek kuglsre, bugla yugu 782 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 782 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Ana Metusela bugla yugu nogwa i swara ede, 969 nedre, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Ana Lamek bugla yugu 182 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Kuglsre, yegl dugwa, Yawe makan gaba ere kide ere norukwa pre nono kogon podo ersre, giugl prisre, kaya mokna i nomga. Ana na erme yagl gak ta kuglka i we, ye nono ake ple di noran, nono tau wakan moramniwe dugwa. Didre, ye yagl gak i kagie Noa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Noa mabuno paugwa, mabuno wakan meglkwa mere paugwa.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Lamek ye Noa kuglsre, bugla yugu 595 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 595 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Ana Lamek bugla yugu nogwa i swara ede, 777 nedre, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Ana Noa bugla yugu 500 nedre, yagl gak suota kuglkwa. Ta kagie Siem we didre, ta kagie Ham we didre, ta kagie Jafet we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yoba mudu mabuno kide beglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Ana okuo yoba mere kide makan mina bage bage moglsre, ye abroma mere kiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />Kiglko, God wama tau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, God wama we di beglkwa. Yoba tau angelo tau u kide eigwa pre dumedi prikwa, ba yoba tau prikwa i, Set gawama, yoba God kamo prikwa i pre dumedi prikwa.</char></note> yoba abai gak kiglkwa i wakai kandre, yene wakai kanimere igwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Igo, Yawe yegl dugwa, Yoba we, ye aimadi moglkraiglkwa. Te, na Murubuglona aimadi ka giglede ta di te moglkrabuka. Yoba bugla yugu 120 moglsre, goraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Ana God wana tau ye abai gak igwa ikra, akie bogl swara paigo, abai wagle ikra yagl gak kiglkwa. Yagl gak kiglkwa i podo mogl, olto kaima meglkwa. Ege i meglko, okuo tau ama meglkwa. Ana yoba podo meglkwa i, ye okna ibo yobuglo podo eriko, ye kagno paugwa.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Ana Yawe kanugwa yoba ege ege mabuno kide keme kinano gudu pre, mabuno erikwa ama kide kaima erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Eriko, Yawe kandre, ye okna yoba beke yogwa kide prisre, dem muduo yubun dogwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Dem muduo yubun dogo, ye yegl dugwa, Na yoba beke yeiga ba etne kide prika pre mudu si goraglka. Yoba si goglsre, agl bugla ya dua kabu ya kua ki ama mudu si goragle di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Yegl dugwa ba yagl swara ta moglkwa, kagie Noa we digwa. Ana Noa i we, Yawe ye swara wakai kanugwa.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Noa ya ye gawama kano paugwa. Ana Noa mabuno kide erekre, yoba du moglkwa pre gagie ka ta sikrikwa. Ye God bogl deno muduno swara yedre, boma daguma miurka. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Te, Noa yagl gak suota kuglkwa. Ta kagie Siem we didre, ta Ham we didre, ta Jafet we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Ana yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa we, ye God gumuglo wagle u kide pi kodidre, ye ama kuda magigl magigl beglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />God kanugwa, yoba mudu ka kaima mabuno kide keme beglkwa pre u kide pi kodigwa.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noa sip ta bekugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Animals entering the ark" file="FM 027 Animals Enter the Ark_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="6.13" />Ana God ere mogl, Noa yegl di togwa, Yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i kuda keme beglkwa pre na yoba mudu si goragledi prika. Na kuri ta mogl, yoba mudu si goglsre, makan ama ere kide eraglka. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Ana ene we, ede gopa we digwa i, tau si yudre, sip ta bekenatniwa. Sip ta bekenatnga yugugl i we, agai pere pere yenabuka. Ana sip beke kodin, nigl ede yugugl pi dinabedi ene ede nuglo idre, sip meda ya yugugl akie egratniwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Ana sip siragl mere sie yei bekenatnga i we, yegl eratnga, sip olto 130 mita mere bekidre, prak 22 mita mere bekidre, ana ede mitna enabuka i, 13 mita mere bekenatniwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Ene sip idaule bekidre, sip dagigle wagle kugl kar ere ede mitna enatnga ba sip bre yomara magigl 1 mita ikne kugl kar erekratnga. Agai i yoko yenabuka. Ana sip dagigle wagle dua ta ersre, sip yugugl bogl suota tebe atne kuratnga. Bogl ta atne kuglsre, ta suna kuglsre, ta mitna ibo kuratniwe di, yegl di togwa.<verse eid="GEN 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />God yegl didre, ye ama ka yegl di togwa, Ene pro! Na kamun podo ta dedenaglka. Dedibo, nigl makandile mudu ake wai dinan, yoba ya taragl kane kane makan mina moglsre, ir mina pipode igwa i, mudu goraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Ba na ene ka kaima di te padraglka. Ene ebin bogl, ya wanma ebinoma bogl akie ede sip mina yugugl enaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Ana agl bugla ya dua kabu ki we, ene taragl mudu makan mina meglkwa suo suode idre, i pi sip yugugl edinatniwa. Taragl swara swarade kumugl ta idre, abai ta idre, ye ene bogl kor moraiglmedi i pi sip yugugl edinatniwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Kua kane kane ya te, agl bugla kane kane ya te, taragl kane kane makan mina wanigwa i, ye kor moramnedi suo suode ede u ene moratnara unaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Ana kaya mokna mudu kane kane yogwa i, tau si i pi sip yugugl edin, yenan, ene yoba nebi, agl bugla ya ki ama nenaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />God ka yegl di te kodugo, yagl Noa i we, God dumere mudu duglo boglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Nigl kamun podo sugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Ana okuo Yawe ere mogl, Noa yegl di togwa, Yoba mudu erme meglkwa i we, ye mudu mabuno kide erikwa. Kide erikwa ba ene swara yoba du motnga kaniga. Yegl pre ene yobanma mudu bogl ede sip yugugl pio. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Ana agl bugla ya ki yegl meglkwa i we, tau yoba si gogl, tawa naraiglkwa kuno erukwa, tau kuno erekrukwa. Ana taragl tau kuno erukwa i we, ene taragl swara swarade kumugl 7-pela idre, abai 7-pela idre, ede sip yugugl enaiglkwa. Te, taragl tau kuno erekrukwa i we, ene taragl swara swarade kumugl swara ta idre, abai swara ta idre, ede enaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Ana kua i we, kua kane kane meglkwa i, ene ama swara swarade kumugl 7-pela idre, abai 7-pela idre, ede sip yugugl enaiglkwa. Ene yegl eribi, taragl kane kane meglkwa kumugl ya abai tau goglkre, kor mogl, gagro kuraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Ana na we, na ege 7-pela de mogl, kamun dedenaglka. Kamun dedibo, ege 40-pela de etne sidre, eduer sidre, erabuka. Eran, taragl ere yeiga makan mina meglkwa i we, mudu goraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Yawe ka yegl di te kodugo, yagl Noa i we, ye Yawe dumere mudu duglo boglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Ana Noa bugla yugu 600 ne kodugwa igne, nigl kamun ikra si, makandile mudu ake wai dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Ana Noa yogo, ebie yogo, wama ebino bogl yeigo, ye nigl kamun ikra sinabukra we di prisre, ede sip yugugl eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Eigo, agl bugla kane kane yoba si gogl, tawa tenaiglkwa kuno erukwa ya te, agl bugla kane kane yoba si gogl, tawa tenaiglkwa kuno erekrukwa ya te, kua kane kane ya taragl kane kane makan mina wanigwa i, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />mudu suo suode wigwa. Taragl kane kane wigwa i we, ta kumugl yogo, ta abai yogo, suo suode ede u sip yugugl Noa moglmara wigwa. God unaiglmiwe di Noa di tomere wigwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Ana ege 7-pela de ikra dudugo, nigl kamun ikra sugwa.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Ana Noa bugla yugu 600 ne kodugwa igne ikra, ba 2 mun, de namba 17 i we, makan buko dugo, nigl podo makan atne ede egli ugwa. Ugo, kamun podo kaima sugwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Kamun etne si, eduer si moglkwa. Ege 40-pela de togokre, si pai moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Ana kamun podo kaima sugwa ba kamun mabuno bogl sugwa ade swara igne i we, Noa yogo, ye ebie yogo, Noa wama Siem ya Ham ya Jafet yeigo, ebino yeigo, ede pi sip yugugl eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Ana dua kabu kane kane ya te, agl bugla kane kane ya te, taragl kebra kane kane makan mina wan meglkwa ya te, kua kane kane ama sip yugugl meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Taragl mudu ir mina pipode igwa i, suo suode ede u Noa sip yugugl moglmara u kodigwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" /><figure style="fig" alt="Looking out of the ark" file="FM 028 Looking Out the Ark_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="7.16">Sip dua God yene yogugl togwa</figure>Taragl kane kane mudu meglkwa ta kumugl yogo, ta abai yogo, suo suode, God unaiglme dumere ede sip yugugl u kodigwa. Ana yoba ya taragl kane kane sip yugugl u, mogl kodigo, Yawe dua yogugl togwa.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Ana kamun ege 40-pela de si moglko, nigl makan ake wai didre, ede mitna pi, sip ake ple dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Ake ple didre, ede mitna kaima ogo, sip nigl yaudomugl wan moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Sip nigl yaudomugl wan moglko, nigl ede mitna pi mogl mogl, kamin muglo mudu uglo koglo koglo paigwa i, i atne ede kodugwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Nigl kamin muglo mudu i atne edidre, 7 mita mere ede mitna ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Nigl kamin podo yegl sugwa pre taragl kane kane makan mina meglkwa mudu geglkwa. Kua ya, agl bugla ya, dua kabu ya te, taragl kebra kebra makan mina wanigwa ya, yoba ama mudu geglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Taragl kane kane makan gaba mina wandre, ir mina pipode igwa i, mudu geglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Ana God yegl mere yoba ya agl bugla ya dua kabu ya kua ya taragl kebra makan mina wanigwa mudu si goglko, Noa bogl akie sip yugugl meglkwa ikra keme goglkre, kor meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" /><figure style="fig" alt="People drowning" file="FM 029 People Drowning in the Flood_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="7.24" />Ana nigl ege 150 de makan mudu ake wai di pai moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Nigl kamun dudugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Ana God ye Noa ya agl bugla ya dua kabu kane kane akie sip mina meglkwa ikra pre kodokrukwa. Pre kodokrukwa pre ye ir ta dedugo, ugwa. Ir ugo, nigl mabuno bogl dare ede atne ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />God ere edugo, nigl makan atne moglkwa okna ede meda ugwa ikra ukruko, kamun podo kide sugwa i togugo, erukwa pre <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />nigl dare ede atne pi moglkwa. Nigl dare ede atne pi moglko, ana ege 150 de ikra ede ogo, nigl dare ede atne kaima ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Dare ede atne kaima ogo, ana ba 7 mun, de namba 17 i we, sip ikra dumo makan ta Ararat we dimara muglo ibo u pai moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />U pai moglko, nigl ama dare ede atne pi pai moglko, ana ba 10 mun, de namba 1 i we, muglo meglbi tau ama u nogugl eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Ana muglo meglbi tau ama u nogugl eigo, Noa ege 40-pela de kan moglsre, dua kebra ta sip mina ere paduglkwa yauro edidre, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />kua ta kagie kotkot we digwa i meda edugwa. Edugo, kua i pru di bage bage pi, wanugwa. Pru di wan mogl, aglke ikne ukre, nigl mudu ede atne ogwa igne pra, wan moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Ana Noa ye nigl mere pai moglmo mo ede atne omada di prisre, kua yumugl ta i meda edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Edugo, kua yumugl pru di wan mogl, dumo ta ake morabuka dokugwa ba nigl makan ake wai di pai moglkwa pre dumo ta ake morabuka ta yekrukwa. Ta yekruko, kua yumugl aglke ede ikne u, Noa sip mina moglmara ugo, Noa ogo duglo si meda edugwa. Edugo, kua ye ogo mina akugo, ye yu sip yugugl edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Edidre, ye aglke kor ege 7-pela de moglsre, kua yumugl i meda edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Edugo, kua yumugl pru di wan mogl, pi min paugo aglke ede ikne ugwa. Ugwa igne, ye ede ta oliv we digwa yaudo ta bro kike yugwa. Yaudo ta bro kike yugo, Noa nigl ede atne ogwa pamedi prukwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Dove flying with olive twig" file="CO00633B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C. Cook" ref="8.11" /> <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Noa yegl prisre, ye aglke kor dagl ege 7-pela de mogl, kua ikra i meda edugwa. Edugo, kua pru di ede ikne ukrukwa.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Ana Noa bugla yugu 601 ne kodugwa igne, ba 1 mun, de namba 1 i we, nigl mudu dare ede atne ogwa. Ogo, Noa sip idaule mitna ikne sada boglsre, kan meda edugwa, nigl mudu dare kodugwa paugo, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Ana ba 2 mun, de namba 27 i we, makan mudu kugla dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Makan mudu kugla dugo, God ere mogl, Noa yegl di togwa, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />Ene ebin bogl yebr, wanma ebino bogl yebi, ede sip meda pio. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Ana taragl kane kane ene bogl akie sip mina meglkwa i, kua, agl bugla, dua kabu, ya taragl kane kane makan mina wanigwa taragl i, ene ama i pi sip meda edio. Edibi, ye gagro mere kiglbi, ede bage bage pi, moraiglmiwe di, yegl di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Di togo, Noa ebie bogl yebriko, wama ebino bogl yeigo, ede sip meda eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Eigo, agl bugla, dua kabu, kua ya taragl kane kane makan mina wanigwa taragl i ama ede sip meda eigwa. Taragl kane kane meglmere meglmere gi gide ede meda eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noa Yawe tawa togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Ana Noa ere mogl, kobuglo bogl ta kugl, Yawe tawa tenagledi ere yogwa. Ere yedre, agl bugla ya kua kane kane yoba si gogl, tawa tenaiglkwa kuno erukwa i tau idre, si goglsre, kobuglo bogl mina gagl tawa togwa. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Gagl tawa togo, Yawe demene erukwa prisre, dem muduo aragan erukwa. Dem muduo aragan eruko, yene nomane mina yegl di prukwa, Yoba we, ye gak kebra mogl, ede pi kade meglkwa igne pra, mabuno kide eramnedi prikwa. Yegl prikwa ba na aglke kor dagl mabuno kide erimara ere te ikne edenagledi makan ere kide ersre, taragl kane kane mudu meglkwa si goglsre, erimere yegl aglke kor dagl ta erekraglka. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" /><figure style="fig" alt="Noah sacrificing and rainbow" file="C011 bw OT.tif" size="span" copy="New Tribes Mission" ref="8.22">Noa tawa togo, Yawe titokubun borabedi erukwa</figure>Erekribo, yoba kaya mokna yaraiglkwa igne yenan, si yunaiglkwa igne ama ta yenabuka. Te, ir erabuka igne yenan, niga dinabuka igne ama ta yenabuka. Te, ade denabuka igne yenan, kamun sinabuka igne ama ta yenabuka. Te, etne yenan, eduer ama yenabuka. Dumo makan yoko yenabuka igne, yegl keme aimadi pai morabiwe di, yegl di prukwa.<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">God ye ka kaima Noa di te paduglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Ana God ere mogl, Noa wama bogl okuo wakai moraiglmedi ye di wakai yei te, yegl dugwa, Ene gak mere kide kulo! Mere kide kiglbi, ene yoba mere mogl, ede pi dumo pere pere uglo koglo koglo moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Ana dua kabu kane kane ya agl bugla ya kua ya taragl kebra makan mina wanigwa ya buglo bagle mudu i we, ene kuduglno podo goraiglkwa. Kuduglno podo geglbi, ene yoba mogl mitna edidre, ye sugl moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Ene taragl mudu maginagle meglkwa i sugl moglsre, taragl i ama nenaiglkwa. Na okna ibo yoba taragl mie nenaiglmedi tekre, kaya mokna kane kane paigwa i yoba nenaiglmedi ere yei teiga. Na taragl i ere yei temere ikra mere na erme ama taragl mudu maginagle wan meglkwa i, ene yoba nenaiglkwa pre teiga. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Ene nenaiglkwa pre teiga ba taragl kane kane bormai wagle kor meglkwa pre ene mie bormai pai moglkwa bogl nekrio. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5-6" />Te, agl bugla mo dua kabu ta ere mogl, yoba ta si goran, yoba taragl i si goraiglkwa. Te, yoba ta ere mogl, yoba ta si goran, yoba ye ama si goraiglkwa. Yoba na moglmere moraiglmedi beke yeiga pre yegl eraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Ana, na ene okna kana di teigra, ene gak mere kide kulo! Mere kide kiglbi, ene yoba mere mogl, ede pi dumo pere pere moraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />God ka yegl didre, ye ama Noa wama bogl di te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />Ene prio! Na nana ene ka kaima di te padrarika. Ka kaima di te padrarika i, ene pre ya ene gawanma okuo moraiglkwa pre panabuka. <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />Ene yoba pre panan, taragl kane kane ene sip yugugl meglkwa igne akie meglkwa i, ye ama pre panabuka. Kua ya agl bugla ya dua kabu kane kane ya taragl kane kane dumo makan mina meglkwa i pre panabuka. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Ana na ka kaima di te padiglka i, yegl diga, okuo nigl kamun podo aglke kor ta yoba ya taragl kane kane mudu si goragledi ukrabuka. Te, makan mudu ere kide eragledi ama ka kaima ta ukrabe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12-13" />God ka yegl di kodidre, ye ama yegl dugwa, Na titokubun kamun kua mina ediga boglkwa. Na ka kaima di te padiglka ikra pre obuno dinabedi ediga boglkwa. Ka i, ene yoba pre ya, te taragl mudu maginagle meglkwa pre aimadi kamin panabuka. <verse eid="GEN 9:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Na okuo kamun kua mina ibo ere edibo, titokubun ama borabuka. <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />Titokubun boran, na ka kaima ene ya taragl kane kane meglkwa i di te padiglka ikra pre moraglka. Pre moglbo, nigl kamun podo ta yoba ya taragl mudu si goragledi ukrabuka. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Titokubun boran, na kandre, ka di te padiglka i pre moraglka. Na taragl kane kane maginagle meglkwa i di te padiglmere mere i aimadi panabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />God ka yegl di kodidre, ye ere mogl, Noa aglke kor yegl di togwa, Titokubun boran, na ka kaima taragl mudu maginagle meglkwa i di te padiglka ikra pre obuno dinabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ham ye nem ere kide ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Ana Noa wam suota sip yugugl mogl ede meda wigwa i we, ye kagno Siem ya Ham ya Jafet we digwa. Ham yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Kenan we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Ana Noa wam suota i we, ye yoba mudu okuo ede bage bage pi, uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, kowano awano meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Ana Noa ere mogl, kogon kor ersre, ede wain ere yaglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Ere yaglsre, mogo bogl yogwa igne, uro nuglo ere i wain edugwa. Edidre, tau ne, spak erukwa. Spak ersre, ye sel yugumo yugugl mogl, kuguglmo gaglmo gugl edidre, yokoko ugl paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Yokoko ugl paugo, Ham, Kenan nem ikra, ede yugugl pi, nem yokoko ugl paugwa kanugwa. Kandre, aglke ede ikne meda u, agigle suo di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Di togo, Siem ya Jafet prisre, kugugl gagl ta idre, kobano wagle padigl i ede pi neno yokoko pai moglmara tebe bi di tebrika. Ye yene mokono te, kan meda kra edidre, i pi tebe bi di tebrika pre neno yokoko paugwa kankribrika. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Ana Noa spakmo dudugo, aduglkwa igne, ye wam okuo ikra erumere digwa prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />Prisre, ye yegl dugwa, Na Kenan di kide yei teiga. Ye gawama mogl atne kaima ede, nem komono suo gawanoma nigl kogono yoba moraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Didre, ye ere mogl, ka yegl dugwa, Yawe, Siem Godmo moglkwa i we, ye sigie kagie wanabuka. Ana Kenan we, ye gawama mogl atne ede, Siem gawama nigl kogono yoba moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Te, Jafet we, God ye gawama makano podo tenabuka. Tenan, Jafet gawama ya Siem gawama akie panaiglkwa. Paibi, Kenan gawama ye nigl kogono yoba moraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Nigl kamun podo sugwa ikra dare ede atne pi kodugo, Noa okuo bugla yugu 350 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Ana Noa bugla yugu moglkwa i swara ede, 950 nedre, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Noa Gawama Kagno Paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Ana nigl kamun podo sugwa ikra dudu kodugwa igne, yagl suota Siem ya Ham ya Jafet ikra ere mogl, yagl gak tau kiglkwa. Ye kagno ya gawanoma kagno magigl i paugwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jafet Gawama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Ana Jafet we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, ye kagno Gomer ya Magok ya Madai ya Javan ya Tubal ya Mesek ya Tiras. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Te, Gomer we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, ye kagno Askenas ya Rifat ya Togarma. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Te, Javan we, ye ama yagl gak suo kuglkwa, ye kagno Elisa ya Tarsis. Te, Javan gawama tau Saiprus yoba meglko, tau Dodan yoba meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Javan gawama ede pere pere pi, yugobuno pere pere i nogugl edigwa. Tau mudi nigl bina meglko, tau dumo kebra nigle suna yemara meglko, erikwa. Ye ede pere pere pi, yugobuno pere pere ikra i nogugl ede moglsre, ye ama dumo makan pere pere ikra kipai moglsre, ka pere pere digwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ham Gawama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Ana Ham we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, ye kagno Kus ya Isip ya Libia ya Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Te, Kus we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, ye kagno Seba ya Havila ya Sapta ya Rama ya Sapteka. Te, Rama we, ye yagl gak suo kuglkwa, ye kagno Seba ya Dedan we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Ana Kus ye yagl gak ta ama kuglkwa, kagie Nimrot we dugwa. Nimrot ere mogl, yobuglo podo ersre, u yoba kade moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Yoba kade moglsre, ye ama taragl are dimede ere sidre, erukwa. Yegl eruko, Yawe pre kan erukwa. Yegl pre okuo yoba yegl ta erikwa i di teigwa, Ene Nimrot taragl are dimede ere sumere singo, Yawe pre kan erume digwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Nimrot yoba kade king moglsre, komono kana taun podo 4-pela sugl moglkwa, Babel ya Erek ya Akat ya Kalne we digwa. Taun 4-pela i, dumo kade Babilonia suna yeigwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11-12" />Ye taun 4-pela i sugl moglsre, okuo ede dumo kade Asiria we dimara pi, dumo kade suna i taun 4-pela ere kegwa. Taun 4-pela i, Ninive ya Rehobotir ya Kala ya Resen we digwa. Dumo Resen i we, Ninive ya taun podo Kala we dimara suna yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Ana Ham wam Isip we, ye gawama tau Lidia yoba meglko, tau Anam yoba meglko, tau Lehap yoba meglko, tau Naptu yoba meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Te, tau Patrus yoba meglko, tau Kaslu yoba meglko, tau Krit yoba meglkwa. Te, Kaslu yoba i we, ye gawama tau Filistia yoba meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Ana Ham wam ta, Kenan we, ye yagl gak komono kuglkwa, kagie Sidon we dugwa. Te, Kenan wam tau gawama i, tau Hit yoba meglko, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />tau Jebus yoba meglko, tau Amor yoba meglko, tau Girgas yoba meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Te, tau Hivi yoba meglko, tau Arka yoba meglko, tau Sini yoba meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Te, tau Arvat yoba meglko, tau Semar yoba meglko, tau Hamat yoba meglkwa. Kenan gawama i, yugobuno pere pere mogl, ede dumo pere pere pi meglko, yoba okuo mudu Kenan yoba we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Ana Kenan yoba makano we, Numa taun Saidon we dimara yedre, yei ede pi taun ta Gerar we dimara Numa edugwa. Gerar i, taun ta Gasa yomara magigl yogwa. Ana Gerar Numa edidre, ede u koglo pi, Numa ikne taun tau Sodom ya Gomora ya Atma ya Seboim we dimara Numa edugwa. Taun 4-pela i, dumo ta Lasa we dimara magigl yeigwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Ana i Ham gawama kagno paugwa. Ye yugobuno pere pere meglmere mere, ka pere pere didre, dumo pere pere pi moglsre, yoba pere pere meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siem Gawama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Ana Noa wam Siem we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa. Siem ye Jafet agigle komono moglsre, Eber yoba kowano awano moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Ye yagl gak kuglkwa, ye kagno Elam ya Asur ya Arpaksat ya Lidia ya Aram. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Te, Aram we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, ye kagno Us ya Hul ya Geter ya Mas. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Te, Arpaksat we, ye yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Sela. Te, Sela we, ye yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Eber. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Te, Eber we, ye yagl gak suo kuglkwa, ye kagno Pelek ya Joktan. Pelek moglkwa igne, yoba maginagle meglkwa ye yubu si, ede dumo pere pere eigwa pre kagie Pelek we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Te, Joktan we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Almodat ya Selep ya Hasarmavet ya Jera <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />ya Hadoram ya Usal ya Dikla <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />ya Obal ya Abimael ya Seba <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />ya Ofir ya Havila ya Jobap. Yagl gak i, mudu Joktan wama meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Ana yagl i makano i we, dumo makan Mesa we dimara yei ede pi dumo makan Sefar we dimara ogwa. Dumo makan Sefar we dimara i, muglo mere paigo, ade umara kra yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Ana i Siem gawama kagno paugwa. Ye yugobuno pere pere meglmere mere, ka pere pere didre, dumo pere pere pi moglsre, yoba pere pere meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Ana i Noa gawama kagno paugwa. Ye yugobuno pere pere ya yoba pere pere meglmere mere kagno paugwa. Nigl kamun podo sugwa ikra dudugwa igne, Noa gawama i ede dumo makan pere pere pi moglsre, yoba pere pere meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Yawe yoba kano ere pere pere edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Okna ibo yoba mudu ka pere pere dikre, ka swara keme digwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Ana ye akie mogl, ede dumo ade umara pi, dumo auduno ta yogwa kanigwa. Dumo i kagie Babilonia we digwa. Dumo i auduno yogwa kandre, ye dumo i kipai meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Ye kipai moglsre, ere mogl yegl digwa, Nono we, nono makan koglwa pere yu, ake dage si, ere brik edinamniwe digwa. Edidre, brik i gigle dinabedi garamniwe digwa. Yegl ersre, ye yugu kobuglo wagle kekre, makan koglwa brik i wagle keigwa. Ye ama brik si dage panabedi ede nuglo yu, ake dage si padigl, keigwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Yoba brik garamniwe didre, ye ama ere mogl, yegl digwa, Nono taun podo ta kenamga. Kemun, taun kenamnara nono ama yugu swara ta kei ede mitna kaima, kamun mina ibo enamga. Yegl oromun, nono kagnono wanan, nono akie mogl, ede dumo bage bage uglo koglo koglo ta pikramniwe di, yegl digwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Tower of Babel" file="FM 036 Tower of Babel_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="11.4" /><verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, yoba taun ya yugu podo keigwa i kanagledi ede atne ugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Udre, ye yegl dugwa, Yoba i we, ye swara moglsre, ka swara keme digwa. Ye mabuno bogl kogon erikwa igne taragl podo yegl erikwa. Ana okuo we, ye siragl taragl eramnedi praiglkwa i, eraiglkwa kuno erabuka. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Ana nono we, nono ede yugu keimara atne pidre, ye kano ere pere pere ede tenamga. Ede tomun, yoba tau ka dibi, tau ye ta prikraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Ana Yawe yegl didre, ye yegl mere ersre, yoba si pere pere edugwa. Si pere pere edugo, ye taun ere keigwa ikra kide kodo, akie moglkre, yoba ede dumo bage bage uglo koglo koglo pi kipai meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Yawe yegl mere yoba kano ere pere pere ede tedre, yoba uglo koglo koglo bage bage moraiglmedi si pere pere edugwa pre dumo i Babel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Babel mabuno paugwa, Si pere pere edugwa.</char></note> we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siem gawama kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Siem ya ye gawama kano paugwa. Siem bugla yugu 100 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Arpaksat we dugwa. Nigl kamun podo sugwa ikra dudugwa igne, ye bugla yugu suo nedre, gak i kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Ye Arpaksat kuglsre, okuo bugla yugu 500 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 500 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak tau ama kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Ana Arpaksat bugla yugu 35 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Sela we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Ye Sela kuglsre, bugla yugu 403 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 403 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak tau ama kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Ana Sela bugla yugu 30 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Eber we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Ye Eber kuglsre, bugla yugu 403 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 403 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak tau ama kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Ana Eber bugla yugu 34 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Pelek we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Ye Pelek kuglsre, bugla yugu 430 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 430 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak tau ama kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Ana Pelek bugla yugu 30 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Reu we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Ye Reu kuglsre, bugla yugu 209 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 209 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak tau ama kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Ana Reu bugla yugu 32 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Seruk we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Ye Seruk kuglsre, bugla yugu 207 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 207 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak tau ama kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Ana Seruk bugla yugu 30 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Nahor we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Ye Nahor kuglsre, bugla yugu 200 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 200 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak tau ama kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Ana Nahor bugla yugu 29 nedre, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Tera we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Ye Tera kuglsre, bugla yugu 119 ta ama mogl tebe edugwa. Bugla yugu 119 mogl tebe edumara suna i, ye yagl gak ya abai gak tau ama kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Ana Tera bugla yugu 70 nedre, okuo yagl gak suota kuglkwa. Ta kagie Abram we didre, ta kagie Nahor we didre, ta kagie Haran we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Tera ya ye gawama kano paugwa. Tera ye yagl gak suota kuglkwa, kagno Abram ya Nahor ya Haran we dugwa. Te, Haran i we, ye yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Lot we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Haran ye agai dumo ta mam ye kuglmara moglsre, nem kor moglkwa igne Haran goglkwa. Dumo i Ur we digwa. Ur i, dumo podo kagie Kaldia we dimara suna yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Ana Abram ya Nahor i we, ye abu ibrika. Abram ebie kagie Sarai we digwa. Te, Nahor ebie kagie Milka we digwa. Nahor ebie Milka i, ye agigle Haran abuglo moglkwa. Te, Haran abuglo ta ama moglkwa, kagie Iska we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Ana Sarai we, ye temne paugwa pre gak ta kuglkrukwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Ana Tera ere mogl, wam Abram ya ebiamo Sarai idre, Haran wam Lot ikra ama idre, ye dumo Ur, dumo kade Kaldia suna yogwa ikra kide kodidre, ede dumo kade ta kantri mere yegl ta yogwa, Kenan we dimara enagledi ogwa. Ye akie dumo Kenan enamnedi eigwa ba ye konbo bage pi taun ta Haran we dimara pidre, kipai meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tera bugla yugu 205 nedre, dumo Haran i mogl, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">God ye Abram ede Kenan enabedi dedugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />
    <figure style="fig" file="Map_Adam ede u Josep_Kuman.jpg" size="span" copy="FMOsoft" ref="12.1" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, Abram yegl di togwa, Ene we, ene dumo kaminen ya yobanma ya ene nen nem agiglema kide kodidre, ede dumo kor ta na poglsi i nogugl ede ene tenaglmara i po. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Ene en, ene gawanma mere kide moglsre, yugobuno pere ta moraiglmedi ere edenaglka. Na yegl ersre, na ama ene ere wakai ere tedre, kagn podo tenaluwa. Kagn podo tebo, ene ere mogl, yoba pere ama ere wakai ere tenatniwa. <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Te, yoba ene ere wakai ere tebi, na ye ere wakai ere tenaluwa. Ba yoba swara ta ene ere kide ere tenan, na ye ere kide ere tenaluwa. Te, yoba yugobuno pere pere moglsre, uglo koglo koglo meglkwa we, na ene mina mudu ere wakai ere tenaluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Leaving Haran" file="hk00036b.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="12.4">Abram yumomugl kide kodidre, ede dumo Kenan ogwa</figure>Ana Abram bugla yugu 75 ne kodugwa igne ye ere mogl, dumo Haran kide kodidre, Yawe dumere ede ogwa. Abram yogo, Lot yogo, akie terke ede ebrika. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Ana Abram ebie Sarai auro idre, agigle wam Lot auro idre, ede ogwa. Te, ye dumo Haran meglkwa igne bonaganano ya aglno buglano ya nigl kogono yoba yuigwa i, pra idre ede dumo makan Kenan we dimara enamnedi eigwa. Pi mogl mogl, okuo pi Kenan plau digwa.<verse eid="GEN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Dumo Kenan ikra plau didre, ye Kenan suna wan pi, dumo kebra ta More we dimara eigwa. Dumo More i, ede ta paugwa, kagie ok we digwa. Te, dumo More i we, taun ta Sekem we dimara magigl yogwa. Ana ye dumo kade Kenan suna wan doko meglkwa igne i Kenan yoba kamun kade kipai meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, Abram moglmara plau didre, ka yegl di togwa, Dumo Kenan i we, na ene gawanma tenaluwe dugwa. Dugo, Abram Yawe na moglmara ume di prisre, kobuglo bogl ta kugl, Yawe tawa tenagledi ere yogwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Altar" file="hk00251b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="12.7" /> <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Ere yedre, ye okuo dumo i kide kodidre, ede pi muglo meglbi ta yomara ogwa. Muglo meglbi i, dumo Betel we digwa, ade umara koglo ibo kra yogwa. Muglo meglbi yomara i pidre, ye sel yugu kipaugwa. Ye kipamara i, dumo Betel ade beimara yogo, dumo ta Ai we dimara ade umara yogwa. Pi kipadre, ye dumo i ama kobuglo bogl ta kugl, Yawe tawa tenagledi ere yogwa. Ere yedre, ye Yawe agle di prisre, kamage ere togwa. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Ana ye okuo dumo i kide kodidre, dumo makan ta Negev we dimara enagledi ede ogwa.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abram ede Isip ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Ana igne i dumo Kenan suna i kidan podo yogwa. Kidan podo yogwa pre Abram ede kantri Isip we dimara ege sugunagle ta moragledi ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Ana ye yobama bogl akie pidre, dumo Isip magigl eigwa igne, Abram ere mogl, ye ebie Sarai yegl di togwa, Ene abu wakai kaima motnga kaniga. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Yegl pre, nono ede Isip omun, Isip yoba ene kandre, ene inamnedi eraiglkwa. Ene inamnedi eribi, ye yagl i ebie moglme didre, na na si goraiglkwa ba ene ta si goglkraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Yegl eraiglkwa pre nono ede Isip omun, ene na abauglo moliwe do. Yegl din, ye ene pre na si goglkre, ere wakai ere naraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Ana Abram ya ye yobama ede Isip eigo, Isip yoba kanigwa, Sarai abu wakai kaima moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Kanigo, Isip king yobamo kade tau ama ye kanigwa. Kandre, ye pi king di teigwa, abu wakai kaima ta umiwe digwa. Didre, ye Sarai agre i ede pi king yugumo edigwa. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Edigo, king i ye Sarai inagledi Abram ere wakai ere togwa. Ye sipsip, kau, donki, ya kamel ya te nigl kogonmo yagl abu i pi Abram togwa.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Isip king yegl erukwa ba Sarai ye Abram ebie moglkwa pre Yawe kide podo tau Isip king ya ye yobama sinabedi dedugwa. Dedugo, kide sigo, <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Isip king ere mogl, Abram wo! dugwa. Dugo, Abram ugo, king yegl dugwa, Siragl eruko, ene mabuno yegl ere natne? Siragl eruko, ene na ebina moglme dikre, <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />na abara moglme dine? Yegl dinga pre na ye ebina morabedi yuiga. Erme we, ene ebin te ikne ediga. Ene agre i ede po! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" /><figure style="fig" alt="Abraham Map" file="Map_Abraham_Kuman.jpg" size="span" copy="FMOsoft" ref="12.20">Abram dumomugl kide kodo, konbauna wan ede omere kwia yogwa</figure>King yegl didre, ye ama yobamo tau di te, Abram agre i ede pi Isip meda edio! dugwa. Dugo, ye Abram agre i ede pi Isip meda edigwa. Ye ebie bogl ya bonaganamo, ya aglmo buglamo ya yobama bogl i pi meda edigwa.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Lot ya Abram ede pere pere ebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Ana Abram yogo, ebie yogo, Lot yogo, ye dumo Isip kide kodidre, ede ikne pi, dumo makan Negev we dimara eigwa. Ye aglno buglano ya te, bonaganano mudu idre ede eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abram agl bugla mere kide kuglsre, silva ya gol mere kide kan nedre, erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Ana ye dumo Negev kide kodidre, bage bage pai ede pi dumo ta okna Betel ya Ai suna kipaimara ikra ede ikne eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />Dumo i, Abram okna kobuglo bogl ta kuglkwa. Ana dumo igle eigo, Abram aglke kor Yawe agle di prisre, kamage ere togwa.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Ana Lot ya Abram akie wan miurka, ba Lot ye ama sipsip ya meme ya kau ki mere kide kuglko, ye yobama ya nigl kogonmo yoba ama mere meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Yegl pre Lot ya Abram dumo makan swara kipabrika kuno erekrukwa. Suo akie taragl mere kide kugl nebrika pre akie miurka i, agl bugla kugl kan nenaiglkwa kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Te, Abram aglmo buglamo sugl meglkwa yoba ye Lot aglmo buglamo sugl meglkwa yoba bogl kigl nonga digwa. Te, igne i Kenan yoba ya Peres yoba ama dumo i kipai meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Yegl paugwa pre Abram ere mogl, Lot yegl di togwa, Nono bormai swara muglka pre kigl nonga ta dikrabuglka. Te, nono aglno buglano sugl meglkwa yoba ama nonga ta dikraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Dumo podo yogwa pre nono yegl erabuglka. Ene ede dumo pere ta en, na ama ede dumo pere ta enaglka. Ene ede ogono wo kra ta en, na ede ogono koda kra enaglka. Te, ene ede ogono koda kra ta en, na ede ogono wo kra enagle di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Abram yegl dugo, Lot kanugwa, nigl Jordan omara ede pi taun ta Soar we dimara i dumo wai wai yedre, dumo mudu kugl togwa yogwa. Dumo i, Yawe dumo wakaile ere yogwa ikra yomere mere yedre, dumo Isip ama yomere mere yogwa. Dumo i, Yawe taun suo Sodom ya Gomora ere kide erekrukwa igne yegl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Yegl yogwa pre Lot ye nigl Jordan omara dumo wai wai yogwa i wakai kandre, Dumo i kipai moragle dugwa. Dumo i ade umara yogwa pre Lot taraglmo ya yobamo idre, ede pi ade umara ogwa. Ogo, Lot ya Abram ede pere pere pi, kipai miurka. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abram dumo Kenan we dimara kipai moglko, Lot dumo wai wai yomara ikra wagle taun tau yeimara dumo bina ta kipai moglsre, okuo ede pi taun i swara ta Sodom we dimara bina sel yugumo kipaugwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Ana yoba Sodom kipaigwa i we, ye yoba kide kaima meglkwa. Ye tadaglme podo kide, Yawe mane dumara erikwa.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abram ede Hebron ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Ana Lot ye Abram moglmara kide kodidre, ede pi kodugwa igne, Yawe ere mogl, Abram yegl di togwa, Ene we, ene igle mogl, kan ade umara kra ede, beimara kra ede, nigl bre kra ede, nigl beye kra ede, ero! <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Ene dumo makan mudu kanga i we, na ene ya ene gawanma mudu tenaglka. Tebo, ene makano aimadi kamun yenabuka. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Te, na ama ene gawanma pi kaugl mere yegl, mere kide moraiglmedi ere edenaglka. Ere edibo, meglbi, yoba ene gawanma kerenaiglkwa kuno erekrabuka. Pi kaugl kerenaiglkwa kuno erekrabere yegl mere kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Ana erme we, na agai dumo koglo koglo yogwa ene tenaglka pre ene ade umara kra ya beimara kra pidre, nigl bre ya nigl beye kra pidre, dumo mudu kano! di, Yawe yegl di togwa.<verse eid="GEN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Yawe ka yegl di kodugo, Abram ere mogl, sel yugumo terke i ede pi dumo ta Hebron we dimara pidre, kipaugwa. Ye kipamara, ede ok tau paigwa, yagl ta kagie Mamre we digwa edemo paigwa. Abram kipadre, kobuglo bogl ta kugl, Yawe tawa tenagledi ere yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">King kuda podo beglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1-9" />Ana igne i, king 5-pela ta nigl Jordan umara meglkwa. King ta kagie Bera, ye dumo Sodom sugl moglko, te king ta kagie Birsa, ye dumo Gomora sugl moglko, king ta kagie Sinap ye dumo Atma sugl moglko, te king ta kagie Semeber ye dumo Seboim sugl moglkwa. Te, king ta ama dumo Bela sugl moglkwa. Dumo Bela i, erme Soar we dumga. Ana king 5-pela i, king swara ta ade umara kra moglkwa i, bitno moglko, ye king i moglmara atne kra meglkwa. King ta ye bitno moglkwa i, kagie Kedorlaomer we digo, ye kantri Elam sugl moglkwa. Ana king 5-pela nigl Jordan umara i ere mogl, bugla yugu 12-pela mere yegl, king Kedorlaomer ye bitno moglkwa ikra taks teigwa. Taks te ede pi bugla yugu 13 mina ye mogl pere ede, Kedorlaomer moglmara atne kra moglkramnedi taks tekrikwa. Taks tekrikwa pre bugla yugu namba 14 we, Kedorlaomer ere mogl, king suota ade umara kra akie meglkwa i amino bogl di makai sidre, kuda bogl, king 5-pela i tenagledi erukwa. King suota i, ta kagie Amrafel, ye kantri Babilonia sugl moglko, king ta kagie Ariok, ye kantri Elasar sugl moglko, te king ta kagie Tidal, ye Goim yoba kingno moglkwa. King suota i amino bogl wigo, Kedorlaomer bogl u swara pi mogl, king 5-pela nigl Jordan umara meglkwa i kuda bogl tenamnedi wigwa. Ye u yoba pere pere dumo suna mogl wigwa i kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo ere wigwa. Ye Refaim yoba dumo Asterot Karnaim we dimara meglkwa i kuda bogl tedre, Sus yoba dumo Ham we dimara meglkwa i kuda bogl tedre, Em yoba dumo Save Kiriataim we dimara meglkwa i kuda bogl teigwa. Yoba i kuda bogl tedre, ye ama Hor yoba we digwa, ye kamun muglo nem ta meglkwa, ye dumo makan Seir we dimara suna meglkwa i kuda bogl tedre, ye sika si ede pi dumo Elparan we dimara eigwa. Dumo Elparan i, dumo wau yomara bina yogwa. Ye yegl ersre, ede ikne u, dumo ta Enmispat we dimara wigwa. Dumo Enmispat i, erme Kades we dumga. Enmispat udre, ye Amalek yoba dumo tau meglmara i mudu kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erikwa. Ersre, Amor yoba dumo Hasason Tamar meglkwa i ama kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erikwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 14:1-9">King 4-pela ikra yoba pere pere kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo ere wigo, king 5-pela nigl Jordan umara kipai meglkwa i, ye King 4-pela amino bogl i kuda bogl norarimedi prisre, amino bogl u, dumo auduno ta yogwa kagie Sidim we dimara kuda bogl tenamnedi makai sigwa. Dumo Sidim auduno yogwa i, erme mudi nigl Detsi we dumga i ake wai dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 14:1-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Dumo Sidim i, nigl nubun mere yegl bage bage meglkwa. Meglkwa ba atne i, nigl yoko moglkrukwa. Nigl kama ta ede nuglo mere yegl moglkwa, kolta we digwa. King 4-pela i ya king 5-pela i amino bogl kuda beglko, king 4-pela amino yobuglo eriko, Sodom yoba ya Gomora yoba kingno bogl teke eigwa. Teke eigo, tau nigl kama i moglmara yage atne si, ede nigl kama i mina atne eigo, tau teke ede pi muglo paimara eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Eigo, king 4-pela ikra amino bogl kaya mokna ya taragl mudu dumo Sodom ya Gomora yogwa idre, ede eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Ye ama Abram agigle wam Lot taraglmo bogl i ede eigwa. Lot okna kana u, Sodom suna kipaugwa pre yegl erikwa.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Ana Abram ye yagl Mamre edemo ok paimara kipaugwa. Mamre ye Amor yoba ta moglkwa, agigle suo ama miurka, kagno, Eskol ya Aner. Yagl suota i ye Abram bogl okna ka di padiglkwa, Nono munara kuda ta panan, nono nono ake ple di kuda eramne di, ka yegl di padiglkwa. Ana yagl ta kuda king wagle beglkwa ikra teke ogwa u, kuda siragl mere paugwa ye Hibru yagl Abram ikra di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Di tedre, ye ama Kuda ikne yobuglo ere u, ene agitn wam Lot si kane sidre, i ede eimiwe di, Abram yegl di togwa. Abram prisre, ye nigl kogonmo yagl tau okna kuda boraiglmedi obuno di togwa i, i makai sidre, ye ede okna pi, king 4-pela ikra sika si ogwa. Ogo, ye nigl kogonmo yagl i akie eigwa. Ye sika si ede pi dumo Dan we dimara eigwa. Nigl kogonmo yagl i, 318-pela meglkwa. Ye mudu mano kugl yogwa igne ede u kade meglkwa igne, Abram nigl kogonmo yoba meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Dumo Dan pi, kuda ikne meglmara magigl eigo, Abram nigl kogonmo yagl yubu si, bage suo edugwa. Edugo, ye eduer king 4-pela ikra amino bogl kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erikwa. Yobuglo ersre, kuda ikne sika si ede pi dumo ta Hoba we dimara eigwa. Dumo Hoba i, Dumo Damaskus we dimara nigl bre kra yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Sika si pidre, ye Abram agigle wam Lot taraglmo bogl ya abu ya yoba tau si kane sigwa i ya taragl mudu king 4-pela i ede eigwa ikra mudu idre, ede ikne wigwa.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melkisedek ye Abram di wakai yei togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Ana Abram ye king Kedorlaomer ya king tau amino bogl akie meglkwa i kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo ersre, ede ikne ugwa. Ede ikne u moglko, Sodom king ikra ye Abram tegigl yenabugledi dumo auduno ta yogwa Save we dimara ogwa. Dumo Save i, erme King Dumo Auduno we dumga. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Sodom king Abram tegigl yenabugledi ogo, dumo ta Salem king ama bret ya wain nuglo Abram tenagledi i ede ogwa. Salem king i, kagie Melkisedek we digwa. Ye dumo i king moglsre, ye ama yoba tawa tenamnedi erikwa i idre, ye tawa God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa togwa yoba moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Ye Abram tegigl yedre, ogo ake mina ede, Abram yegl di wakai yei togwa, God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa, ye kamun ibo nem moglsre, makan atne nem moglkwa. Ye ene ere wakai ere tenabiwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa i, ye ene ake ple di togo, ene kuda ikne kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo etnga. Ye sigie kagie wanabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Abram ere mogl, bonagana mudu ye king 4-pela kuda bogl tedre, ikne edugwa i, yubu si bage 10-pela edidre, bage swara ta Melkisedek togwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Abram ye bonagana bage swara ta ikra Melkisedek togo, Sodom king ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Yoba si kane sigwa ene yunga i, narsre, enene bonagana inatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:21" /><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22-23" />Dugo, Abram di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na Yawe, God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa, kamun mina ibo ya makan atne nem moglkwa i, ka giglede di te, taragl swara ta ikragle diga. Na ene taraglnen, kan kebra mo yoba kaglno towo kan mo taragl kebra yegl mere swara ta ikraglka. Ikribo, ene Abram na taraglnana idre, taragl mere kan nome di, yegl ta dikratnga. <verse eid="GEN 14:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Ana na niglna kogona kumugl kaya mokna ta i teiga, ne kodigwa i, pra iga. Na taragl pere ta ikraglka. Ta ikraglka ba yagl suota Aner ya Eskol ya Mamre akie pi kuda bogl tomga pre ye taragl tau yubu si to! dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">God ye Abraham ka kaima di te paduglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Ana okuo Abram kor moglko, ye ogumuglomugl eruko, Yawe ka ta dugo, prukwa. Yawe yegl dugwa, Abram yo, ene kudugl goglkro! Na awaglenen mere yegl moglsre, ene kugl bogl te moglka. Te moglsre, na ama ene kana duglo boglnga pre ere wakai ere tenaluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2-3" />Dugo, Abram di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade Yawe yo, ene siragl mere ere wakai ere naratne? Na gak ta natngo, kuglkrika. Yegl pre na goglbo, na nigl kogona yagl ta Elieser we digwa, taun Damaskus nem moglkwa i, ye taraglnana idre, againa inabuka pamiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 15:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Abram yegl dugo, Yawe aglke kor ka ta Abram di te, yegl dugwa, Ene nigl kogonen yagl i, taraglnen ya againen ta ikrabuka. Enene gak ta kuratnga. Yegl pre ene gogln, ene wan ye taraglnen idre, againen inabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Didre, ye Abram auro i pi meda edidre, yegl dugwa, Ene kan kamun mitna ibo edo. Kugl kuri kerenatnga kuno erabo? Keranatnga kuno erekrabere yoba ene gawanma kerenaiglkwa ama kuno erekrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" /><figure style="fig" alt="Abraham counting stars" file="FM 042 Abram Counting the Stars_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="15.6" />Dugo, Abram ye Yawe pre meduglkwa. Pre meduglko, Yawe ye Abram pre meduglkwa kandre, yoba du kaima moglmedi kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Kandre, yegl dugwa, Na Yawe moglka. Ene taun Ur, dumo Kaldia suna yogwa motnga igne, na ene auro i ede u dumo Kenan, magigl i makan ene tenagledi ediga. Ene dumo Kenan inatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Dugo, Abram di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade Yawe yo, ene siragl mere etn, na kandre, dumo makan magigl i ka kaima na inaglka pamedi pragle? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Abram yegl di prukwa pre Yawe ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Ene ede pi kau abai ta bugla yugu suota moglkwa idre, meme abai ta bugla yugu suota moglkwa idre, sipsip kumugl ta bugla yugu suota moglkwa ama idre, yuo! Te, kua yumugl kruo ta idre, kua yumugl gagigle ta idre, yuo! dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Ana Abram taragl i mudu yu Yawe moglmara edidre, si goglkwa. Kau ya meme ya sipsip ikra suna wom si paka didre, koglo bage ta epigl sidre, koglo bage ta epigl sidre, erukwa. Ersre, kua suo i, si paka dikre, ta koglo yei, ta koglo yei, erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Taragl i epigl sugo, kua kigla tau mie nenamnedi pru di ede atne u, akigwa ba Abram si pi eglke edugwa.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Ana min paugwa, ade beinagledi eruko, Abram ugl du paugwa. Ugl du paugo, ogumuglomugl eruko, mim podo erukwa kanugwa. Kandre, ye kudugl podo goglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Kudugl podo goglko, Yawe ye Abram yegl di togwa, Na ka ta di tebo, ene pre pogl sinatnga. Ene gawanma okuo ede kantri ta yoba pere makano yenabara pi moraiglkwa. Meglbi, makan nem ene gawanma ye nigl kogono yoba moraiglmedi si kane sidre, mabuno kide ere tedre, bugla yugu 400 mabuno yegl mere eraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Yegl eribi, ene gawanma ye makan nem nigl kogono ere tenaiglkwa. Yegl eraiglkwa ba na ere mogl, makan nem ye yubun podo tebo, ene gawanma bonagana mere idre, dumo i kide kodidre, ede enaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Ba ene we, ene moratnara kiede mogl, kanana moratnga. Moglsre, ene kidagl yei, gogln, yoba ene maugl sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Te, ene gawanma ede kantri pere ta enaiglkwa i, tabre ta ede ikne ukraiglkwa. Ye pi meglbi, ene gawanma i, ye gawanoma okuo yugobuno namba 4 mina moraiglkwa i, ede ikne unaiglkwa. Amor yoba magigl meglkwa i, ye mabunono kide u podo pikrukwa. Ye mabunonono kide u podo enan, ene gawanma ede ikne u, makanono inaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Ana ade beigo, mim podo erukwa. Mim podo eruko, Abram taragl suo kanugwa. Ta makan koglwa sin yogwa. Sin mina atne doga dogo, ede inge ede kuglo ogwa. Te, taragl ta kanugwa i, ken ta gaiglkwa, dogo, kanugwa. Taragl suo i, Abram taragl tau si gogl, epigl yomara suna ebriko, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Ana igne i Yawe ye Abram ka kaima di te padigl, yegl dugwa, Na makan magigl i mudu ene gawanma tenagledi kaur si kodiga. Gabano numa ikne nigl kebra Isip bina omara i panan, numa ikne nigl podo Yufretis we dimara panabuka. <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Ene gawanma Kin yoba makano ya Kenas yoba makano ya Katmon yoba makano inaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Te, Hit yoba makano ya Peres yoba makano ya Refaim yoba makano inaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Te, Amor yoba makano ya Kenan yoba makano ya Girgas yoba makano ya Jebus yoba makano inaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Abraham ye Hagar yugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Ana Abram ebie Sarai ye gak ta kuglkrukwa, ba ye nigl kogonmo abai ta moglkwa, kagie Hagar we digwa. Hagar ye dumo Isip mam moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2-3" />Ana Abram ya Sarai bugla yugu 10-pela dumo makan kade Kenan suna i miurko, Sarai ye gak ta kuglkrukwa. Yegl pre ye ere mogl, wie Abram yegl di togwa, Ene pro. Yawe na temne panatnedi erukwa pre gak ta kuglkrika. Yegl pre ene na nigl kogona abai moglkwa i inatnga. In, bogl swara pabr, ye gak ta kuran, gak i nana inagle di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Abram ye kamo prisre, pra we dugwa. Pra we dugo, ye ebie Sarai ere mogl, nigl kogonmo abai Hagar, Isip mam ikra idre, Abram ebie ta morabedi togwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Togo, Abram ya Hagar bogl swara pabriko, Hagar dane paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:4">Hagar dane paugo, ye na dana pamedi kandre, yene mogl mitna ede, abu ye sugl moglkwa i kamo prikrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Kamo prikruko, Sarai ere mogl, Abram yegl di togwa, Hagar mabuno kide ere narukwa i, ene mabuno motnga. Nana nigl kogona abai idre, ene ebin morabedi teiga ba ye na dana pamedi kandre, yene mogl mitna ede, na kana prikrukwa. Na aglau erio mo ene aglau etno mo i pre Yawe pre yubu sinabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Dugo, Abram di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Abu i, enene nigl kogonen abu moglkwa. Ene siragl mere eragledi pratnga i, ero! dugwa. Dugo, Sarai ye mabuno kide ere togo, Hagar teke ede ogwa.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Hagar teke ede pi dumo ta Sur we dimara enagledi konbauna ogwa. Ye konbauna pi, dumo ta wau yomara pidre, nigl ta ogo beimara moglkwa. Moglko, Yawe Angelomo ye moglmara ugwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Ye moglmara udre, ye yegl dugwa, Hagar yo, ene Sarai nigl kogonmo abu motnga. Ene aglo mogl unga ya te, aglo ena unga i, di naro! dugwa. Dugo, Hagar di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na sugl moglkwa abu Sarai, moglmara kide kodidre, teke wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Dugo, Yawe Angelomo ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Ene ede ikne pi, ene sugl moglkwa abu moglmara moglsre, kamo duglo boglo! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Yegl didre, ye ama dugwa, Na ene gawanma mere kide moraiglmedi ere edenaglka. Mere kide meglbi, yoba ye kerenaiglkwa kuno erekrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Te, ye ama dugwa, Ene pro! Ene erme dan paugwa. Gak ta kuratnga i, yagl gak ta kuratnga. Kugln, ye kagie Ismael<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Ismael mabuno ta paugwa, prukwa mere paugwa.</char></note> yei tenatnga. Ene yubun podo idre, kai etnga i, Yawe prukwa. Yegl pre gak kagie yegl yei tenatnga. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Ye donki are mere yegl, yobuglo ersre, yoba pere kano prikre, yegl mere morabuka. Yegl moran, ye yoba mudu kuda bogl tenan, yoba i ama ye kuda bogl tenaiglkwa. Ye yoba bormai swara meglkwa ama mudu kuda bogl tenabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Ana Hagar ere mogl, yegl dugwa, God nana kan moglkwa. Na ama ka kaima ye kaniga pamiwe dugwa. Didre, ye ama Yawe kagie kor ta yei togwa. Kagie God na Kan Motnga yegl yei togwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ye yegl dugwa pre yoba okuo ere mogl, nigl ogo beigwa i, Bir Lahai Roi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, nigl kagie Bir Lahai Roi, i mabuno God na Kanugwa Niglmo mere yegl paugwa.</char></note> we digwa. Nigl i, dumo Kades we dimara ya Beret we dimara suna moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Ana Hagar ede ikne ogo, ye Abram bogl yagl gak ta kiurka. Kiurko, Abram ere mogl, kagie Ismael we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Abram bugla yugu 86 ne kodugwa igne, Hagar ye yagl gak Ismael kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">God ye Abram kagie kor yei togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Ana Abram bugla yugu 99 ne kodugwa igne, Yawe ye moglmara plau didre, ka yegl di togwa, Na God Yobuglna Podo Paugwa moliwa. Na kana duglo boglsre, mabuno na wakai kaniga i ero! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Ana na we, na ka kaima okna di te padiglmere ikra eraglka. Na ene gawanma mere kide moraiglme dimere ikra ere edenagle di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />God yegl dugo, Abram yage kobragai padre, guma dra i pi makan mina paduglkwa. Yegl eruko, God ye ka di te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />Na we, na ka kaima ta ene di te padiliwa. Ene gawanma ede bage bage pi, yugobuno pere pere mere kide moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Te, ene kagn we, yoba Abram we digwa ba kagn i kide kodidre, kagn Abraham<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Abram mabuno paugwa, yoba neno moglsre, yagl podo moglkwa. Te, kagie kor Abraham mabuno paugwa, yoba mere kide neno moglkwa.</char></note> we dinaiglkwa. Na ene gawanma mere kide moglsre, yugobuno pere pere moraiglmedi ere edenaglka pre kagn kor Abraham we dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Na ene gawanma mere kide moraiglmedi ere edibo, ye yugobuno pere pere moraiglkwa. Meglbi, ene gawanma tau ama yoba kade king moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Na ka kaima di te padiglka i, ene pre panan, ene gawanma okuo moraiglkwa pre ama aimadi panabuka. Na ene Godnen moglsre, ene gawanma okuo moraiglkwa ama Godno moraglka. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Na ene gawanma Godno moglbo, na ama dumo Kenan magigl i etne suna wan motnga i, ene ya ene gawanma mudu tenaglka. Erme makan i, yoba pere makano yogwa ba mudu ene gawanma bogl makanono aimadi yenabuka pre tenagle di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">God Nagno puduo gagie bolo! dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Te, God ere mogl, ka ta ama Abraham di togwa, Na ka ta ama di te padiglbo, ene ka i duglo boratnga. Ene duglo bogln, ene gawanma okuo aimadi duglo boraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Na kana ene ya ene gawanma okuo moraiglkwa duglo boraiglkwa i, yegl diga, ene yagl mudu gagno puduo gagie boraiglkwa. Yagl gak kebra ya te, yagl kade ya te, yagl kidagl pra, mudu gagno puduo gagie boraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Ene gagno puduo gagie beglbi, ene praiglkwa, God ka kaima di noro paduglkwa ikra nono pre pamedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12-13" />Yagl gak mudu ene gawanma okuo kuraiglkwa i, ade 8-pela meglbi, ene gagno puduo gagie boraiglkwa. Ene gawanma pre ya te, ene nigl kogono yoba tau yagl gak kuraiglkwa ya te, yoba yugobuno pere nigl kogono yoba topo boramnedi yuibi, ene topo sinaiglkwa i, pra akie pre diga. Ene yegl eribi, ene gagno wagle kandre, yegl praiglkwa, God ka kaima di noro paduglkwa i, nono pre aimadi panabedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Ba yagl ta moran, gagie puduo gagie ta boglkran, yagl i na ka di te padiglka i, duglo boglkrukwa pre ye ene meglmara si pi eglke edibi, ye pere morabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Te, God ama ere mogl, ka yegl dugwa, Ana ene ebin kidagl Sarai we, ene erme kagie Sarai i kide kodidre, kagie Sara we dinatnga. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Na ye ere wakai ere tebo, ye ene wan kurabuka. Te, na ye ere wakai ere tebo, ye gawama ede bage bage pi, yugobuno pere pere moraiglkwa. Yugobuno pere pere meglbi, ye gawama tau yoba king moraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />God yegl dugo, Abraham aglke kor yage kobragai padre, guma dra i pi makan mina paduglkwa. Yegl erukwa ba ye gaugl sim ersre, yegl kina gudu prukwa, Na bugla yugu 100 nenaglka igne na ka kaima gak ta kuraglo? Te, Sara bugla yugu 90 ne kodugwa. Ye ama ka kaima gak ta kurabo mo, yegl kina gudu prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Abraham yegl kina gudu prisre, ye ere mogl, God yegl di prukwa, Ene na wana Ismael sugl moglsre, ere wakai ere tenatnba, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Yegl dugo, God di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene kaima dinga ba ene ebin kidagl Sara ene wan ta kurabuka. Ye kuran, ene kagie Aisak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Aisak mabuno paugwa, gaugl erukwa.</char></note> we dinatnga. Na ka kaima di te padiglka ikra, yagl gak i ya ye gawama okuo moraiglkwa i pre aimadi panabuka. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Te, Ismael we, ene dinga prika. Na ye ere wakai ere tebo, ye gawama mere kide moraiglkwa. Mere kide meglbi, ye yugobono pere ta moraiglkwa. Te, Ismael yagl gak 12-pela kurabuka. Yagl gak wagle i yagl kade moglsre, yugobuno pere pere sugl moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Ismael yegl mere ere wakai ere tenaglka ba na ka kaima okna di te padiglka ikra, Aisak pre panabuka. Sara erme bugla yugu swara mere moglsre, yagl gak i kurabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />God ka yegl di kodidre, ye ede ogwa.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Ana God ka yegl dugwa ade swara i mina Abraham ye God kamo duglo boglsre, ye wam Ismael ya te, ye nigl kogonmo yoba yagl gak kiglkwa ya te, ye nigl kogonmo yagl ye topo sugwa, yoba yagl mudu i makai sidre, gagno puduo gagie bogl togwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Ana Abraham gagie puduo gagie beglkwa igne, ye bugla yugu 99 ne kodugwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Te, ye Ismael gagie puduo gagie bogl togwa igne, Ismael bugla yugu 13 ne kodugwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Ade swara i, yoba Abraham gagie puduo gagie bogl teigo, Abraham ama ere mogl, wam Ismael gagie puduo gagie bogl tedre, <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />nigl kogonmo yoba yagl gak kiglkwa ikra ya nigl kogonmo yagl yoba yugobuno pere topo bogl neigo, ye topo sugwa ikra, yoba yagl mudu gagno puduo gagie bogl togwa.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">God Abraham di te, Sara yagl gak ta kurabe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Ana Abraham ye yagl Mamre edemo paimara ikra kipai moglkwa. Edemo i, kagie ok we digwa. Abraham kipai moglsre, ye ege swara ta ermine, ade podo dogo, sel yugu kipamara yugu dramugl ame di moglkwa. Ame di moglko, Yawe ye moglmara u plau dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Abraham yugu dramugl ame di moglko, yagl suota iro meglko, Abraham kan iro ede yagl suota i kanugwa. Kandre, ye muglkude pi, yagl i meglmara ogwa. Pidre, ye goglko bodugl, bre magide, guma dra makan mina edidre, <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />ye yagl swara ta yegl di togwa, Yagl kade yo, na ene nigl kogonen yoba mere yegl moglka. Ene wakai pitn, na yugunamugl kuri ta akie moramga. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Na nigl kogon yoba ta dedibo, ye nigl kogl yunan, ene kaglno nigl koraiglkwa. Kaglno nigl koglsre, ede mabunomugl bi yomara ame di moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Na bret kuri ta yuibo, ene nebi, aragan erabuka. Nebi, aragan eran, ene ede enaiglmiwa. Na ene nigl kogono yagl moglko, ene na yugunamugl wigwa pre na yegl ere tenagledi priwe dugwa. Ye yegl dugo, yagl suota di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ana prawa, ene dinere mere yegl ero! digwa.<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Ana Abraham muglkude pi, Sara sel yugu yugugl moglmara pidre, yegl di togwa, Ene tabre flaua wakai 20 kg mere yegl idre, nokidre, bret gaglo! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Abraham yegl didre, ye muku di pi ye kau kuglkwa meglmara ogwa. Kau kuglkwa meglmara pidre, ye kau nagigle wakai, mie wam gigle dikrabuka mere yegl ta moglkwa idre, nigl kogonmo yoba ta togwa. Togo, nigl kogonmo yoba i tabre si kegwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Si kego, dogwa igne, Abram mie wam idre, kau ame nuglo duku igwa ya sis kau ame nuglo mina bekigwa idre, yagl suota i nenaiglmedi yubu si togwa. Yubu si togo, ne meglko, Abraham ye meglmara i adigl moglsre, sugl moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Ana yagl suota ikra ere mogl, Abraham yegl di prikwa, Ene ebin kidagl Sara aglo moglme? digwa. Digo, ye di ikne ede, Magigl i, sel yugu yugugl moglme dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Yegl dugo, Yawe ye yegl di togwa, Na we, na bugla yugu swara ta mogl, aglke ede ikne unaglka. Sara komono kana wam ta kurabuka. Wam ta kuran, na unagle dugwa. Yegl dugo, Sara ye mokonomugl, sel yugu dua yomara yugugl moglsre, ka dugwa pre moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11-12" />Ka dugwa prisre, ye gaugl sim erukwa. Abraham ya Sara, suo akie kidagl kaima miurko, Sara gak kurabuka igne dudugwa. Yegl pre Sara gaugl sim ersre, yegl kina gudu prukwa, Na kidagl yeigo, na yagl kadena Abraham ama kidagl yogo, erukwa. Yegl pre na gak ta kuglsre, gun yenaglka kuno erabo? yegl kina gudu prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:11-12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" /><figure style="fig" alt="Sarah overhears the Lord" file="FM 043_Sarah Overhears the Lord_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="18.13">Angelo ka dugo, Sara gaugl erukwa</figure>Yegl kina gudu pruko, Yawe ere mogl, Abraham di prukwa, Sara siragl pre gaugl sim ersre, Na kidagl yeiga gak ta kuraglka kuno erabo di kina gudume? <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Na Yawe moliwa. Na siragl ta eragledi praglka i siragl mere kuno erekrabe? Na bugla yugu swara ta mogl, aglke ede ikne unagle diga ikra we, Sara wam ta kuran, unaluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Yegl dugo, Sara kudugl goglsre, Na ta gaugl erekrie dugo, Yawe dugwa, Ta manugwa. Ene kaima gaugl etne dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">God dumo Sodom ere kide eragle dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Ana yagl suota ikra adiglsre, ede eigo, Abraham agre i ede pi konbauna bage edenagledi auro yogwa. Ye akie pidre, konbauna bage ta kuglo ibo mogl, kan atne taun Sodom yomara edigwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Edigo, Yawe ere mogl, yagl suo i yegl di togwa, Na kuri ta mogl, taragl swara ta eraglka i, teke padiglkre, Abraham di nogugl ede tenaglka paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18-19" />Abraham gawama mere kide moglsre, yoba giglede ta moraiglkwa. Te, na Abraham mina yoba yugobuno pere pere uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ere wakai ere tenaglka. Te, na Abraham kere iga i, ye gagiglma ya gawama okuo moraiglkwa di tenan, na kana duglo boglsre, mabuno wakai ya mabuno du keme eraiglkwa pre kere iga. Di tenan, ye yegl eribi, na Abraham ere wakai ere tenagle diga ikra ye gawama i ere tenaglka. Abraham yegl pre kere iga pre na kuri ta mogl, taragl swara ta eraglka i, Abraham di nodugl ede tenaglka pamiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 18:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Yawe ka yegl di kodidre, ye ama yegl dugwa, Sodom yoba ya Gomora yoba kide kaima moglsre, tadaglme podo kaima erime digwa prika. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Yegl pre na ede atne, taun suo i yomara pidre, mabuno erikwa kanaglka. Ka kaima tadaglme podo erime dimere erimo mo erekrimo mo yegl pre pi kanagle dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Yawe yegl dugo, yagl suo i ede Sodom enabugledi ede ebriko, Yawe ya Abraham pai miurka. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Pai miurko, Abraham ye Yawe moglmara magigl pidre, yegl dugwa, Ene yoba mabuno kide erikwa si goglsre, yoba mabuno wakai erikwa i ama si goglsre, ka kaima yegl eratno? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Yoba mabuno wakai erikwa 50-pela dumo Sodom suna ta meglbi, ene ka kaima yoba 50-pela i pre dumo kanige erekre, ere kide ere kodinatno? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Yegl ta erekratnga. Ene yoba mabuno wakai erikwa ya yoba mabuno kide erikwa i swara ede, mudu si goratnga kuno erekrabuka. Yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa Jasno motnga pre mabuno du keme ere tenatnga pamiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Abraham yegl dugo, Yawe di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba mabuno wakai erikwa 50-pela ta Sodom suna kipai meglbi, kanibo, yoba i pre dumo kanige ersre, yoba ta si goglkragle dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Ana Abraham ere mogl, aglke kor dugwa, Ene Yagl Kade motnga, na yoba yoko moliwa. Na ka ta dikraglka paugwa ba na ka sugunagle ta dinaglka. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Na yoba 50-pela pre diga ikra we, yoba 45 keme ta meglkwa panan, yoba 5-pela moglkrikwa i pre yoba mudu si goratno? dugwa. Dugo, Yawe aglke kor di ikne edugwa, Yoba mabuno wakai erikwa 45 ta meglkwa panan, na yoba mudu ta si goglkragle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Dugo, Abraham ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ana 40-pela ta meglkwa panan we? dugo, Yawe 40-pela ta meglkwa panan, na yoba 40-pela i pre dumo kanige eresre, yoba mudu ta si goglkragle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Yegl dugo, Abraham aglke kor dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na ka ta dibo, kubrokro. Yoba 30-pela keme ta meglkwa panan we? dugo, Yawe di ikne edugwa, 30-pela ta meglkwa panan, na ta si goglkragle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Dugo, Abraham aglke kor dugwa, Aya, ene Yagl Kade motnga pre na ka ta dikraglka mere paugwa ba na diga. Yoba 20-pela keme ta meglkwa panan i we? dugo, Yawe aglke kor dugwa, 20-pela ta meglkwa panan, na yoba 20-pela i pre dumo kanige ersre, yoba mudu ta si goglkragle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Yegl dugo, Abraham aglke kor dugwa, Na ka swara keme ta ama di praglka. Ene kubrokro. Yoba 10-pela keme ta meglkwa panan we? dugo, Yawe di ikne ede yegl dugwa, 10-pela ta meglkwa panan, na yoba 10-pela i pre dumo kanige ersre, yoba mudu ta si goglkragle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Yawe ka yegl Abraham di te kodidre, ye ede ogwa. Ogo, Abraham ede ikne yugomugl ugwa.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Sodom yoba mabuno kide erikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Ana angelo suo ikra ede Sodom enabugledi pi miurka min paugwa igne, Sodom plau dibrika. Plau dibriko, Lot ye taun yomara kobuglo togl ere winabo dimara dua yomara ame di moglsre, angelo suo i ubrika kanugwa. Kandre, ye adigl, ede pi angelo suo ubrara pidre, goglko bodugl, bre magide, guma dra gaba mina edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Edidre, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade suo, na ene nigl kogono yoba mere yegl moluwa. Ene na kipaimara udre, kaglno nigl koglsre, ugl panabrika. Ugl padre, tagna kana adigl ede enabriwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, yegl dibrika, Yegl kodo, no yoba makai simara meda panabugle dibrika. <verse eid="GEN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Yegl dibrika ba Lot ka giglede dugwa pre ye akie ede Lot kipaimara yugugl eigwa. Akie eigo, Lot ye bret tau yis edekre gagl togwa. Gagl tedre, kaya mokna podo tau ama akie gagl tedre, eruko, ye neigwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Lot ya angelo i ye kaya mokna ne kodidre, ugl paikrikwa igne, Sodom yagl mudu u, Lot yugumo yobugl winabo di i suna edigwa. Sodom yagl i, kidagl ya kulu ya kumugl gak mudu koglo koglo meglkwa i wigwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Lot yugumo yobugl winabo di i suna edidre, ye agle di, Lot di prikwa, Yagl suo ene kipanara panabugledi ubrika i, aglo miure? digwa. Ene ye agre i meda edin, no ye gu dinamniwe digwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Yegl digwa ba Lot yene ede meda udre, dua yoguglsre, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />yegl dugwa, Na ninama agrama wagle, mabuno kide yegl ta erekrio! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Ene prio! Na abra suo miurka ye yagl bogl ta paikribrika. Na abra suo i agre yu meda edibo, ene ta eramnedi praiglkwa i, eraiglkwa. Ba yagl suo i na kipaimara ubrika pre na kugl bogl tenaglka paugwa. Yegl pre ene mabuno kide ta ye ere tekraiglmiwe! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Yegl dugwa ba Sodom yagl mudu ere mogl, Lot di te, Agai noro! digwa. Yegl didre, yene di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl i, dumo pere nem moglkwa ba ye erme jasno mere yegl moglsre, mabuno siragl mere ta eramga i di norume digwa. Yegl didre, ye aglke kor Lot di te, Erme we, no yagl suo i ere kide ere tedre, ene ama akie ere kide kaima ere tenamniwe digwa. Yegl didre, ye Lot ake nu si yu, dua yomara udre, dua sada boramnedi erikwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Sodom yoba yegl erikwa ba yagl suo ikra dua yauro, Lot ake gudu yugugl edidre, dua yogiurka. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Dua yogiglsre, ye ama Sodom yagl mudu dua wagle meglkwa i, gumuglno kin yenaiglmedi eribrika. Eribriko, kumugl ede pi yagl kidagl pra, mudu gumuglno kin yeigwa pre ye yugu dua dokigwa, kankrikwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lot dumo Sodom kide kodugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12-13" />Ana yagl suo ere mogl, Lot yegl di tebrika, No we, no dumo magigl i ere kide ersre, yoba mudu si gorabuglka. Yoba magigl i mabuno kide kaima erikwa Yawe pre kan erukwa. Pre kan ersre, ye no ere kide erabredi dedugo, ubuglka. No dumo ere kide ersre, yoba mudu si gorabuglka. Yegl pre ene yobanma ta Sodom suna i meglmo? Ene wan mo abutn mo abutn wie mo yobanma ira ta Sodom meglkwa i agre i ede enatnga pamiwe di, yegl dibrika. <verse eid="GEN 19:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Angelo suo yegl dibrika pre Lot ede pi yagl suo ye abuglo inabugledi eribrika i yegl di togwa, Nono dumo munara i we, Yawe ere kide erse, yoba mudu si goglsre, yegl erarukwa. Yegl pre ene tabre Sodom kide kodidre, ede piro! dugwa. Lot yegl dugwa ba yagl suo i pribrika, Lot ka boglo erumedi pribrika.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Ana kamun tagugwa igne, angelo suo Lot di tebrika, Ene ebin idre, abutn suo idre, tabre ede pio! Ta manan, yoba mudu geglbi, ene ama akie goraiglmiwe dibrika. <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Yegl dibrika ba Lot tabre pikrukwa pre angelo suo ye Lot ogo akidre, Lot ebie ya abuglo ogono akidre, i pi Sodom meda edibrika. Yawe ye Lot mirie goglkwa pre angelo suo yegl eribrika. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Ye i pi Sodom meda edibriko, angelo ta yegl dugwa, Ene gogl dinaiglmiwa, ede pio! Ene kan ikne edekre, dumo auduno yomara bage magigl i moglkre, ede dagne ibo pio! Ta manan, ene goraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Yegl dugwa ba Lot di ikne ede, Yagl kade suo, i ta manabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Yegl didre, ye ama angelo swara ta yegl di togwa, Na ene nigl kogonen yoba mere yegl moluwa. Ene na wakai kandre, mitna goglsre, ake ple di narsre, na gogl dinabedi i pi meda edinga. I wakai etnga ba na dagne ibo ta pikraglka paugwa. Muglo i eglke kuri yogwa pre na bage pi moglbo, ene dumo Sodom ere kide eribr, na ama goraglka pamiwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Ene taun kebra ta magigl yogwa i kano! Taun i magigl yogwa pre na teke ede pi taun i enaglka kuno erabuka. I ama kebra yogwa pre na teke ede pi taun i pidre, kor moraglba, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Dugo, angelo Prawa dugwa. Na ene di pitnga i prika. Taun kebra i ta ere kide erekraglka. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Ana ene tabre ede taun i pio! Ene dumo i mina enamnedi pi meglbi, na taragl ta erekraglka pamiwe dugwa. Yegl pre yoba okuo ere mogl, taun kebra i Soar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina kagie Soar i mabuno paugwa, kebra.</char></note> we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">God Sodom ya Gomora ere kide erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Ana ade koragle sugo, Lot ede Soar suna pi kodugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Ogo, Yawe makandigle moglkwa ya dugo, Yawe kamin mitna ibo moglkwa i, kobuglo de bauglo erikwa dedugo, kobuglo i kamun mere yegl si, yage Sodom ya Gomora sigwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Yawe yegl ere, taun i ya dumo auduno taun suo i magigl yogwa i mudu ere kide ersre, yoba ama mudu si goglkwa. Kugl kan ya ki ama ere kide ere kodugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" /><figure style="fig" alt="Destruction of Sodom and Gomorrah" file="FM 046 Destruction of Sodom and Gomorrah_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="19.26" />Lot teke ede pi Soar ogwa igne, ye ebie okuo udre, kan ikne edugwa. Kan ikne edugwa pre ye ede u mudi koglo pi, kobuglo mere yegl pi adigl pai moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Ana Abraham tagna kide kana adiglsre, ede pi ye Yawe bogl okna ka di miurara ikra ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Pidre, ye kan Sodom ya Gomora ya dumo auduno magigl yogwa ikra edugwa, inge podo ede mitna ogo, kanugwa. Yoba makan koglwa sin gaiglkwa inge omere podo yegl erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Ana God yegl ere, taun dumo auduno yomara yebrika i, ere kide ersre, yoba mudu si goglkwa. Yegl erukwa ba Abraham ye di prukwa ikra kina torua sikrukwa. Kina torua sikrukwa pre ye Lot taun kipamara i, auro i pi meda edidre, dumo ere kide ersre, yoba si goglsre, erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lot abuglo suo yagl gak kiurka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Ana okuo Lot ye Soar aimadi morabuka kudugl goglkwa pre ye abuglo suo idre, ede dumo dagne ibo ogwa. Ye mudu ede dagne ibo pidre, kobuglo mur kipai meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Kipai meglko, Lot abuglo komono ere mogl, abauglo okuo yegl di togwa, Abu mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ye ede yagl pidre, gak kiglkwa. Yegl erikwa ba nono ede yagl ta enabuglka magigl i ta moglkriko, nono neno ama kidagl yei kodugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Yegl pre nono neno wain nuglo tau tenabuglka. Tobugl, ye nedre, spak eran, nono neno bogl padre, gak kurabuglka. Gak ta kugl, nono yugobuno kagie ta dudukrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Yegl pre abai suo i eduer neno wain nuglo tau tebriko, ye nedre, spak erukwa. Spak eruko, ye abuglo komono ere mogl, nem moglmara ogo, ye bogl swara pabrika. Bogl swara pabrika ba ye nem spak podo erukwa pre ye abuglo erukwa i pre kan erekrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Ana tagna we, Lot abuglo komono i, ye abauglo okuo yegl di togwa, Na eduer nina bogl bogl swara akie pabuglka. Nono erme eduer ama wain nuglo tau tenabuglka. Ye nedre, spak eran, ene ama ye moglmara en, bogl swara panabrika. Yegl etn, nono suo akie gak ta kugl, nono yugobuno kagie dudukrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Yegl pre ye eduer aglke kor neno wain nuglo tebriko, ye nedre, spak erukwa. Spak eruko, ye abuglo okuo ere mogl, nem moglmara ogo, ye bogl swara pabrika. Bogl swara pabrika ba ye nem spak podo erukwa pre ye abuglo okuo erukwa i pre kan erekrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Abai suo yegl eribriko, ye neno wagle dano paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Dano paugo, ye ere mogl, gak kiurka. Lot abuglo komono ye yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Moap we dugwa. Moap yoba erme meglkwa i, ye gawama meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Te, ye abuglo okuo yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Benami we dugwa. Amon yoba erme meglkwa i, ye gawama meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Abimelek Abraham ebie yugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Ana Abraham ere mogl, dumo ta kipai moglkwa i kide kodidre, bage bage pai, ede pi dumo makan Negev we dimara ogwa. Pidre, ye dumo Negev suna i, dumo kebra ta Kades ya Sur we dimara suna kipaugwa. Dumo i kipadre, okuo ye dumo i kide kodidre, ede pi dumo ta Gerar we dimara ege sugunagle ta moragledi ede ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Abraham ede Gerar pidre, ye Gerar yoba yegl di togwa, Sara na abara moglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre Gerar king, kagie Abimelek we digwa i, ye ere mogl, nigl kogonmo yoba tau dedugo, ye pi Sara agre i ede u king ebie ta morabuka pre king moglmara yuigwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Yuigo, Abimelek eduer ta ugl pai kubu kanugwa, God ye moglmara udre, yegl di togwa, Ene we, abu ta yunga i, wie ta moglkwa pre ene goratniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />God yegl dugwa ba Abimelek ya Sara ye ege swara ta bogl swara paikribrika pre Abimelek ere mogl, di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na aglau ta erekriko, na yobanama ama aglau ta erekrikwa. Yegl pre ene ka kaima no si goratno? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Ye ama yegl dugwa, Abraham yene di nare, Abu i na abara moglme dugo, Sara ama, Yagl i na agra moglme dugwa. Yegl pre na tadaglme ta erekriedi prika. Na mabuno du keme erie di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Ana Abimelek ugl kubu kanumara i, God di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Owo, ene ka kaima dinga. Na prika, ene tadaglme ta erekriedi prisre, abu i yunga. Yegl pre ene abu i bogl padre, tadaglme na mane dimara eratnga konbo i, na si kegl diga pre erekitnga. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ana erme we, ene abu i te ikne wie moglmara edo! Yagl i na ka kep yoba moglkwa. Ene pre ye na agle di pran, ene ta goglkratnga. Ba ene abu i ta te ikne edekitn, ene ya ene yobanma ama mudu ka kaima goraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />God ka yegl di te kodugo, Abimelek tagna kana adiglsre, ye nigl kogonmo yoba di makai sidre, God ka dugwa ikra ye di togwa. Di togo, ye kudugl podo geglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Ana Abimelek ye nigl kogonmo yoba yegl di tedre, ye Abraham agle dugo, ugwa. Abraham ugo, Abimelek yegl di prukwa, Ene siragl pre mabuno kide ere notne? Na tadaglme siragl mere eriko, ene na yobanama bogl aglau eraiglmedi etne? Ene mabuno yegl ta erekratnga paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Siragl eruko, ene mabuno kide yegl etne? di, yegl di prukwa.<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abimelek yegl di pruko, Abraham di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na abara moglme diga i, yegl pre diga, yoba magigl i God kuduglmo goglkrimedi prisre, na ebina i ye inamnedi ersre, na na si goraiglmedi prika. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Ba na ka kibi dikrika. Ye kaima na abara moglkwa. No neno swara moglkwa ba mano pere pere miurka pre na ye iga. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Ana God na Ene nen yugumo kaminmo kide kodidre, dumo pere pere wan moratnedi dedugwa igne, na Sara yegl di teiga, Ene yegl di, na ere wakai ere naratniwa. Nono bage ta obugl, ene yoba di te, Abraham na agra moglme dinatniwe di, okna yegl di teie dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Ana Abimelek ere mogl, sipsip ya kau ya nigl kogon yagl abu tau idre, Abraham togwa. Tedre, ye ebie Sara ama te ikne edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Edidre, ye yegl dugwa, Ene makan mudu yogwa i kano! Makan i, mudu na makana yogwa. Na makana suna i, ene dumo ta wakai kanatnara i, kipanatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Ye Abraham yegl di tedre, ye ama Sara yegl di togwa, Na we, na mige silva 1,000 idre, agitn kumap teiga. Na kumap teiga pre ene yobanma ya yoba pere mudu ama praiglkwa, Abu Sara aglau ta erekrumedi praiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17-18" />Ana Abimelek okna Sara yugwa igne, Sara ye Abraham ebie moglkwa pre Yawe ye Abimelek ya, ye ebie ya, ye nigl kogonmo abu mudu gak ta kuglkraiglmedi ere edugwa. Ana Abraham erme God agle di pruko, God ye Abimelek ya ki aglke kor gak kuraiglmedi ere edugwa.<verse eid="GEN 20:17-18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Sara Aisak kuglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, ye Sara ka di te paduglmere ikra ake ple di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Ake ple di togo, Sara dane paugo, okuo yagl gak ta kuglkwa. God okna Abraham di te, Sara ege igle gak ta kurabe dumere, igne i kuglkwa. Abraham kidagl yei kodugwa igne kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Sara yagl gak kuglko, Abraham ere mogl, ye wam i kagie Aisak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Aisak mabuno ta paugwa, gaugl erukwa.</char></note> we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Abraham ye wam kagie Aisak we dugo, Aisak ege 8-pela de moglko, Abraham ye God okna di tomere wam gagie puduo bogl togwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Abraham ye Aisak kuglkwa igne i ye bugla yugu 100 ne kodugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Ye Aisak gagie puduo bogl togo, Sara gak ta kuglsre, gun yogwa i pre ye ere mogl, yegl dugwa, God ere wakai ere narukwa pre na gun yedre, gaugl erika. Yoba tau Sara yagl gak ta kuglme dibi, yoba praiglkwa i ama mudu gun yebi, no akie gaugl eramniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Ka yegl didre, ye ama dugwa, Yoba okna ta Abraham di te, Ebn Sara gak ta kurabiwe di, yegl ta dimo? Ta manada! Yegl ta dikrikwa. Ba Abraham kidagl moglkwa igne, na yagl gak ta kule di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Ana yagl gak i ere mogl, yakugo, ye mam am biglke dugwa. Ye am biglke dugwa igne, Abraham kaya mokna podo kego, yoba u neigwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham ye Hagar ya Ismael di meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Ana aglke ta Hagar, Isip mam ikra, wam Ismael ere mogl, Aisak kiam sugwa. Kiam sugo, Sara kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Sara kandre, Abraham yegl di togwa, Na nigl kogona abu i, ye wam bogl di meda edo! Ene gogln, Aisak swara ene taraglnen ya againen inabedi prika. Hagar wam ikne ta ikrabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Sara ka yegl dugo, Abraham kide kaima prukwa. Ismael ye ama Abraham wam moglkwa pre kide kaima prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Yegl prukwa ba God ere mogl, Abraham yegl di togwa, Ene wan ya nigl kogonen abu di meda edinatnga i, pre yubun dekro! Sara dumere eratniwa! Ene gawanma mere moraiglme diga ikra we, Aisak swara ye wama ya gawama pre diga. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Te, nigl kogon abu ikra wam we, ye ama ene wan moglkwa pre ye gawama mere moglsre, yugobuno pere ta moraiglmedi ere edenagle di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />God ka yegl dugwa pre Abraham tagna kana adiglsre, bret ya nigl migi ta meme nagie mina bekigwa idre, Hagar koba wagle padigl tedre, wam bogl suo akie di meda edugwa. Di meda edugo, Hagar dumo ta Berseba we dimara pidre, dumo suna i wan moglkwa. Dumo i, dumo wau yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Ana Hagar nigl tau yugwa i, wam bogl nebriko, dudugwa. Dudugo, Hagar ye wam agre i ede pi ede kebra ta pamara mabunomugl edidre, <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />ye ede prak iro pi, yagl ta yer sinan, ede eglke kuri enabere mere yegl Hagar ede eglke kuri yegl ogwa. Ye wam gorabuka kanakrukwa pre ede eglke kuri iro ogwa. Ye eglke iro pidre, ye ame di mogl, kai erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Ana yagl gak ama kai erukwa. Ye kai ere moglko, God prukwa. Ana God angelomo kamun mitna ibo moglsre, Hagar yegl di prukwa, Hagar yo, ene motnara aglau siragl mere pame? di, yegl didre, ye ama ka yegl di togwa, Ene kudugl goglkro! God ye yagl gak kai ere moglkwa i prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Ene ede wan moglmara pi, ogo ake adigln, adrabuka. Na ye gawama mere kide moglsre, yugobuno pere ta moraiglmedi ere edenagle di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Ana God ye Hagar maugl nigl ta magigl moglkwa kanabedi ere edugo, Hagar kanugwa. Kandre, ye nigl migi i pi nigl koglsre, yu wam togo, nogwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Ana God ye yagl gak i ake ple di te moglko, yagl gak i yakugwa. Ye dumo ta wau yomara mogl, u kade pidre, kibr yer sugwa yagle moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Dumo wau yomara i, dumo Paran we digwa. Ana Ismael dumo Paran i wan mogl, kade moglkwa. Kade moglkwa igne ye mam ere mogl, Isip abai ta yu, ye wam togo, yugwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham ya Abimelek ka giglede di padiurka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Ana igne i Abimelek, dumo Gerar king ikra ere mogl, yagl ta kagie Fikol we digwa bogl akie Abraham moglmara ubrika. Fikol ye Abimelek amimo sugl moglkwa yagle moglkwa. Ana ye ede u Abraham moglmara ubriko, Abimelek ka yegl di Abraham togwa, Ene we, ene taragl kane kane etnga i, God ene ake ple di togo, etnga. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Yegl pre erme God kagie mina ka kaima ta di nare padratnedi prika. Ene na bakagl narekre, na gagrama ya gawanama ama bakagl tekratnga i pre ya te, na ene mabuno wakai ere teimere ene na mabuno wakai ere narsre, na kantrinana ede suna u, kipai motnara i, yoba makan nem magigl meglkwa i, ama mabuno wakai ere tenatnga i pre ka gigledi ta di nare padratnedi prie di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abimelek yegl dugo, Abraham di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ana ene dinere yegl mere ka gigledi di te padiliwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Yegl didre, ye ka ta ama Abimelek di togwa. Abraham okna maugl nigl ta perukwa ba Abimelek nigl kogonmo yagl tau ere mogl, maugl nigl i yene igwa. Yegl pre Abraham nomane sugo, Abimelek di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Di togo, Abimelek di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene okna di narekitnga pre na ta prikrika. Na nigl kogona yoba ira yegl erikwa ama na ta digo, prikrie dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Ana Abraham ere mogl, sipsip ya kau tau yu, Abimelek togo, ye akie wakai morabugledi ka di padiurka. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Ka di padigl kodibriko, Abraham sipsip nagigle abai 7-pela i pere edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />I pere edugo, Abimelek Abraham di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene sipsip nagigle abai 7-pela i pere edinga i, mabuno siragl mere pame? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Dugo, Abraham di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na sipsip 7-pela i ene tenaglka. Ene in, yoba kandre, O, Abraham ka kaima maugl nigl i perumedi praiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Abraham ya Abimelek dumo i ka di padiurka pre Abraham ere mogl, dumo i kagie Berseba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Berseba mabuno ta paugwa, ka gigledi di padiglkwa niglmo.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Ana Abraham ya Abimelek dumo Berseba i mogl, ka gigledi di padiurko, Abimelek ya ye amimo sugl moglkwa yagle Fikol i aglke ede ikne dumono, Filistia yoba meglmara ebrika. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ede ebriko, Abraham ere mogl, dumo Berseba i ede ta tamarisk we digwa yaglkwa. Yaglsre, ye dumo i Yawe, God Aimadi Moglkwa i agle di prisre, kamage ere togwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Ana Abraham ye Filistia yoba meglmara dumo i ege tau olto kipai moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">God ye Abraham di te, Aisak si gogl, gagl tawa naratne dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Ana okuo God ere mogl, Abraham na kana pre medrabo mo pre mediglkrabo mo di, ere kanagledi ye Abraham ka ta di togwa. God Abraham yo dugo, Abraham, Na mogliwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Dugo, God ye yegl di togwa, Ene we, wan swara kaima ta moglkwa i, idre, ede dumo makan Moria we dimara po! Na ene wan Aisak, mudn suna moglkwa i pre diga. Ene dumo makan Moria we dimara en, na muglo meglbi ta ene obuno di tebo, muglo meglbi i mina ene wan i si goglsre, gagl tawa naratniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />God ka yegl dugwa pre Abraham tagna kana adiglsre, taragl tau donki moko bolamugl edidre, wam Aisak ya nigl kogonmo yagl suo idre, te, tawa gagl tenagledi ede ekresre, ede dumo ta God enabe dumara enagledi ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Ye ege suota pi moglsre, de namba 3 ye eglke mogl, dumo ikra kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Dumo ikra kandre, ye nigl kogonmo yagl suo di te, yegl dugwa, Ene igle mogl, donki sugl moglsro! Na wana bogl akie ede dage ibo pidre, God kagie kade tedre, ede ikne unabugle dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ana Abraham tawa tenagledi ede ekrukwa ikra idre, ye wam Aisak kake idre, ede enabedi togwa. Tedre, yene naip ya doga yobugl akugo, wam bogl akie ede ebrika. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Ye pi miurko, Aisak ere mogl, Nina yo, dugwa. Dugo, Abraham, We, ene do dugwa. Dugo, Aisak ka yegl di prukwa, Nono ede ya doga yobugl yubuglka ba sipsip nagigle ta tawa tenabuglka i, aglo moglme? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Aisak yegl dugo, Abraham di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Wana yo, God yene sipsip nagigle ta gagl tawa narabredi norabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Dugo, ye akie ede ebrika.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Ana ye ede pi dumo ta God ye Abraham obuno di tomara ebriko, Abraham kobuglo bogl ta kuglsre, ede ekrukwa ikra i pi tebe egle koglkwa. Ede i pi kobuglo bogl mina tebe egle koglsre, ye wam Aisak ogo kagle kane sidre, i pi kobuglo bogl mina ede ikra egle koglmara tebe edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ede egle koglmara tebe edidre, ye naip akidre, wam si goragledi erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Si goragledi eruko, Yawe Angelomo heven ibo moglkwa agle di, Abraham yo! dugwa. Dugo, Abraham Na mogliwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Abraham yegl dugo, Yawe angelomo dugwa, Ene wan si goglkro! Ye ka kaima sikro! Erme ene na God moglka i, kuduglna goglnga kaniga. Ene wan swara kaima moglkwa ba ene ye ake gi dikre, si gogl, tawa naragledi etnga. Yegl pre ene na kuduglna goglnga kaniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Ana Abraham kan koglo koglo edidre, kanugwa, sipsip kumugl ta ye moglmara mokomugl moglkwa kanugwa. Sipsip i bre yogagle mina ede kebra ta paimara warke gide paugwa. Abraham sipsip i kandre, ye pi idre, si gogl, gagl tawa togwa. Yegl erukwa pre sipsip i, Aisak agaimo yugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Ram in thicket" file="FM 049 Ram in the Thicket_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="22.13" /> <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Abraham sipsip gagl tawa tedre, ye ere mogl, dumo i Yawe Norabuka we di, kagie yei togwa. Yegl pre yoba erme digwa, Yawe kaminmo muglo mina norabiwe di, yegl di meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Ana Yawe angelomo heven ibo moglkwa aglke kor Abraham agle didre, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />yegl dugwa, Abraham yo, Yawe ene yegl di togwa, Ene wan swara kaima moglkwa i ene ake gi dikre, si gogl tawa naragledi etnga i pre nana kagna mina ka giglede ene di te padiglka. <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />Na kaima ene ere wakai ere tedre, ene gawanma mere kide moraiglmedi ere edenaglka. Ere edibo, kugl kuri mitna ibo mere kide keglmere ya te, wesan mudi nigl bina mere kide meglmere mere yegl moraiglkwa. Te, ene gawanma ama ye kuda ikne kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo eraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Te, ene na kana duglo boglnga pre yoba yugobuno pere pere moglsre, uglo koglo koglo moraiglkwa i we, na ene gawan ta morabuka ye mina mudu ere wakai ere tenaluwe di, Yawe yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Ana Yawe angelomo ka yegl di kodugo, Abraham ya Aisak ede ikne pi, Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl suo ikra miurara ebriko, ye akie ede ikne dumo Berseba eigwa. Eigo, Abraham yobama bogl Berseba okna kipaimara ikra kipai meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nahor wama kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Ana okuo yoba ta Abraham moglmara u, ye agigle Nahor kamo di te, yegl dugwa, Nahor ebie Milka ama yagl gak tau kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Yagl gak komono kuglkwa i, kagie Us we digwa. Te, ye okuo Bus ya Kemuel ama kuglkwa. Kemuel ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Aram we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Te, Milka yagl gak tau ama kuglkwa, kagno Keset ya Haso ya Pildas ya Jitlap ya Betuel we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Abraham agigle Nahor ebie Milka yagl gak 8-pela i kuglkwa. Te, Betuel ere mogl, abai gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Rebeka we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Nahor ama nigl kogonmo abu, kagie Reuma we digwa, ye ebie namba 2 morabedi yugo, ye ama yagl gak 4-pela kuglkwa. Yagl gak 4-pela i, kagno Teba ya Gaham ya Tahas ya Maka we dimiwe di, yagl ta ugwa ikra Abraham yegl di togwa.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Sara goglko, Abraham dumo makan ta gigl pene yenabedi topo sugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Ana Sara bugla yugu 127 nedre, <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />goglkwa. Ye dumo ta Kiriat Arba we dimara, dumo podo Kenan suna yogwa mogl, goglkwa. Dumo Kiriat Arba i, nono erme Hebron we dumga. Ye goglko, Abraham mirie goglsre, kai ere moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Ye kai ere mogl, ebie goglkwa i kanige ere padigl, ede pi Hit yoba kipai meglmara pidre, ye ka yegl di togwa, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />Na we, na ene makano mina kipaiga ba na dumo pere nem moglka. Erme na ebina goglkwa pre ene gigl pene ta naribi, na i pi kobuglo mur mina atne yenagle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Abraham yegl dugo, Hit yoba di ikne ede, yegl digwa, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />Ene pro. Ene no munara yagl kade motnga. Yegl pre ene gigl pene swara ta wakai kanatnara i wagle ebin goglkwa i, i pi mur mina atne yenatnga. Gigl pene makan nem swara ta mane dikrabiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Ana Hit yoba yegl digwa pre Abraham adiglsre, ye bre magide makan nem yoba togwa. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Ye bre magide tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene na ebina kobuglo mur mina atne yenaglka wakai pribi, yagl Efron, Sohar wam, di pre nario. <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />Dumo kebra Makpela we dimara ye dumo makanmo ta yogwa. Ana dumo makan i mina kobuglo mur ta bina yogwa. Na kobuglo mur i, mige siramna we dinabuka i, tebo, ene kan meglbi, dumo i aimadi na gigl penena yenabuka. I pre di prio. dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10-11" />Ana Hit yoba taun kobuglo togl winabo dumara dua yomara ame di mogl, ka di prikwa. Te, ye meglmara yagl Efron i ama moglkwa. Ye moglkwa pre yene di ikne ede, Abraham yegl di togwa, Yagl kade yo, ene pro. Na mige naratnga ta ikraglka. Na dumo makan ya kobuglo mur akie ene yoko teiga. Na ene yoko teiga i, na nena agrama kan meglkwa. Ene ebin goglkwa i, i pi kobuglo mur mina atne yeo dugwa. Ye dugo, Hit yoba mudu pre meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 23:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Abraham aglke kor bre magide, makan nem yoba meglkwa togwa. <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />Ye bre magide tedre, ye Efron yegl di togwa, Ene pro. Na dumo makan ya kobuglo mur akie topo sinaglka. Ene mige inatniwa. In, na ebina dumo i kobuglo mur mina atne yenagle di, yegl dugwa. Dugo, Hit yoba mudu pre meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Abraham yegl dugo, Efron di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />Yagl kade yo, ene pro. Na makana i pre mige ta ibo, mige silva 400 inaglka kuno erukwa ba nono mina taragl i taragl kebra yoma, kodo! Ebn goglkwa i pi kobuglo mur mina atne yeo dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Efron yegl dugo, Abraham ye kamo prisre, Efron mige silva 400 we dugwa, Hit yoba pre meglkwa ikra, Abraham kersre, Efron togwa. Ana mige swara swarade we, yubunmo yoba stoa ere yeigwa yoba mige silva yubu simere kuno yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Ana yegl mere Abraham ye Efron dumo makanmo ya kobuglo mur bina yogwa ikra ya ede mudu makan i mina paigwa topo sugwa. Dumo makan i dumo kebra Makpela we dimara suna yogwa. Te, Makpela i, dumo Mamre we dimara magigl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Abraham makan i ye makanmo aimadi yenabuka pre topo sugo, Hit yoba taun kobuglo togl winabo dumara dua yomara makai sigwa i mudu kan meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Abraham makan topo sidre, ye ebie Sara kobuglo mur i, dumo kebra Makpela we digwa yomara ikra, kobuglo mur mina atne yogwa. Dumo i, dumo Mamre yomara magigl yedre, dumo podo Kenan we dimara suna yogwa. Ana dumo Mamre nono erme Hebron we dumga. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Yegl keme Hit yoba makan i ya kobuglo mur mige bogl neigo, Abraham gigl penemo aimadi yenabedi topo si yugwa.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl dedugo, ye abai Rebeka bogl i, Aisak togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Ana God ye Abraham siragl ta erukwa i, ake ple di tedre, Abraham ere wakai ere togwa. Yegl eruko, Abraham mogl pi, kidagl kaima yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Kidagl kaima yedre, ye nigl kogonmo yagl ta ede okna pidre, Abraham taraglmo mudu sugl moglkwa i, Wo dugo, ugwa. Ye ugo, Abraham yegl di togwa, Ene ogn na bikina wagle atne padiglo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okna ibo i, mabuno yegl ta paugwa. Yoba ka dinaiglkwa i, giglede panabuka pre, ye ogono yoba ta di tenaiglka i, bikino wagle atne padiglsre, ka di te padraiglkwa.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Padiglsre, ene Yawe, God heven ibo ya makan atne nem moglkwa i, ye kagie mina ka kaima di nare padratnedi prika. Na Kenan yoba dumono suna kipaiga ba ene Kenan abai ta bogl i na wana tekratnga i pre dinatnedi prika. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Ene Kenan abai ta bogl i tekre, ene ede pi na dumo kamina, yobanama meglmara pidre, abai ta yu, wana Aisak tenatniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Yegl dugo, ye nigl kogonmo yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ana na abai ta doko kanibo, abai i magigl i ta una kiurie dinan we? Na ene wan auro i pi, dumo kaminen okna kipanga i edenaglo? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Yegl dugo, Abraham di ikne ede, Mane dugwa. Ene na wana auro i pi edekratniwa! <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Yawe, God heven ibo moglkwa i, na nina yobama bogl dumo kamina akie munga igne na auro yu, magigl i edugwa. Na magigl i edidre, ye na di nare, makan magigl i ene gawanma tenaluwe dugwa. Ana ye erme angelomo dedenan, angelomo ede okna pi, ene ake ple di tenan, ene na dumo kamina pi abai ta yu, wana tenatnga. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Ba ene abai ta doko kan, abai i ukragledi pran, ene ka kaima di nare padratnga i mina kogonen dudunabuka. Ba ene na wana auro i pi dumo kamina edekratniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Dugo, nigl kogon yagl i ogo Abraham bikie wagle atne padiglsre, ye sugl moglkwa yagl Abraham dumere ka kaima di te paduglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Ana Abraham ye nigl kogonmo yagl i taragl wakai kane kane abai nem agiglema tenabuka pre togo, nigl kogonmo yagl i Abraham kamelmo 10-pela idre, taragl wakai kane kane ikra mokono bolamugl edidre, taun ta Abraham agigle Nahor okna kipamara, dumo makan kade Mesopotemia suna i, ede ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Ye ede pi moglkwa, taun i mim eruko, plau didre, taun bina maugl nigl moglmara magigl kamel i pi edidre, kamel ogono kaglno bodraiglmedi eruko, ye bodugl pai meglkwa. Mim erukwa igne i abu ede taun meda pi, nigl keglkwa egemo yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Kamel ogono kaglno bodugl pai meglko, Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl i ye Yawe agle di, yegl dugwa, Yawe yo, na sugl moglkwa yagl Abraham Godmo motnga ikra we, ene ake ple di narsre, te Abraham mirie gogl, ere wakai ere ten, abai ta doko inagledi wiga i kanaluwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Na we, na maugl nigl moglmara magigl moglko, yoba magigl i kipai meglkwa abroma ede taun meda u, nigl koramnedi wigwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Ana na erme ene yegl di priwa, abai magigl i wibi, na swara ta di te, Na nigl goglka. Ene nigl kogl kake yunga i ake atne ede natn, nenaglba yegl dibo, abai ta di ikne ede, Ene nigl no! Na ama nigl kogl, kamelnen tenagle di, yegl ta dinan we, ene abai i Aisak enabedi kere inedi praglka. Te, abai yegl ta dinan, ene Abraham mirie gogl, ere wakai ere tenedi praluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Ana nigl kogon yagl i kamage yegl ere moglko, abai ta nigl koragledi nigl migi kake i ede magigl ugwa. Ye kagie Rebeka we digwa. Abraham agigle Nahor ikra ebie Milka bogl okna yagl gak ta kiurka, kagie Betuel we dibrika. Rebeka ye Betuel abuglo moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Ye abai wakai kaima moglsre, ege swara ta kumugl yagl bogl paikrikwa. Ye ede magigl udre, ede maugl nigl moglmara yoglbo pi, nigl koglsre, ede ikne ugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Ede ikne ugo, nigl kogon yagl muku di pi, ye umara ogo, tegigl yebrika. Tegigl yebriko, nigl kogon yagl yegl dugwa, Ene nigl kogl yunga i kuri ta natn, nenaglba yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Ye yegl dugo, abai i ye di te, Yagl kade yo, ene no! didre, nigl migi tabre ake atne edidre, ye togwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Ye nigl togo, yagl i pra ne kodugo, abai aglke kor dugwa, Na ama nigl kogl yu, kamelnen tebo, ye pra nenaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Ye yegl didre, nigl tau migi mina kogl yugwa i tabre toiede ede baglkugl mina atne edidre, muku di ede maugl nigl moglmara pi, nigl koglsre, yagl i kamelmo mudu pre yu, toiede ede baglkugl mina atne ede togwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Ye kamel nigl te moglko, nigl kogon yagl i ka ta dikre, abai i toro kan moglkwa. Ye kina gudu pre, Na kogon mina wiga i Yawe ake ple di narumo mo narekrumada di, kina yegl gudu prisre, toro kan moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ana nigl kogon yagl ye abai i kan moglko, abai nigl kogl togo, kamel nigl ne kodigwa. Ne kodigo, yagl i poglai gumano gol ya ogono bogo gol suo gre yugwa abai i tenagledi i meda edugwa. Poglai gumano i yubunmo 6 grams mere yegl paugo, ogono bogo swara swarade yubuno 110 grams mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Ye taragl i, i meda edidre, abai di pre, Ene ira abuglo motne? dugwa. Didre, ye ama yegl dugwa, Na yagl tau ama idre wiga. No ene nen kipamara panamga agai ta yomo? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Yegl dugo, abai di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Na Betuel abuglo moglka. Na nina Betuel, ye Nahor ya Milka wano moglme dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Yegl didre, ye ama yegl dugwa, Ene no kipamnara panaiglkwa agai pra yogwa. Te, kamel ama no kana panaiglkwa kuno erukwa. No kugl mere kamel nenaiglkwa pre yedre, kugl mere kamel kugl panaiglkwa pre yomne di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Abai yegl dugo, yagl i bre magide tedre, Yawe kagie kade togwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Ye yegl dugwa, Yawe we, ye sigie kagie wanabuka. Ye na sugl moglkwa yagl Abraham Godmo moglsre, ye Ere wakai ere tenagle dumere keme Abraham mirie gogl, ere wakai ere togwa. Te, na we, Yawe na konbauna obuno di naruko, na ede Abraham yobama kipaimara wiwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Ana abai we, ye muku di ede pi mam kipamara pidre, siragl taragl plau dugwa i mam ya nem agiglema di togo, prikwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29-30" />Ana Rebeka agigle ta moglkwa, kagie Laban we digwa. Ye abauglo yagl i ka dumere dugwa prisre, poglai gumano ya ogono bogo paduglkwa ikra kandre, muku di ede taun bina pi, maugl nigl ikra moglmara ogwa. Ye pidre, yagl i kamel meglmara adigl mogl pai moglko, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Ye kandre, yegl dugwa, Ene we, Yawe ene ere wakai ere tomiwa. No yugu ere wakai ersre, kamel panaiglmara ama ere wakai erumga. Yegl pre ene na kipaimara unatniwa! Ene siragl pre taun bina adigl mogl pai motne? di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Laban ka yegl dugwa pre Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl i Laban bogl akie ede pi Laban kipamara ebriko, nigl kogon yagl ede yugugl ogwa. Ede yugugl ogo, Laban yoba di togo, ye bonagana kamel mina padigl yuigwa i, i makandigle edidre, kamel kugl nenaiglkwa i tedre, kamel kugl panaiglkwa kugl i ama ede tedre, erikwa. Yegl ersre, Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl ya yagl tau akie wigwa i kaglno nigl koraiglkwa pre nigl kogl yuigwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Yegl eriko, yoba tau kaya mokna gagl yu ye nenaiglmedi teigwa. Teigo, nigl kogon yagl i yegl dugwa, Na kaya mokna oglade nekraglka. Na kogon mina wiga pre kogon i di tedre, okuo nenaluwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Laban di ikne ede, Ana do! dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Ana nigl kogon yagl i yegl dugwa, Na we, na Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl moglka. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Yawe ye Abraham ka kaima ere wakai ere togo, Abraham taragl mere kaima kan yogwa. Ye ere mogl, sipsip ya meme ya kau Abraham tedre, kamel ya donki tedre, nigl kogon yagl abu ya silva ya gol togo, kan yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Ana Abraham ebie Sara we, ye kidagl yei kodugwa igne yagl gak ta kuglko, Abraham taraglmo mudu wam i togwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Tedre, ye ama na yegl di narukwa, Ene na ka kaima di nare padratnga. Na Kenan yoba dumono suna kipaiga ba Kenan abai ta bogl i wana tekratnga. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Ene na nina dumo kaminmo, yobanama kipai meglmara pidre, abai ta yu, wana tenatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Dugo, na di ikne ede, yegl diga, Na abai ta doko kanibo, abai i na bogl akie ta una kiuran, na siragl eragle? diga. <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Digo, ye yegl dugwa, Na Yawe kamo duglo bogl moglka. Ye angelomo ene kogonen u wakai enabedi dedenan, ene angelo bogl akie ede nina dumo kaminmo, yobanama kipai meglmara ebr, abai ta yu, wana tenatnga. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Te, ene na yobanama kipai meglmara en, ye abai ta tekribi, na ka kaima di nare padratnga i mina kogonen dudinabiwe di, Abraham yegl dume di, nigl kogon yagl i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />Nigl kogon yagl i ka yegl didre, ye ama ere mogl, ka yegl dugwa, Ana Abraham yegl di narukwa pre na erme ede maugl nigl moglmara taun bina udre, Yawe agle di, yegl diga, Yawe yo, na sugl moglkwa yagl Abraham Godmo motnga ikra we, ene na kogon mina wiga i ake ple di natn, abai ta doko inagledi wiga i kanaluwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Na we, na maugl nigl moglmara magigl adigl moglka. Ana na erme ene yegl di priwa, Abai ta nigl kogl yunan, na ye di pre, Ene nigl kogl yunga i kuri ta natn, nenaglba yegl dibo, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />ye na di nare, Ene no! Na ama nigl kogl, kamelnen tenagle dinan we, ene abai i na sugl moglkwa yagl wam enabedi kere inedi praluwe di, yegl diga.<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Ana nana nomana mina kamage yegl ere moglko, Rebeka nigl migi kake yu taun meda udre, ede maugl nigl moglmara yoglbo pi, nigl koglkwa. Ye nigl koglsre, ede ie ugo, na ye di pre, Nigl ta nenaglba yegl diga. <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Na yegl digo, ye nigl migi tabre ake atne edidre, di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene no! Na ama nigl kogl, kamelnen tenaluwe dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre na nigl neiga. Na nigl neigo, ye ama nigl kogl, kamelna togwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Te kodugo, na di pre, Ene ira abuglo motne? diga. Na yegl digo, ye di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na Betuel abuglo moglka. Na nina Betuel, ye Nahor ya Milka wano moglme dugwa. Yegl dugo, na poglai guma padigl tedre, ogo bogo suo ama ere teiga. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Taragl i tedre, na bitna magide te, Yawe, na sugl moglkwa yagl Abraham Godmo moglkwa i kagie kade tedre, Sigie kagie wanabiwe diga. Yawe na konbauna obuno di naruko, na Abraham agigle wam kipamara wiga. Ye abuglo, bogl i Abraham wam tenaglka kuno erabuka. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Yegl pre erme ene na sugl moglkwa yagl Abraham ere wakai ere tedre, mabuno du ere tenamnedi pribi, na di nario. Te, ta manan, i ama di nario. Ene di naribi na siragl eraglka pre pogl sinaluwe di, Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl yegl di kodugo, Laban ya abai nem Betuel di ikne ede, yegl dibrika, Ka dinga i no wagle paikrukwa pre no siragl we dinabugle? Taragl i poglkwa Yawe wagle paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Rebeka magigl i moglkwa. Ene auro i ede enatnga. Auro i pi edin, Yawe ene di tomere Rebeka ye ene sugl moglkwa yagl wam i ebie morabiwe di, yegl dibrika.<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Ana Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl i ye kano prisre, goglko bodugl, bre magide Yawe togwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ye bre magide Yawe tedre, taragl silva ya gol ya kugugl gagl gre yugwa i meda edidre, Rebeka togwa. Taragl i Rebeka tedre, ye ama taragl tau mige podo boglkwa Rebeka mam ya agigle togwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Ana Abraham nigl kogonmo yagl i yegl ere kodugo, ye yagl tau akie wigwa i bogl kaya mokna ya nigl ki nedre, ugl paigwa. Ugl padre, adiglkwa igne, nigl kogon yagl i yegl dugwa, Ene prawe dibi, na sugl moglkwa yagl moglmara ede enagle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Ye yegl dugwa ba abai i agigle ya mam ere mogl, yegl dibrika, Nono ege sugunagle 10-pela de mere ki yegl ta akie mun, ene abai idre, ede enaiglmiwe di, yegl dibrika. <verse eid="GEN 24:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Yegl dibriko, nigl kogon yagl di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na kogon mina wiga i, Yawe na ake ple di narukwa pre na tabre ta pikrabedi erekriro! Ene prawe dibi, na sugl moglkwa yagl moglmara ede enagle di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Yegl dugo, ye aglke kor dibrika, No abai agle dubugl, unan, yene di prabuglka. Ye erme ede enabo mo pikrabo mo i pre di prabugle dibrika. <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Ye yegl didre, Rebeka agle dibriko, Rebeka ugwa. Rebeka ugo, ye di pre, Ene yagl magigl moglkwa i bogl ede enabro? dibrika. Dibriko, Rebeka di ikne ede, No ede enabugle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Yegl dugwa pre ye di te, Prawa, Rebeka ede enabiwe didre, nigl kogon abu ta Rebeka gak kebra moglkwa igne ye sugl moglkwa i ama Akie ede enabriwe dibrika. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Yegl dibriko, ye nem agiglema ere mogl, Rebeka di wakai yei te, yegl digwa, Abaro yo, ene gawanma u milion tau enaiglmiwa. Ye kuda ikne kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo eraiglmiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Yegl digo, Rebeka ya ye nigl kogonmo abu tau akie kamel au sidre, nigl kogon yagl i bogl akie ede eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Ana Aisak we, ye nigl Bir Lahai Roi ogo beimara ikra kide kodidre, dumo makan Negev suna kipaugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Ye ege swara ta poko dugwa igne, ede meda pi, kugl moglmara wan moglkwa. Ye wan moglsre, kan iro ede kamel tau wigwa kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Te, Rebeka we, ye kamel au sidre, ugwa. Udre, ye kan iro ede Aisak kandre, kamel au sugwa kide kodidre, ede maginagle ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Pidre, ye nigl kogon yagl ikra yegl di prukwa, Yagl ta kugl moglmara nono tegigl yenagledi ugwa. Yagl i ira ume? dugwa. Yegl dugo, nigl kogon yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl i Aisak, na sugl moglkwa yagl moglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre Rebeka lap ta idre, guma dra si kegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Aisak ugo, nigl kogon yagl ye kogon mina pi, siragl mere erukwa i mudu Aisak di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Ye Aisak di te kodugo, Aisak ye Rebeka agre i ede pi sel yugu ta Aisak mam Sara okna kipamara ogwa. Agre i ede ogo, ye yagl abu miurka. Yagl abu miurko, Aisak ye Rebeka dem muduo tedre, ye okna mam Sara goglkwa pre mirie gogl moglkwa i, erme tau aragan erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Abraham wama ya gawama kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Ana Abraham abu pere ta yugwa, kagie Ketura we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Simran ya Joksan ya Medan ya Midian ya Isbak ya Sua we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Ana ye wam Joksan we, ye ere mogl, yagl gak suo kuglkwa, kagno Seba ya Dedan. Te, Dedan we, ye gawama Asur yoba ya Letus yoba ya Leum yoba meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Te, Ketura wam Midian we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa kagno Efa ya Efer ya Hanok ya Abida ya Elda. Yagl gak kagno magigl paugwa i, ye mudu Ketura wama ya gawama meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Ana Abraham ere mogl, Na goglbo, na wana Aisak taraglnana mudu inabiwe di, yegl mere di paduglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Yegl di paduglkwa ba ye nigl kogonmo abu suo yugwa i wanoma we, Abraham kor moglkwa igne, ye taraglmo tau wama i tedre, ye wam Aisak moglmara eglke moraiglmedi dedugo, ye ede pi ade umara kra meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham goglko, kobuglo mur yeigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7-8" />Ana Abraham kidagl kaima yogo, dem muduo aragan eruko, ye bugla yugu 175 nedre, goglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Ye goglko, ye wam suo Aisak ya Ismael dumo Makpela kobuglo mur yomara ikra yebrika. Kobuglo mur i okna Hit yoba Efron, Soar wam ikra makanmo mina yogwa. Makan i, dumo Mamre we dimara ama magigl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Makan i okna Hit yoba makano yogwa ba Abraham topo sugwa pre ye makanmo yogwa. Dumo i, Sara goglko, Abraham okna paduglmara Aisak ya Ismael ye neno Abraham goglko, padiurka. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Abraham goglko, God ye Abraham wam Aisak ere wakai ere togwa. Aisak ye maugl nigl Bir Lahai Roi moglmara ikra kipai moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Abraham wam Ismael wama ya gawama kagno paugwa. Sara nigl kogonmo abu Hagar, Isip mam ikra ye Ismael kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Ana Ismael ere mogl, yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno magigl i paugwa. Ye gak ta komono kuglkwa i, kagie komono paugo, gak tau okuo kuglkwa kagno okuo paugwa. Ye wam komono i, kagie Nebaiot we digwa. Te, okuo ye Kedar ya Atbel ya Mipsam kuglsre, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Misma ya Duma ya Masa kuglsre, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadat ya Tema ya Jetur ya Nafis ya Kedema kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />I Ismael wam 12-pela kagno paugwa. Wam 12-pela i okuo yagl kade moglsre, yugobuno pere pere sugl meglkwa. Te, ye yobanoma okuo meglkwa we, yene nenoma 12-pela i kagno idre, dumo tau ye yugu kipaimara ya sel yugu kipaimara kagno 12-pela i teigwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ismael ye bugla yugu 137 nedre, goglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Te, ye gawama we, ye makano dumo ta Havila we dimara yei ede pi dumo Sur we dimara ogwa. Dumo Sur i, Isip yomara ade umara kra yogwa. Kantri ta Isip ya kantri Asiria we digwa i, dumo Sur i, suna yogwa. Ismael gawama dumo i kipai moglsre, kuda ikne ikne meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rebeka Iso ya Jekop kuglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Abraham wam Aisak ya ye gawama kano paugwa. Ana Abraham ye Aisak kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Kuglko, Aisak ere mogl, bugla yugu 40 nedre, Rebeka yugwa. Rebeka ye Laban abauglo moglsre, Aram yagl Betuel dumo makan Mesopotemia suna kipai moglkwa ikra abuglo moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Aisak ye Rebeka yugo, Rebeka temne paugwa. Ye temne paugwa pre Aisak ye gak ta kurabedi Yawe kamage ere togwa. Ye kamage ere togo, Yawe ye kamo prisre, Rebeka ake ple di togo, Rebeka dane paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Ye dane paugwa i, wam suo dane mina mogl, ake nu si ikne ikne edibrika. Yegl eribrika pre Rebeka ere mogl, I siragl pre na moglmara plau dumada di, yegl kina gudu prukwa. Yegl kina gudu prisre, siragl pre plau dugwa i pragledi pi, Yawe agle di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Agle di pruko, Yawe ye yegl di togwa, Ene gak suo kuratnga i, ye gawanoma yugobuno suo moraiglkwa. Ye ede pere pere pi, yugobuno pere pere meglbi, yugobuno swara ta yobuglo ere yugobuno ta tenaiglkwa. Te, gak ta komono kuratnga i, ye gawama ere mogl, gak ta okuo kuratnga gawama i, nigl kogono ere tenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Ana Rebeka dane paugo, ye gak kurabuka egemo ugo, ye yagl gak suo kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Ta komono kuglkwa i, gagie gogl kogl, gagie yugo mere kaima boglkwa. Yoba taragl are ere sidre, nagie kugl yaursre, gagie yugo pai moglko, i pi kugugl gagl erikwa yegl mere yoba yagl gak i gagie yugo yegl mere yomedi kanigwa. Yegl pre ye kagie Iso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Iso mabuno paugwa, ogo gagie yugo mere boglkwa.</char></note> we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Te, Rebeka yagl gak ta ama kuglkwa we, ye Iso kagle beye ake moglko, mam ye kuglkwa. Yegl pre ye kagie Jekop<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Jekop mabuno suo paugwa. Ta, kagle beye akugwa. Ba ka i ama mabuno ta paugwa, yoba bakagl togwa.</char></note> we digwa. Aisak ye bugla yugu 60 ne kodugwa igne, Rebeka yagl gak suo i kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso komono moglkwa ba agaimo kide kodugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Ana yagl gak suo i yake kade miurka igne we, Iso taragl are ere si nedre, kugl waiwai yoba moglkrimara wan moglkwa yagle moglkwa. Ye yegl erukwa ba Jekop ye kiede moglsre, yoba sel yugu kipaimara yugomugl keme wanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Ana Aisak ye taragl are si keigwa ne, wakai prukwa pre ye Iso wakai kanugwa. Te, Rebeka we, ye Jekop wakai kanugwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Esau sells birthright" file="FM 052_Esau Sells Birthright_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" loc="25.29-34" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="25.29" />Ana aglke ta, Jekop sup ta gagl moglko, Iso kugl waiwai yoba moglkrimara wan moglsre, kidan podo kide gogl ede ikne ugwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Ye ede ikne udre, ye Jekop yegl di togwa, Na kidan podo goglka. Ene bin gogl idre, sup gaglnga i tau yubu si naro! dugwa. Yegl pre ye kagie ta Idom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Idom mabuno paugwa, gogl.</char></note> we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Ye agigle yegl di togo, Jekop di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene komono motnga pre neno goran, ene yagl kade moglsre, taraglmo mere ene inatnga. Ene againen i ta natn, sup gaglka i nenatne dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Yegl dugo, Iso aglke dugwa, Ene kano! Na gorarika. Na againana ake gi didre, na ta goglbo, againana wagle siragl eragle? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Iso yegl dugwa ba Jekop aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ene againen na naratnga pre ka giglede di nare padigln, sup tenagle dugwa. Dugo, Iso ye dumere ka giglede di te paduglkwa. Ana Iso yegl mere ye agaimo topo bogl nogo, Jekop yugwa. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Iso ka giglede di te paduglko, Jekop ye bin sup ya bret tau yubu si togo, Iso taragl i nigl bogl ame di mogl nedre, adigl ede ogwa. Ye agaimo agigle okuo togwa i pre yubun dekre, ede ogwa.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Aisak ede dumo Gerar ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Ana igne i dumo Kenan i, kidan podo yogwa. Abraham okna moglkwa igne, kidan podo yomere yegl aglke kor yogwa. Kidan podo yogwa pre Aisak ede dumo ta Gerar we dimara, Filistia yoba kipai meglmara ogwa. Dumo Gerar i, king ta sugl moglkwa, kagie Abimelek we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Aisak ede Gerar ogo, Yawe ere mogl, ye moglmara plau didre, ka yegl di togwa, Ene ede Isip pikre, na dumo ta ene di tenaglmara i moglo! <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Dumo i we, ene dumo erme motnara i pre diga. Magigl i moglo! Motn, na ene motnara mogl tedre, ene ere wakai ere tenaglka. I siragl pre na okna ene nen Abraham ka kaima di te padiglka ikra dimere ersre, dumo makan magigl i mudu ene ya ene gawanma tenaglka. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4-5" />Ene nen Abraham na kana duglo boglkwa. Na yegl ero! diga ye ersre, yegl erekro! diga ye erekre, yegl erukwa pre na ene gawanma mere kide moraiglmedi ere edenaglka. Kugl kuri mere kide keglmere, yegl mere moraiglkwa. Na yegl ere tedre, dumo makan magigl i mudu ene gawanma tenaglka. Tedre, ene gawan ta okuo morabuka ye mina yoba uglo koglo koglo yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, mudu na ere wakai ere tenagle di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Yawe yegl dugwa pre Aisak dumo Gerar kipai moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Ana Aisak dumo Gerar kipai moglko, yoba tau ye ebie kandre, Abu i, ira moglme? digwa. Yoba yegl di prikwa igne, ye kudugl goglsre, Rebeka abu wakai kaima moglkwa pre makan nem ye inamnedi ersre, na na si gogl dinaiglmedi, prisre, ye Na ebina moglme dikre, Abara moglme dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Ye ka yegl didre, dumo i ege olto kipai moglkwa. Ana Filistia yoba kingno Abimelek ikra we, ye aglke ta yugugl mogl, windo mina kan atne ede, Aisak ye Rebeka nugo kugro moglko, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Kandre, ye Aisak Wo dugo, Aisak ugwa. Aisak ugo, ye ka yegl dugwa, Nogugl paugwa, abu i ene ebin moglkwa paugwa. Yegl pre siragl eruko, ene Na abara moglme dine? di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Aisak di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta ye inagledi ersre, na si gogl dinabedi yegl pre die dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Yegl dugo, Abimelek aglke kor dugwa, Ene mabuno i siragl pre ere notne? Na yobanama meglkwa i, yagl swara ta ere mogl, ebin yuma, bogl swara ta pabra, aglau i no mudu mabuno muna, aglau enene mitna paugo we di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Yegl didre, ye yobama yegl di togwa, Yoba ta ere mogl, yagl i mo ye ebie ere kide ere tenan, nono ye ka kaima si goramniwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Ana Aisak taun Gerar i kipai moglsre, kugl mogo ere yaglkwa. Kugl mogo ere yaglkwa bugla yugu swara i mogo dogo, ye kugl mogo mere kide si yugwa. Yawe ye ere wakai ere togwa pre ye mogo swara swarade boglkwa, pare wi sugwa i, edie swara mina 100-de koglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Yawe ye ere wakai ere togo, ye taragl mere i makai si mogl, mogl, taragl mere kide kaima kan yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Ye sipsip ya meme ya kau ki mere kide kuglsre, nigl kogonmo yoba mere kide meglkwa pre Filistia yoba deno muduno u kide ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Deno muduno u kide ogo, Filistia yoba i ere mogl, Aisak nem Abraham kor moglkwa igne ye nigl kogonmo yoba maugl nigl tau perikwa i, ye makan gaba si atne ede, maugl nigl si bi digwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Si bi digo, Abimelek ere mogl, Aisak yegl di togwa, Ene yobugln podo paugwa. No yobuglno podo paikrukwa. Yegl pre ene no dumono kide kodidre, ede dumo pere ta po! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Ye yegl dugo, Aisak dumo i kide kodidre, dumo auduno ta yogwa, Gerar we dimara sel yugumo i pi kipai moglkwa.<figure style="fig" file="hk00220b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="26.17">Aisak maugl nigl mere perukwa ba makan nem yoba nonga si, mane digwa</figure><verse eid="GEN 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Ana Aisak ede dumo auduno yogwa, Gerar we dimara i pi kipadre, ye nem Abraham kor moglkwa igne, ye nigl kogonmo yoba maugl nigl tau okna perikwa ikra yomara aglke kor perukwa. Abraham goglko, Filistia yoba okuo ere mogl, makan pere si bi digwa. Yegl pre Aisak aglke kor persre, maugl nigl i kagno Abraham okna yomere aglke kor yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Ana aglke ta Aisak nigl kogonmo yoba ere mogl, dumo auduno yomara ikra maugl persre, nigl ogo ta boglkwa kanigwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Ye kanigo, Gerar yoba agl bugla sugl meglkwa yoba i ka nonga si, Nigl i no niglno moglme! digwa. Ye nonga sigwa pre Aisak ere mogl, nigl i kagie Esek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Esek mabuno paugwa, nonga.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Ana Aisak nigl kogonmo yoba maugl nigl kor ta periko, makan nem aglke kor nonga sigwa pre Aisak ere mogl, nigl i Sitna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibra mina, kagie Sitna mabuno paugwa, kigl nonga.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Ye dumo i kide kodidre, ede bage ta ogo, ye nigl kogonmo yoba aglke kor maugl nigl ta perikwa. Periko, makan nem nonga sikrikwa. Yegl pre Aisak nigl i kagie Rehobot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Rehobot mabuno paugwa, agai norukwa.</char></note> we didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Okna agai wakai ta moramga ta yekrukwa ba erme we, Yawe ake ple di noruko, agai pra yogwa. Yegl pre nono magigl i mun, nono kogonono u wakai enabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Ana okuo ye dumo i kide kodidre, ede pi dumo Berseba we dimara ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Ye Berseba ogo, ege swara i eduer Yawe ye moglmara plau didre, ka yegl di togwa, Na ene nen Abraham Godmo moluwa. Na ene motnara mogl teiga pre ene kudugl goglkro! Na Abraham ka kaima di te padiglka ikra pre na ene ere wakai ere tedre, gawanma mere kide moraiglmedi ere edenagle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Yegl dugwa pre Aisak dumo i kobuglo bogl ta kuglsre, Yawe agle di prisre, kamage ere togwa. Ye dumo i sel yugumo kipaugo, ye nigl kogonmo yagl dumo igle maugl nigl ta ama perikwa.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aisak ya Abimelek ka kaima di padiurka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Ana igne i Abimelek yogo, ye nomane togwa yagl kagie Ahusat yogo, ye ami sugl moglkwa yagl kagie Fikol yogo, ye taun Gerar i kide kodidre, ede u Aisak kanamnedi wigwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Wigo, Aisak yegl dugwa, Nono akie munga igne ene deno kubro narsre, na Ede dumo bage ta po! digwa. Ana ene erme siragl pre wime? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Aisak yegl di pruko, ye di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yawe ene motnara mogl togwa no kan pogl sumga. Yegl pre no yomun, ene yen, ka kaima di padramnedi umga. <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />No okna ene ere kide ere tekre, mabuno wakai keme ere tomga. No ama Ede po dumga igne, kuda bogl tekre, yoko Ede po dumga. No mabuno kide ta ene ere tekrumnere ene yegl ama no mabuno kide ta ere norokratnga i pre ka kaima di padramnedi prumga. Yawe erme ene ere wakai ere tomiwe digwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Yegl digo, Aisak ye yagl suota i kaya mokna nenaiglmedi podo ere togo, kaya mokna ya nigl ki akie neigwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Ne kodidre, ye ugl paigwa. Padre, kamun tagugo, ye tagna kana adiglko, Aisak ya Abimelek ka kaima di ikne ikne ede padiurka. Padiurko, Aisak, Ede pio dugo, ye deno muduno wida dugo, ede eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Ana ade swara i mina Aisak nigl kogonmo yoba u, yegl di teigwa, No maugl nigl perumga ikra we, nigl atne moglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Yegl digwa pre Aisak maugl nigl i kagie Siba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Siba mabuno paugwa, ka kaima di te padiglkwa.</char></note> we dugwa. Yegl pre taun ta dumo i yogwa, erme ama yoba Berseba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Berseba mabuno paugwa, ka kaima di te padiglkwa niglmo.</char></note> we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso ebie suo kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Ana Aisak wam Iso we, ye bugla yugu 40 nogwa igne, abu suo yugwa. Ta kagie Judit we digwa. Ye Hit yoba ta Beri we digwa abuglo moglkwa. Te, ye ebie ta kagie Basemat we digwa. Ye Hit yoba ta Elon we digwa abuglo moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Aisak ya Rebeka ye abu suo i kide kanibrika. Yegl pre deno muduno yubun dogwa.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Jekop ye nem bakagl togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Ana Aisak kidagl kaima yogo, gumuglo kin yogwa. Yegl eruko, ye aglke ta wam komono Iso agle dugo, ugwa. Iso ugo, Aisak Wana yo dugo, Iso di ikne ede, We, na mogliwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Yegl dugo, Aisak ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene pro. Na kidagl kaima yeiga. Na aunake goraglka prikrika. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Yegl pre ene kibr yer idre, ede pi taragl are ere si yu, <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />gagl naratnedi prika. Mie wam dogon erabuka na nedre, wakai praglka mere yegl gagl natn, na nebo, ene di wakai yei tenaglka. Na ene di wakai yei tedre, okuo goraluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Ana Aisak ye Iso ka yegl di togo, Rebeka pre moglkwa. Pre moglkwa pre Iso ede kugl waiwai yomara taragl are ere si yunagledi ogo, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Rebeka ye wam Jekop yegl di togwa, Ene pro. Ene nen ere mogl, agitn komono Iso ka ta di togo, pre moglka. Ye yegl di togwa, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />Ene ede pi taragl are si yudre, mie dogon erukwa gagl naratnedi prika. Gagl natn, na nedre, Yawe gumuglo wagle ene di wakai yei tedre, okuo goragle di, yegl di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Yegl pre na erme ene ka ta di tebo, ene prisre, na dinaglmere eratnga. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Ene ede pi nono meme ya sipsip kunga meglmara pidre, meme nagigle wakai suo si gogl, yu naro! Si gogl, yu natn, na mie wam dogon erabuka nen kidagl nedre, wakai prabuka mere yegl garaglka. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Na gaglbo, denan, ene i pi nen kidagl tenatnga. Ene i pi ten, ye nedre, Iso di wakai yei tenabuka ikra ene di tedre, okuo gorabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Rebeka yegl dugo, Jekop di ikne ede, ye mam yegl di togwa, Ene pro! Na agra komono Iso nagie yugo podo sugo, na nagna yugo sikrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Yegl pre nina kidagl ta ere mogl, na ake pran, ye Jekop na bakagl narumedi, yegl di prabuka. Yegl di prisre, ye na di wakai yei narekre, di kide yei narabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Jekop yegl dugwa ba ye mam ere mogl, di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Wana yo, ye ene ta di kide yei tenan, ene inatnere na inaglka. Ene na dimere keme eratnga. Meme nagigle suo pre diga ikra dimere pi si gogl, yuo! dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Jekop mam yegl dugwa pre ye pi meme nagigle suo si gogl, yu mam togwa. Mam togo, Rebeka mie wam gaglkwa, dogon erukwa. Aisak nedre, wakai prabuka mere yegl gaglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Yegl gaglsre, ye Iso kuguglmo gaglmo tau Rebeka yugumo yugugl yogwa i yu ye wam okuo Jekop ede togwa. Kugugl gagl i, Iso kugugl gagl dimede edenagledi prukwa igne edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Jekop mam ye kugugl gagl i ede tedre, meme nagigle suo nagino kugl yaurukwa idre, Jekop ogo mina ya nugu mina nagie yugo sikrumara padigl togwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Padigl tedre, ye meme mie dogon erukwa gaglkwa i Jekop tedre, bret tau ama gaglkwa i tedre, erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Ana Jekop kaya mokna ikra i ede pi nem moglmara pidre, Nina yo dugwa. Dugo, Aisak Na mogliwe dugwa. Didre, ye ere mogl, Ene na wana komono uno mo wana okuo une? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yegl dugo, Jekop di ikne ede, nem yegl di togwa, Na ene wan komono Iso moglka. Ene di natnere ikra erika. Ene ugl panga kodo, adigl mogl, siragl are mie wam ikra yuiga i nedre, na di wakai yei naratniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Ana Jekop yegl dugo, ye nem Aisak ere mogl, yegl di prukwa, Wana yo, ene siragl mere tabre si yune? dugwa. Dugo, Jekop di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene Godnen Yawe ye ake ple di narukwa pre tabre si yuiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Yegl dugo, Aisak ere mogl, Wana yo, ene magigl wo! dugwa. Na ene ake pribo, ene ka kaima Iso motno mo i praluwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yegl dugwa pre Jekop ede nem moglmara magigl ogo, Aisak ye ake prisre, yegl dugwa, Ene nugun Jekop nugu mere yegl prika ba ene ogn ake prika, Iso ogo mere yegl prie dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Jekop mam ye meme nagino yugo ogo mina padigl togwa pre ye nem ake prukwa igne, Iso nagie yugo podo sumere yegl mere sugo, prukwa. Yegl pre ye Jekop moglmedi prikre, Iso moglmedi prisre, di wakai yei tenagledi erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Di wakai yei tenagledi erukwa ba ye aglke kor di prukwa, Ene ka kaima na wana Iso motno? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jekop Na Iso moluwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Jekop yegl dugwa pre ye nem Aisak ere mogl, Ene siragl are mie wam gaglnga i yu naro dugwa. Na nedre, ene di wakai yei tenagle di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jekop ye meme mie wam i tedre, wain nuglo suru tedre, eruko, nem kidagl nogwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Nem kidagl nedre, yegl dugwa, Na wana yo, ene magigl ya u, paunana si no dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Dugo, Jekop magigl pi, pauna si nogo, Jekop ye Iso kuguglmo gaglmo edugwa i, Aisak ye Iso nagie demene orukwa mere prisre, Na wana Iso kaima moglme di prisre, di wakai yei te, yegl dugwa, Aya, na wana nagie demene orukwa i, yoba kaya mokna ere yaiglmara, Yawe makan gaba ake wakai ere togwa demene erumere yegl mere erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Ana na wana yo, God heven ibo moglkwa ene kaya mokna ere yaratnara waradarua erabedi ere tedre, makan gaba nuglo podo morabedi ere tedre, erabiwa. Yegl erse, ene kugl mogo ere yaratnga ya ede wain ere yaratnga i mere kide koraiglmedi ere edenabiwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Te, yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa bitno magide ene ya ene gawanma tedre, ene ya ene gawanma ye kogono ere tenaiglmiwa. Te, ene agiglnma sugl motn, ye ama bitno magide ene tenaiglmiwa. Yoba ta ere mogl, ene di kide yei tebi, yene u kide enaiglmiwa. Te, yoba ta ere mogl, ene di wakai yei tebi, ye u wakai enaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Ana Aisak ye Jekop di wakai yei togo, Jekop ede ogo, igne i keme ye agigle Iso taragl are ere sugwa i, i ede ugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Ye i ede ikne udre, ye ama mie wam dogon erabedi gaglsre, i pi nem kidagl moglmara ogwa. I pi nem kidagl moglmara pidre, ye yegl dugwa, Nina yo, ene ugl panga kodo, adigl mogl, siragl are mie wam yuiga i nedre, na di wakai yei naratniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Yegl dugo, ye nem Aisak ere mogl, Ene ira une? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Iso di ikne ede, nem yegl di togwa, Na ene wan komono Iso moluwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Iso ka yegl dugwa pre Aisak ogo gagie nuglo podo didre, yegl dugwa, Ene Iso motnga pre ira taragl are si yu, gagl narume? Ene ukitnga igne, na mie wam yugwa i nedre, ye di wakai yei teiga. Ye ka kaima u wakai enabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Aisak ka yegl dugo, Iso kamo i prisre, kai podo erukwa. Ye kai podo ersre, nem yegl di togwa, Nina yo, ene na ama di wakai yei naro! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Yegl dugwa ba Aisak di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Ene agitn u, ka kibi di narukwa. Ka kibi di naruko, na ene di wakai yei tenaglka ikra, ye di wakai yei teigo, ye i ede ome dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Ana Iso ere mogl, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ye kagie Jekop we digwa kuno erukwa. Ye ege suo na bakagl narukwa. Ege ta, na komono moglka againa i yugwa. Te, erme ene di wakai yei naratnga i, ye di wakai yei tengo, i ede ogwa. Ene di wakai yei naratnga i, ka swara ta na pre pai moglkrumo? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Iso yegl di prukwa ba Aisak di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene pro, ye ene bitn mere yegl morabiwe didre, yoba bormai swara mudu ye ye kogonmo ere tenaiglmiwe diga. Te, na ama ye kugl mogo ya ede wain ere yarabuka i mere kide koraiglmiwe diga. Yegl pre na ene ka ta siragl mere di wakai yei tenagle? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Dugo, Iso ye nem kidagl aglke kor di prukwa, Ene di wakai yei naratnga ka swara yegl keme pamo? Ene na ama di wakai yei naro! dugwa. Yegl didre, ye aglke kor kai erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Iso ka yegl dugo, ye nem kidagl Aisak ere mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Ene kipanatnara we, makan gaba nuglo podo moglkran, God waradarua erabedi erekrabiwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Ene ere mogl, yoba kuda bogl tedre, taraglno idre, kor moratnga. Te, agitn kogonmo ere tenatniwa. Ere tenatnga ba okuo ene kide prisre, mogl pere edin, ye ene sugl moglkrabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Ana Aisak ye Iso di wakai yei tekre, Jekop di wakai yei togwa i pre Iso ye Jekop dem kubro tedre, yegl kina gudu prukwa, Na nina kidagl gorabuka magigl erukwa. Ye goran, gaba buko dumun, na agra Jekop si goragle di, yegl kina gudu prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Yegl kina gudu prisre, ye ka tau ama yegl mere dugo, yoba tau prisre, ede u Rebeka di teigwa. Di teigo, Rebeka ere mogl, yoba ta dede, ye wam okuo Jekop dedenan unabedi dedugwa. Dedugo, pi di togo, Jekop ugwa. Ugo, Rebeka ye yegl di togwa, Ene agitn Iso bakagl tenga pre ye dem kubrukwa. Ye, Na agra si goglbo, dena muduna aragan erabe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Yegl pre na ka ta dinarika ene duglo boratnga. Ene teke ede pi na agra Laban dumo Haran moglmara enatnga. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Ene agitn erme dem podo kubrukwa ba ene dumo i ege tau motn, dem muduo aragan erabuka. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Ye ene bakagl tenga i kina torua sidre, dem muduo aragan eran, na yoba ta dedibo, u ene di tenabuka. Di tenan, ene ede ikne unatnga. Ta manan, ene suo akie ege swara igne giur, na wana ta moglkraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aisak Jekop dedugo, ye ede bawamo Laban moglmara ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Ana Rebeka ere mogl, wie kidagl Aisak yegl di togwa, Iso ye Hit abu suo yugwa i kide kaima kaniga pre kor moglka kide prika. Jekop ama ta ere mogl, Hit abu yegl mere ta yunan, na goragledi prie di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Ana Rebeka ka yegl dugwa pre Aisak ere mogl, Jekop wo! dugo, ugwa. Jekop ugo, nem di wakai yei tedre, ka kidine ama yegl di togwa, Ene Kenan abu ta ikratniwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Ene ede dumo makan Mesopotemia, man nem kidagl Betuel kipamara enatnga. Ene en, ene man agigle Laban ama morabuka. Ye abuglo ta inatniwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />God Yobuglo Podo Paugwa ene ere wakai ere tedre, gawanma mere kide moraiglmedi ere edenabiwa. Ere edenan, mere kide meglbi, ye yugobuno pere pere akie moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Te, God okna ye Abraham ka kaima di te paduglmere ikra ene ya ene gawanma ere tenabiwa. Ere tenan, ene ya ene gawanma makan magigl i inaiglmiwa. Makan magigl i erme ene kipai motnga ba makanen kaima yekrukwa. Yegl erukwa ba God okna ibo Abraham togwa pre ene ya ene gawanma inaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Aisak ka yegl didre, ye Jekop dedugo, Jekop ede dumo makan Mesopotemia ikra, bawamo Laban moglmara enagledi ogwa. Rebeka ye Jekop ya Iso mano moglko, Laban Rebeka agigle moglkwa. Te, Laban we, ye Aram yagl Betuel ikra wam moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso abu ta ama yugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Ana Aisak ye Jekop di wakai yei tedre, ede dumo Mesopotemia pi abai ta inabedi dedugwa i, Iso prukwa. Te, Aisak ye igne i ama Jekop di te, Kenan abu ta ikratniwe dugwa i prisre, <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Jekop ye nem mam kano prisre, ede dumo Mesopotemia enagledi ogwa i, Iso ama prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Yegl pre Iso ere mogl, Na nina Aisak Kenan abu kide kanugwa pamiwe di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Yegl di prisre, ye Abraham wam Ismael ikra moglmara pidre, abuglo ta namba 3 abu morabedi yugwa. Abu i, kagie Mahalat we digwa. Te, Mahalat agigle ta moglkwa, kagie Nebaiot we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jekop ugl kubu ta kanugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jacob's ladder" file="FM 053 Jacob's Ladder_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="28.10" />Ana Jekop we, ye ede dumo Mesopotemia enagledi ogwa igne, ye dumo Berseba kipai moglmara i, kide kodidre, ede Mesopotemia, dumo kebra ta Haran we dimara, enagledi konbauna ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Ye pi moglsre, ege ta ye konbauna ogo, ade beigwa. Ade beigwa pre ye dumo ta omara i meda ugl paugwa. Ye kobuglo ta idre, ede iko mere yei, ugl paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Ye ugl padre, ugl kubu ta kanugwa. Ugl kubu i mina ye lata ta kanugwa. Lata i, ikne makan gaba mina yogo, ikne ede heven ibo ogwa. Lata yegl yogo, God angeloma ede kuglo pi, ede atne u, ere meglkwa kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Te, lata pi heven ibo sige yomara i we, Yawe adigl moglsre, ugl kubu mina Jekop yegl di togwa, Na Yawe moluwa. Na ene yagl awan Abraham Godmo moglsre, nen Aisak Godmo moglka. Ene ugl panara makan magigl i, ene ya ene gawanma tenaglka. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Te, ene gawanma pi kaugl mere yegl mere kide moraiglkwa. Mere kide meglbi, tau ede ade umara ebi, tau ede ade beimara ebi, tau ede nigl bre ebi, tau ede nigl beye ebi, bage bage yegl pi, kipai moraiglkwa. Te, ene ya ene gawan i mina na yoba yugobuno pere pere uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ere wakai ere tenaglka. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Ana ene pro! Na ene enatnara akie pidre, ene sugl moraglka. Bage ta enatnara ene sugl moglsre, okuo na ene auro i ede u dumo magigl i aglke kor edenaglka. Na ene kide kodokre, erme ka di padiglmere keme eragle di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Ana Jekop adiglsre, yegl dugwa, Yawe kaima dumo magigl i moglkwa ba na okna kankriwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Te, ye kudugl goglsre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na igle moglka kudugl goluwa! Dumo magigl i God kipamara mere yegl yogwa. Te, dumo i ama heven ibo duamo mere yegl yomiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Ana Jekop ka yegl didre, ye aglke kor ugl padre, tagna kana aduglkwa. Ye tagna kana adiglsre, kobuglo ta ede iko yogwa ikra bodugl padiglsre, kugo nuglo tau toide kobuglo bolamugl edugwa. Ye Dumo igle Yawe na moglmara ume di, aimadi pre morabuka pre yegl erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Yegl ersre, ye dumo i kagie Betel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Betel i mabuno ta paugwa, God kipamara.</char></note> we dugwa. Taun ta dumo magigl i yogwa okna Lus we digwa ba Jekop kagie kor yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20-21" />Ana Jekop kagie kor yedre, ye God ka kaima di te padigl, yegl dugwa, Yawe yo, na erme dumo eglke ta enaglka i, ene na enaglmara akie pi, na sugl moglsre, te kaya mokna ya kugugl gagl ta natn, na wakai wan mogl aglke ede ikne nina kipamara ebo, ene na Godna moratniwa. <verse eid="GEN 28:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Te, na kobuglo ta magigl i bodugl padiglka i, na kandre, dumo magigl i, God kipamara mere yegl yomedi praglka. Te, ene taragl tau naratnga we, na ka kaima yubu si bage 10-pela edidre, bage swara ta ene te ikne edinaluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Jekop ede Laban moglmara pi plau dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Ana Jekop ye dumo Betel ikra kide kodo, konbauna ede pi yoba ade umara kipai meglmara ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Pi plau didre, ye maugl nigl ta kanugwa. Maugl nigl i, taun bina yoba kipai moglkrimara moglkwa. Maugl nigl dra mina kobuglo paglkane podo ta tebe si kegl digwa. Jekop ye maugl nigl i kandre, ye ama kanugwa, sipsip bage suota makai si mogl, ogono kaglno bodugl magigl pai mogl, nigl nenamnedi sugl meglkwa. I siragl pre sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba ege ege sipsip kiglkwa mudu yu, maugl nigl i mina nigl kogl teigwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Ege ege yoba pere pere sipsipno yu makai sidre, mudu meglkwa igne ye kobuglo ikra ake nu si eglke ede, maugl dra yaurikwa. Yaursre, sipsipno nigl kogl tedre, kobuglo ake nu si ikne ede padigl, maugl dra si kegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Ana Jekop ye sipsip sugl meglkwa yagl meglmara pidre, yegl di prukwa, Agrama wagle, ene aglo kipaime? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, No dumo Haran ki pamne digwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Yegl digo, Jekop ere mogl, Ene yagl ta kagie Laban we digwa, Nahor gawamo moglkwa i, ene ta pre kan erimo? yegl di prukwa. Di pruko, ye di ikne ede, Owo, no pre kan erumne digwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Te, Jekop ama di prukwa, Ye wakai moglmo? dugo, Ye wakai moglme digwa. Yegl didre, sipsip sugl meglkwa yagl i ere mogl, yegl digwa, Yagl i abuglo Resel erme sipsipmo yugwa iro, kano! di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Ana Jekop ere mogl, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene prio! Erme min paikrukwa. Sipsip togl suna edenaiglkwa egemo yekrukwa. Ene oglade nigl kogl tedre, sipsip i pi, kugl moglmara edibi, kugl ne moraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Yegl dugo, sipsip sugl meglkwa yagl i di ikne ede, yegl digwa, No yegl ta erekramga. No sugl mun, yoba mudu sipsipno yuibi, no kobuglo ake nu si eglke ede, maugl dra yaursre, nigl kogl sipsipno tenamne digwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Jekop ya sipsip sugl meglkwa yagl i ka di meglko, Resel ye nem sipsipmo idi magigl ugwa. Ye sipsip sugl moglkwa abai moglkwa pre yugwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Resel, ye Jekop mam agigle Laban abuglo i, sipsip idi magigl ugo, Jekop ye kandre, ye ede maugl nigl moglmara pi, kobuglo ake nu si eglke ede, maugl dra yaursre, ye bawamo Laban sipsipmo nigl kogl togwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Sipsip nigl kogl tedre, ye Resel pauna si nedre, kai erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Ye kai ersre, Resel yegl di togwa, Na mana Rebeka ye ene nen abauglo moglme dugwa. Yegl dugo, Resel muku di ede pi nem moglmara pidre, ye nem di togwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Ana Resel ye nem di te, Ene abatn wam ta kagie Jekop we digwa umiwe dugo, Laban muku di ede pi Jekop moglmara tegigl yenabugledi ogwa. Ye moglmara pidre, nugu kugro, pauna si nedre, agre i ede pi ye kipamara ogwa. Ye akie ede Laban kipamara ebriko, Jekop ere mogl, ye moglmara siragl taragl plau dugwa i mudu Laban di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Di togo, Laban ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Aya, nono kaima bormai swara muluwe di, yegl dugwa. Ana ka i di kodibriko, Jekop ye ba swara mere bawamo Laban kipamara pai moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jekop ye Lea ya Resel Yugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Jekop ye Laban kipamara ba swara mogl kodugo, Laban ere mogl, Jekop yegl di togwa, Nono bormai swara muglka ba ene kogon yoko ere natnga i, kuno erekrumiwe dugwa. Yegl didre, ye di prukwa, Ene topo siramna mere inagledi pitne? dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Ana Laban abuglo suo miurka. Ye abuglo komono kagie Lea we digwa. Te, Resel ye Laban abuglo okuo moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea gumuglo wakai koglkwa ba Resel ye abai wakai kaima moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Jekop ye abai Resel wakai kaima kanugwa pre ye ere mogl, di ikne ede, bawamo Laban yegl di togwa, Na bugla yugu 7-pela ene kogonen ere te kodidre, ene abutn okuo Resel na inagledi prie dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Ana Jekop yegl dugo, Laban di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na abra i, yoba pere tekre, ene tebo, i wakai panabuka. Yegl pre pra, ene na kipaimara moglo! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Yegl dugwa pre Jekop ye Resel inagledi bugla yugu 7-pela Laban kogonmo ere togwa ba Resel ye muduo suna moglkwa pre ye bugla yugu 7-pela i taragl kebra, 3-pela de mo 4-pela de mere yegl yomedi kanugwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Ana Jekop bugla yugu 7-pela kogon ere te kodugwa igne, ye ere mogl, Laban yegl di togwa, Na bugla yugu 7-pela ikra ene kogonen ere te kodiga. Yegl pre ene erme Resel natn, no yagl abu morabugle di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Yegl dugo, Laban yoba magigl kipai meglkwa i mudu Wio! didre, ye kaya mokna podo ere keigo, yoba magigl kipaigwa i, u neigwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Ye ne meglkwa, mim eruko, Laban ere mogl, Resel yu tekre, Lea yu Jekop togo, ye bogl swara pabrika. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Te, Laban ama nigl kogonmo abai ta Lea nigl kogonmo ere tenabedi Lea togwa. Abai i, kagie Silpa we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Ana Jekop ya Lea bogl swara pabriko, Jekop tagna kana adiglsre, ye Lea moglko, kandre, wai kuglkwa. Wai kuglsre, ye ede pi Laban yegl di prukwa, Siragl eruko, ene mabuno yegl ere natne? Na Resel inagledi ene kogonen ere teiga ikra we! Ene siragl pre bakagl natne? dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Ana Laban ere mogl, di ikne ede, Jekop yegl di togwa, Magigl i mabuno pere ta paugwa. No komono kana abro komono yagl tomga. Te kodumga igne pra, abro okuo yagl okuo tenamga. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Erme yoba wakan swara mere kaya mokna keiga i ne moraiglkwa. Ene wakan swara i kan motn, dudinan, no Resel ama ene tenamga. Tomun, ene aglke kor bugla yugu 7-pela kogon ere naratniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Ana Jekop ye Laban dumere Prawa didre, wakan swara i kan moglkwa. Kan moglkwa, dudugo, Laban abuglo Resel ama togo, Jekop yugwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Te, Laban ama nigl kogonmo abai ta Resel nigl kogonmo ere tenabedi Resel togwa. Abai i, kagie Bilha we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Ana Jekop ye Resel ama yugo, bogl swara pabrika. Jekop ye abu suo yugo, Resel ye muduo suna moglkwa ba Lea ye muduo suna moglkrukwa. Yegl eruko, Jekop aglke kor bugla yugu 7-pela Laban kogonmo ere togwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jekop gagiglma kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Ana Lea ye Jekop muduo suna moglkrukwa i Yawe kanugwa. Kandre, ye Lea gak kurabedi ere edugwa ba Resel ye temne paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Yawe ye Lea gak kurabedi ere edugo, Lea dane paugo, ye ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa. Kuglsre, ye yegl dugwa, Na dena muduna yubun dogwa i, Yawe kandre, na ake ple di narukwa pre yagl gak ta kuglka. Erme na wina na wakai kanabiwe di, yegl didre, ye kagie Ruben<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Ruben ya te, kanugwa i magigl magigl pabrika. </char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Ana okuo Lea aglke kor dane paugo, yagl gak ta ama kuglkwa. Kuglsre, ye yegl dugwa, Na wina na wakai kankrukwa i, Yawe prukwa pre yagl gak i ama narume di, yegl didre, kagie Simeon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Simeon ya te, prukwa i magigl magigl pabrika.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Te, ye okuo aglke kor dane paugo, yagl gak ta ama kuglkwa. Kuglsre, ye yegl dugwa, Na erme wina wam namba 3 kuglka pre ye na swara wakai kanan, na ye bogl si dakagl morabugle di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre yagl gak i, ye kagie Livai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Livai ya te, dakaglkwa i magigl magigl pabrika.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Te, Lea okuo aglke kor dane paugo, yagl gak ta ama kuglkwa. Kuglsre, ye yegl dugwa, Erme na Yawe debie sinaluwe dugwa. Yegl pre yagl gak i, kagie Juda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Juda ya te debie sugwa i magigl magigl pabrika.</char></note> we dugwa. Ye Juda kuglsre, okuo ye ege olto yoko mogl, gak ta kuglkrukwa.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Ana Resel ye gak ta kuglkriedi kandre, ye abauglo komono kide pre togwa. Kide pre tedre, ye ere mogl, wie Jekop yegl di togwa, Ene we, ene gak ta natn, kuraglka. Na ta kuglkribo, goraluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Resel yegl dugo, Jekop dem boglko, yegl dugwa, Na God moglmedi pitno? God yene gak ta ene tekrukwa pre kuglkitne dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Yegl dugo, Resel ere mogl, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ana na nigl kogona abai Bilha i, ene yo! Ene in, bogl swara pabr, ye gak ta kuran, nana inaglka. Yegl mere kugl nare miur, na gagrama tau ama moraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Ye yegl didre, ye nigl kogonmo abai Bilha ikra i pi Jekop ebie ta morabedi togo, ye bogl swara pabrika. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Bogl swara pabriko, Bilha dane paugo, ye ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Yagl gak ta kuglko, Resel yegl dugwa, God na kotna pre yubu sugwa i, na aglau ta erekitne dugwa. God yegl didre, ye ama na kamage ere teiga i prisre, yagl gak ta narume di, yegl dugwa. Yegl pre yagl gak i, ye kagie Dan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Dan i, mabuno ka pre yubu sugwa paugwa.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Ana Resel nigl kogonmo abu Bilha i aglke kor dane paugo, ere mogl, yagl gak ta ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Ye yagl gak ta ama kuglko, Resel yegl dugwa, Na abara komono kuda podo bogl teiga mere yegl ersre, yobuglo erie di, yegl dugwa. Yegl pre ye yagl gak i, kagie Naptali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Naptali i, mabuno na kuda boglka mere yegl paugwa.</char></note> we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Ana Lea we, ye yagl gak 4-pela ikra kuglsre, gak kor ta kuglkriedi kandre, ye nigl kogonmo abai Silpa ikra i pi Jekop ebie ta morabedi togwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Jekop togo, ye bogl swara pabriko, Silpa dane paugo, ye ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Kuglko, Lea yegl dugwa, Taragl wakai ta plau dumiwe dugwa. Yegl pre ye yagl gak i kagie Gat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Gat i, mabuno taragl wakai ta plau dugwa mere yegl paugwa.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Ana Lea nigl kogonmo abu Silpa i aglke kor dane paugo, ye ere mogl, yagl gak ta ama kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Ye yagl gak ta ama kuglko, Lea yegl dugwa, Na gun yeiga. Erme abu tau ere mogl, Lea gun yome dinaiglmiwe dugwa. Yegl pre ye yagl gak i kagie Aser<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Aser i, mabuno gun yogwa.</char></note> we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Ana aglke ta kugl mogo wit sigwa egemo yogwa igne, Lea wam Ruben ede wit ere yaiglmara pi, wan mogl, kugl kie ta kagie mandrek we digwa, yoba idre krai gaiglkwa i kandre, mogomo uro yu, mam Lea togwa. Ye Lea togo, Resel ere mogl, Lea yegl di prukwa, Ene wan mandrek mogo uro yugwa i, tau naratn ba, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Yegl dugo, Lea di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Ene na wina i pi inga i, taragl kebra yomedi pitno? Ene na wina idre, na wana mandrek mogo uro yugwa ama idre, yegl eratno? dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre Resel aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ana pra. Ene wan kugl mogo uro yugwa i natn, erme eduer ene Jekop bogl panabriwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Resel yegl dugwa pre Jekop wit simara kogon ere wan moglsre, min paugwa igne ede ikne ugo, Lea ede pi ye umara pidre, ye yegl di togwa, Na wana kugl mandrek mogo tau uro yugwa. Nono bogl swara panabuglka pre mogo i na Resel topo teiga. Yegl pre erme u na kana panatniwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye ugo, eduer bogl swara pabrika. <verse eid="GEN 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Bogl swara pabriko, God ye Lea kamage ere togwa prisre, ye ake ple di togo, Lea dane paugo, ye ere mogl, yagl gak namba 5 kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Lea yagl gak namba 5 kuglsre, yegl dugwa, Na nigl kogona abu ikra wina teiga pre God topona narumiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl pre ye yagl gak i kagie Isakar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Isakar i, mabuno topo.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Te, okuo Lea aglke kor dane paugo, ye ere mogl, yagl gak namba 6 kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Ye yagl gak namba 6 kuglsre, yegl dugwa, God na taragl wakai ere narukwa. Erme na wina yagl gak 6-pela kugl teiga pre ye na kagna kade narabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl pre ye yagl gak i kagie Sebulun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Sebulun i, mabuno kagie kade togwa.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Te, okuo Lea abai gak ta ama kuglkwa, kagie Daina we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Ana God ye Resel kamage ere togwa prisre, ye gak ta kurabedi ake ple di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Ake ple di togo, dane paugo, ye ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglkwa. Ye yagl gak ta kuglsre, yegl dugwa, God na ake ple di narukwa pre na okna gak ta kuglkre, agai goglka i, erme agai ta goglkraluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Yegl didre, ye ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Yawe na yagl gak ta ama narabedi prie dugwa. Yegl didre, ye yagl gak i kagie Josep<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Josep i, mabuno, ta ama narabiwa.</char></note> we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jekop sipsip ya meme tau inagle dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Ana Resel ye Josep kugl kodugo, Jekop ere mogl, Laban yegl di togwa, Na erme ede ikne dumona kamina enagledi prika. Ene dedin, na ede enaglka. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Na ene kogonen ere teiga i, ebina suo topo si kodiga pre na ebina gagrama idre, ede enagledi prika. Na kogon wakai ere teiga i, ene pre kan etnga. Yegl pre ene na dedin, na ede enaluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Ana Jekop ka yegl dugo, Laban ere mogl, di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Aya, ene motnga wakai ta pitn, moratniwa. Na kumo giai yagl ta eruko, kaniga, ene na kipaimara motnga pre Yawe na ere wakai ere narukwa, yegl kaniga. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Yegl pre na topo siramna ene tebo, ene na kipaimara moglsre, kogon ere naratne? Dinatnere tenaluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Dugo, Jekop aglke kor yegl dugwa, Na kogon wakai ene ere teiga i enene pre kan etnga. Taragl ere kuglnga i, na sugl wakai moglko, ye wakai meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Na magigl i wiga igne, ene taragl mere kuglkitnga ba erme taragl kuglnga i, u mere kide pi meglkwa. Na kogon kane kane ene ere teimara i, Yawe ene ere wakai ere togwa. Ba erme we, nana ebina gagrama bakaraglka pamiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Yegl dugo, Laban di ikne ede, Na topo siramna mere ene tenagle? dugwa. Dugo, Jekop aglke kor dugwa, Na mige ta narekratnga ba na ka ta dibo, ene prawa din, na ene sipsipnen ya memenen sugl mogl, pai moraglka. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Yegl pre diga, ene prawa din, na erme sipsipnen ya memenen mudu yubu sinaglka. Sipsip tau kruo kama suna suna meglkwa ya te, sipsip nagigle kama meglkwa i, nana inaglka. Te, meme tau kruo kama suna suna meglkwa i ama nana inaglka. Na topo yegl inagledi prika.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sipsip tau mere kruo meglko, swara swarade keme kama meglkwa. Te, dumo i, meme mere kama keme meglko, swara swarade keme kruo kama suna suna paigwa. Yegl pre Jekop sipsip ya meme suom ta inagle dugwa.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Topo yegl ta natn, na mabuno wakai boraglka i, okuo nogugl panabuka. Na taraglna ere kuraglmara ene kanagledi un, meme tau kruo kama suna suna paikrikwa ta meglbi, mo sipsip nagigle tau kama moglkre, kruo ta meglbi, Jekop kunogl yumedi nogugl panan, kanatniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Jekop ka yegl di kodugo, Laban di ikne ede, Prawa. Ene dinere yegl mere erabugle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Yegl dugwa ba ye dumere erekre, ade swara i mina yene meme tau kruo kama suna suna meglkwa ikra i pere ede, sipsip kama ikra i pere ede, erukwa. Ersre, Laban yene wama kuraiglmedi togwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Togo, ye wama bogl meme ya sipsip i idre, Jekop moglmara eglke moramnedi ede eigwa. Ye ege suota konbauna pi mogl, ede pi eglke kuri ta meglkwa. Meglko, Jekop ere mogl, Laban mememo ya sipsipmo tau meglkwa i sugl moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Ana Jekop ere mogl, ede kane suota paigwa, poplar ya almon ya plen we digwa i, yogagle tau bagl, nagie suna suna pogl edugwa. Pogl edumara i, ede kruo paugo, nagie pai moglmara i kama paugwa pre yogagle i kruo kama suna suna paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Yegl ersre, ye ede yogagle i, sipsip ya meme baglkugl nigl neimara i nigl mina atne yogwa. Sipsip ya meme nigl neigwa igne du akigwa pre yegl erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Jekop ede yogagle ikra baglkugl mina atne edugo, sipsip ya meme yogagle i yomara magigl i du akidre, okuo gagro kiglkwa i, kruo kama suna suna meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Ana sipsip ya meme gagro i, Jekop yene kuragledi i pere edugwa. Laban sipsipmo ya mememo meglmara edekrukwa. I pere edidre, sipsip ya meme tau Laban pre kanige eruko, meglkwa i du akigwa igne, ye kan Laban sipsipmo tau kama meglkwa i ya mememo tau kruo kama suna suna paigwa i, meglmara ede moglsre, du akenaiglmedi erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Te, sipsip ya meme tau yobuglno podo paugwa du akenaiglkwa igne, Jekop ede yogagle ikra baglkugl mina nigl mina atne ye kanaiglmedi yogwa. Sipsip ya meme i ede yogagle ikra yomara magigl i du akenaiglkwa pre erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Ba sipsip ya meme tau yobuglno paikrukwa du akenaiglkwa i we, Jekop ede yogagle ikra yekrukwa. Yegl pre sipsip ya meme tau yobuglno paikrukwa gagro kiglkwa i, Laban pre meglkwa. Ba sipsip ya meme tau yobuglno paugwa gagro kiglkwa i, Jekop pre meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Yegl pre Jekop taragl mere tabre kan nogwa. Kan nedre, ye sipsip ya meme mere kide kuglsre, kamel ya donki ama kuglsre, nigl kogonmo yagl abu ama yugwa.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Jekop Laban moglmara kide kodidre, teke ede ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Ana okuo Laban wama ere mogl, yegl digwa, Jekop we, ye neno taraglmo mudu yugwa. No neno taraglmo idre, erme ye taragl mere kan yomiwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl digo, yoba tau prisre, Jekop di teigwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Te, Jekop kanugwa, Laban okna ka wakai dumere erme dikre, yakebude Jekop togwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Ye yegl eruko, Jekop kanugo, Yawe ere mogl, Jekop yegl di togwa, Ene ede ikne nen agiglnma dumono kamino po! Ene en, na ene enatnara akie pidre, ene sugl moraluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Yawe yegl dugwa pre Jekop ere mogl, Resel ya Lea agle dugo, ye ede u Jekop sipsip ya meme kuglmara ubrika. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Ye ubriko, Jekop ye yegl di togwa, Na kaniga, ene neno okna ka wakai dumere dikre, yakebude narukwa. Yegl erukwa ba na nina Godmo na moglmara mogl narsre, na ake ple di narukwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Na yobuglo ere, ene neno kogon wakai ere teiga i, enene pre kan eribrika. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Yegl erika ba ye ege 10-pela taim topo naragle dumere narekre, na bakagl mere nare, topo kuri keme narukwa. Ene neno Laban yegl erukwa ba Laban na ere kide ere naragledi erukwa i, God kanige erekre, ake ple di narukwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Laban ege tau dugwa, Meme kruo kama suna suna paigwa i, ene mudu ikre, kruo kebra kebra suna paigwa i keme inatniwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, meme gagro kruo kebra kebra suna paigwa i keme kiglkwa. Te, ye ege tau dugwa, Meme kruo kama suna suna paigwa i, ene mudu ikre, kruo olto suna paigwa i keme inatniwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, meme gagro kruo olto suna paigwa i keme kiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />God yegl ere, ene neno kidagl aglmo buglamo idre, na narukwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />Ana na we, aglke ta sipsip ya meme du akigwa igne, na ugl pai, kubu ta kaniga, meme kumugl kruo kama suna suna paigwa i keme du akigwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Na yegl kanigo, kubu kanimara i God angelomo ye Jekop yo dugo, na Mogliwe diga. <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Na yegl digo, ye yegl di narukwa, Meme kumugl kruo kama suna suna paigwa i keme du akigwa i kano! I siragl pre na Laban mabuno kide ene ere tenagledi erukwa i kandre, ene ake ple di teiga. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Na God moglka. Na okna dumo Betel we dinara i, ene motnara wigo, ene kobuglo bodugl padiglsre, kugo nuglo toide bolamugl edidre, ka kaima di nare padiglnga. Na God i moglka. Ana erme we, ene dumo magigl i kide kodidre, ede pi enene dumon kaminen po! God angelomo yegl dumiwe di, Jekop yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Jekop ka yegl dugo, Resel ya Lea di ikne ede, Pra we dibrika. Neno goran, no taragl swara ta ikrabuglka. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Ye no dumo pere mam miuredi kanugwa. Kandre, no di yu boglnga i, ye mudu ne kodugwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />God ere mogl, neno aglmo buglamo idre, ene togwa i, no suo gagroma bogl taraglno mere yegl meglkwa. Yegl pre God siragl mere ene di togwa i, ero! di, abu suo yegl dibrika.<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Jekop ebie suo yegl dibrika pre ye ere mogl, ebie suo ya gagiglma i kamel mokono bolamugl edidre, <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />ye aglmo buglamo ya bonaganamo mudu idre, aglmo buglamo si okna ede, ye moknomugl mage okna okna ede, ede pi dumo Kenan, ye nem Aisak dumo kaminmo ikra enagledi ede ogwa. Ye aglmo buglamo i ya bonaganamo i, mudu dumo Mesopotemia moglkwa igne, kan nogwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Ana Jekop ebiema gagiglma bogl ede enamnedi erikwa igne, Laban moglkrukwa. Ye sipsipmo yugono baragledi ede bage ta ogwa. Ye ede ogo, Resel ere mogl, nem god kibi tau bekugwa i kunogl yugwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Te, Jekop ye, Na ede ikne yugunamugl eiwe di, Aram yagl Laban i di tekre, teke ede pi yegl mere ere, bakagl togwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Ana Jekop aglmo buglamo ya bonaganamo mudu idre, yobama bogl teke ede pi Nigl Yufretis bai ede koglo eigwa. Nigl bai ede koglo pidre, ye dumo muglo mere paigo, Gileat we dimara ede enamnedi eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laban Jekop sika si ede ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Ana Jekop ebiema gagiglma ya nigl kogonmo yoba bogl ege suota bage pai, pi meglko, yoba tau Laban di teigo, prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Ye prisre, nem agiglema di makai sugo, ye Jekop sika si eigwa. Ege 7-pela de mere sika si pidre, ye dumo muglo mere paigo, Gileat we dimara ikra Jekop omara magigl eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24-25" />Magigl eigo, Jekop yobama bogl muglo ibo ta panamnedi sel yuguno keigwa. Laban ama dumo muglo paimara Gileat suna i nem agiglema bogl paigo, magigl magigl paigwa. Magigl magigl paigo, Laban ugl kubu ta kanugwa. Ye ugl kubu kanumara God ye moglmara udre, ka yegl di togwa, Ene kan kun ero! Jekop ka kide ta di tekro! di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:24-25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Ana tagna kana we, Laban ye Jekop moglmara udre, ka yegl dugwa, Ene siragl pre bakagl natne? Ene siragl pre yoba kuda yobuglo erikwa igne ye yoba si kane si i ede wimere mere yegl ere, na abra suo i ede une? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Siragl eruko, ene na di narekre, teke ede une? Siragl pre ene bakagl natne? Ene na di natna, no ene gun yenaiglmedi na yobanama agle dia, ye giglage didre, tamborin ya gita ki sigo. Te, na wakai wan pio! mere yegl ta dia, ene ede wima, i wakai paugo. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Ba ene na di narekitnga pre na abra ya gawanama paunano si nekre, ede pio! dikre, erika. Ene mabuno kide etnga. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Na ene sinaglka kuno erukwa ba eduer ene nen Godmo na moglmara udre, Ene kan kuno ero! Jekop ka kide ta di tekro! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Ene nen dumo kaminmo enagledi prisre, nomanen singa i prika ba ene siragl pre na godnana kunogl ine? di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Laban yegl dugo, Jekop di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene yobuglo ere, abutn suo ikne edinatnedi pre kudugl gogl, teke ede wiga. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Ba ene godnen we, enene dokidre, yoba ta gagl gre yunan kan, nono yoba i si goramga. Ene taraglnen doko kan, ta yenan, nono neno agroma kan meglbi, i nogugl edo! Taraglnen ta yenan, ikne edinatniwe di, yegl dugwa. Resel ye nem godmo kunogl yugwa i Jekop prikrukwa pre ka yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Ana Jekop yegl dugo, Laban ede pi Jekop sel yugumo yugugl pi, godmo kibi i dokugwa, yekrikwa. Yekriko, ye ede pi Lea sel yugumo yugugl pi dokidre, nigl kogon abu suo ikra sel yuguno yugugl pidre, ama dokugwa. Sel yugu i mudu dokugwa, yekriko, ye ede pi Resel sel yugumo yugugl ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Ana Resel sel yugu mina yugugl mogl, ye kamel moko mina yei ame digwa taragl i, makandigle yugugl yedre, god kibi i, taragl i mina atne yedre, bolamugl ame di moglkwa. Laban ede yugugl pidre, ye godmo kibi i dokugwa, kankrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Kankruko, Resel ere mogl, nem yegl di togwa, Nina yo, na adiglkrika i, kide prikro. Adraglba na ba kaniga pre ame di moluwe dugwa. Yegl pre Laban godmo kibi i doko wan moglkwa, kankrukwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Laban ye godmo kibi i dokugwa, kankruko, Jekop dem boglko, ye ka kodo di, yegl dugwa, Na aglau siragl mere erie? Na tadaglme siragl eriko, ene nigade na sika si une? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Ene na bonaganana mina taraglnen dokinga i, ene taraglnen ta yogo, kano? Ta yenan, ene i nogugl edin, na yobanama ya ene nen agitnma kanaiglmiwa! Ye kandre, nono kotno pre yubu sinaiglmiwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Ana na we, na bugla yugu 20-pela ene motnara mogl, ene kogon ere teiga. Na aglnen buglanen wakai sugl moglka pre sipsip abai ya meme abai gagro kor meglkwa keme kiglkwa. Te, na sipsip kumugl mo meme kumugl ta si nekrika. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Ene sipsipnen ya memenen tau taragl are si geglkwa i, na ene kanatnedi i pi obuno dikre, na aglau ta erekrie di, yegl ta dikre, na sipsipnana mo memenana i pi suglo siga. Te, yoba ere mogl, ermine mo eduer sipsipnen mo memenen ta kunogl neigwa i, Ene taraglnen i pi suglo si naro! keme dinga. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Ermine na niga podo dugo, eduer ir podo goglsre, ugl wakai paikrika. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Na bugla yugu 20 ene kogonen ere teiga. Bugla yugu 14-pela, ene abutn suo topo tenagledi kogon erika. Te, bugla yugu 6-pela na sipsipnen ya memenen tau inagledi kogonen erika. Na bugla yugu 20 kogonen ere teimara suna i we, ene ege 10-pela taim topo naragle dinere i narekre, topo kebra keme natnga. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Te, God na suglna ta moglkruma, ene taraglnen swara ta narekre, Yoko ede po! dina, ede wigo ba God ye na ake ple di naruko, na taraglnen tau mere idre, ede wiga. God ta na nina kuduglmo gogl togwa God i, ya na yagl awana Abraham Godmo i pre diga. Na kogon podo ere tedre, yubun podo iga i, God kandre, kotnana pre yubu sidre, eduedi eduer ene motnara pi ene ka tomiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jekop ya Laban ka di padiurka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Ana Jekop ka yegl di kodugo, Laban ere mogl, di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ebn suo i, na abra miurka. Te, gagiglnma i, na gawanama keme meglkwa. Te, sipsipnen ya memenen ya taragl mudu magigl kanga i we, na taraglna mudu meglkwa. Ba na siragl mere abra ya gawanama ake gi dinagle? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Pra, nono suo ka ta di padrabuglka. Di padugl, nono ka i pre moglsre, dinabuglere keme aimadi erabugle di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Laban ka yegl dugo, Jekop ere mogl, kobuglo olto ta yu, yoba okuo kanaiglmedi bodugl paduglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Te, ye ama yobama di te, Kobuglo yuwio! dugwa. Dugo, ye kobuglo yu, br beglkwa. Br beglko, ye mudu kobuglo br beglmara magigl i kaya mokna akie neigwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Neigo, Laban ere mogl, kobuglo br i yene kamo wagle kagie Jegar Sahaduta we dugwa. Te, Jekop kobuglo br i yene kamo wagle Galet<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kagie suo Jegar Sahaduta ya Galet mabuno kuno keme paugwa. Suo akie torua si dinabedi kobuglo br beglkwa mere yegl paugwa. Jegar Sahaduta i, Laban kamo, ka Aram wagle paugo, Galet i, Jekop kamo, ka Hibru wagle paugwa.</char></note> we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Ana Laban ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Kobuglo br bunga i, nono ka ta di padrabuglka i kinano torua si dinabedi buniwe dugwa. Yegl pre kobuglo br i kagie Galet we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Te, Laban ka ta ama dugwa pre kobuglo br i, yoba ama kagie Mispa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kagie Mispa i, mabuno paugwa, yoba mitna ibo mogl, kan moraiglmedi yugu kei ede mitna eigwa paugwa.</char></note> we digwa. Ye ka yegl dugwa, Nono ede pere pere pi morabuglka igne Yawe nono kan morabuka. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Ene na abra suo mabuno kide ere tenatno mo ene abu pere tau yun, yoba ta kan, na ta di narekraiglkwa paugwa ba God nono kan morabuka pre moglo! <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Nono muglara kobuglo br suna beglkwa i ya kobuglo ta suna bodugl padiglka i kano! <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Kobuglo br i ya kobuglo bodugl padiglka i, nono okuo ta kanubugl, ka di padrabuglka i pre morabuglka. Kobuglo br yomara i, na ede koglo ibo pi, ene ere kide ere tenagledi pikraglka. Te, ene ede koglo ya u na ere kide ere naragledi ukratnga. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Abraham ya Nahor ya ye neno Godno i, nono kan morabuka. Ene na ka diga i duglo boglkitn, God ene yubun tenabuka. Te, na ka diga i duglo boglkribo, God na yubun narabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Laban yegl dugo, Jekop ye God kagie mina ye nem Aisak kuduglmo goglkwa God i kagie mina ka kaima di te paduglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Ka kaima di te padiglsre, ye ere mogl, muglo i mina God tawa togwa. Tawa tedre, ye nem agiglema kaya mokna akie nenamnedi agle dugo, ye u akie neigwa. Ne kodidre, ye eduer muglo i paigwa. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Paigo, Laban tagna kana adiglsre, abuglo ya gawama paunano si nedre, di wakai yei togwa. Di wakai yei tedre, ye nem agiglema bogl ede ikne yugunomugl eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jekop ere mogl, Iso na wakai kanabedi taragl tau togwa</para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Ana Laban nem agiglema bogl ede ikne yugunomugl eigo, Jekop yobama bogl ede dumo Kenan enamnedi eigwa. Eigo, God angeloma tau ye tegigl yeigwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Tegigl yeigo, Jekop ye kandre, yegl dugwa, Aya, dumo magigl i, God amimo u bage paimara yomiwe dugwa. Yegl didre, ye ere mogl, dumo i kagie Mahanaim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Mahanaim i, mabuno ta paugwa, yugobuno suo paimara.</char></note> we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Ana Jekop ere mogl, yoba tau ye kamo i pi dumo makan Seir pidre, ye agigle Iso di tenaiglkwa pre dedugwa. Dumo makan Seir i, kagie ta Idom we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Jekop yoba i ka yegl dinaiglmedi beke togwa, Iso yo, ene nigl kogonen yagl Jekop ye ene yegl di togwa, Na ege olto nono bawano Laban kipamara kipai moglka. Erme ye kipamara kide kodo, terke ede wiga. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Na erme kau ya donki, sipsip ya meme kuglko, niglna kogona yagl ya abu ama meglkwa. Na ene kipanara magigl udre, niglna kogona yoba ene di tenaiglmedi dediga i, ene gun yedre, mabuno wakai ere noratnga pre Jekop yegl dumiwe dio! dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Jekop yegl dugo, yoba tau dedugwa i kamo i pi agigle Iso di tedre, ede ikne wigwa. Ede ikne udre, ye Jekop yegl di teigwa, No ede Iso moglmara pidre, kanen di tomga. Di tomgo, ye yagl 400 yugo, bage u tegigl yenamnedi wimiwe digwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Ka yegl digo, Jekop kudugl podo goglsre, nomane podo si erukwa. Yegl ersre, ye yobama ya sipsip, meme, kau ya kamel ki buno di bage suo edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Ye prukwa, Iso u yoba bage swara meglkwa i ta kuda bogl tenan, yoba bage ta meglkwa i, teke ede enaiglmiwe di, yegl di prukwa.<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Jekop yobama ya aglmo buglamo buno di bage suo edidre, ye Yawe kamage ere te yegl dugwa, Yawe yo, ene nina Aisak Godmo moglsre, yagl awana Abraham Godmo motnga. Enene na di nare, Ede ikne dumon kaminen, nen agiglnma meglmara po! dinga. Yegl didre, ene ama na di nare, Ene en, na ene ere wakai ere tenaluwe dinga. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Na we, na ene nigl kogonen yoba moglka ba na yagl wakai moglkrika. Na wakai moglkrika ba ene dinara adigl moglsre, na ake ple di natnga. Na okna nigl Jordan bai ede koglo eiga igne, na muglbo swara akidre ede eiga ba erme na yobanama ya taragl ere kuglka i, mere kide meglko, na buno di bage suo ediga. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Ana na kudugl goglka pre erme ene di prika, ene ake ple di notn, Iso u na ebina gagrama bogl no sikrabedi ene di prika. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Ene di natnga i, Ene ere wakai ere tedre, gawanma mere kide moraiglmedi ere edenagle dinga. Mere kide meglbi, yoba kerenaiglkwa kuno erekrabuka. Mudi nigl bina wesan mere kide yomere mere yegl moraiglmiwe dinga. Jekop yegl di, kamage erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Ana ye kamage yegl ere tedre, ye dumo i eduer ugl paugwa. Ye ugl pai, tagna kana aduglkwa igne ye taraglmo tau Iso tenagledi yubu si pere edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14-15" />Ye meme abai 200 idre, meme kumugl 20-pela idre, sipsip abai 200 idre, sipsip kumugl 20-pela idre, kamel abai gagro am te meglkwa 30-pela gagro bogl idre, kau abai 40-pela idre, kau kumugl 10-pela idre, donki abai 20-pela idre, donki kumugl 10-pela idre, yubu si pere edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Yubu si pere edidre, ye nigl kogon yoba taragl i meglmere gi gide mage yenaiglmedi tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene aglna buglana i, mage i ede okna pio! Na okuo unaglka. Te, ene taragl kane kane, i magigl magigl mage i pikraiglkwa. Ene tau taragl kane ta meglkwa mage i ede okna ebi, ene tau kuri ta mogl, taragl kane ta meglkwa okuo mage i ede enaiglkwa. Te, tau okuo enaiglkwa ama yegl keme eraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Yegl didre, ye ama yoba tau taragl kane swara ta meglkwa idre, ede okna kaima enaiglkwa i yegl di togwa, Ene ede ebi, na agra Iso bage unan, ene tegigl yenaiglkwa. Ene tegigl yebi, ye ere mogl, Ene ira niglmo kogonmo ere teme? didre, te, Ene agl bugla mage i wigwa i, ira aglmo buglamo meglme? didre, te, Ene i ede aglo eime? di, yegl ta dinan, <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />ene di ikne ede, yegl dinaiglkwa, Taragl i, ene nigl kogonen yagl Jekop taraglmo meglkwa. Ye yagl kademo Iso tenaiglmedi no dedugwa. Ye no mokonomugl u moglmiwe di, ene yegl dio! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Yegl didre, ye yoba tau bage namba 2 ya 3 mage i ede enaiglkwa ya tau okuo enaiglkwa i ama di te, Ene Iso tegigl yebi, na ka dimere kuno yegl keme di tedre, <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Ene nigl kogonen yoba Jekop mokonomugl u moglmiwe di, yegl dio! dugwa. Ye prukwa, Na taragl i tebo, ye dem kubrukwa i, pra dem muduo aragan erabuka. Aragan eran, no tegigl yobugl, ye na wakai kanabuka pai dume di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Ana Jekop ye nigl kogonmo yoba i dedugo, ye aglmo buglamo tau Iso tenaiglkwa ikra mage i ede eigo, Jekop yobama bogl eduer dumo i sel yuguno wagle aglke kor paigwa.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">God ere mogl, Jekop si padragledi eruko, Jekop ama God si padragledi erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Ana eduer suna Jekop adiglsre, ye ebie suo ya nigl kogonmo abu suo i ya wama 11-pela bogl ede pi nigl Jabok we digwa yoba nigl bai ede koglo pi pi erimara pidre, nigl bai ede koglo eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Ye nigl bai ede koglo eigo, Jekop ye i pi koglo ibo edidre, aglke ede ikne koglo ya ugwa. Ye koglo ya udre, ye nigl kogonmo yoba taraglmo mudu i ede enaiglmedi dedugwa.<verse eid="GEN 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Jekop ye dedugo, taraglmo mudu i ede eigo, ye swara koglo ya moglkwa. Ye swara moglko, yagl ta u, ye si padragledi erukwa. Eruko, Jekop ama yagl i si padragledi erukwa. Ye ikne ikne si padrabugledi ere miurko, kamun tagugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Kamun tagugo, yagl i yobuglo erekriedi prisre, ye Jekop ogane yobuglo si debruko, Jekop ogane debrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Jekop ogane debruko, yagl i ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Kamun tagumiwa, na edo! dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba Jekop di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene na di wakai yei natn, ene edenaglka. Ba ta manan, ene edekraluwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Jekop yegl dugwa pre yagl i Jekop di te, Ene kagn daglo! dugwa. Dugo, Jekop ere mogl, Na kagna Jekop we dimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Yegl dugo, yagl i aglke kor di ikne ede, Ene kagn erme Jekop we dikre, kagn kor ta daraiglkwa. Israel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Israel i, mabuno paugwa, God bogl kuda biurka.</char></note> we dinaiglkwa. I siragl pre ene God bogl kuda boglsre, yoba bogl kuda boglsre, yobuglo etniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yegl dugo, Jekop ye ama kira pogl, Ene kagn dagl naratnedi prie dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba yagl i di ikne ede, Ene siragl pre na kagna dagl ene tenabedi pitne? dugwa. Yegl didre, ye di wakai yei tedre, ede ogwa.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Ana Jekop ere mogl, Na God guma dra kaniga ba ye na si goglkrume di prisre, dumo i kagie Peniel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Peniel i, mabuno paugwa, God guma dra.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Ana ade koragle sugo, Jekop ye dumo Peniel i kide kodidre, ede ogwa. Ye boi boide ede ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />God ye Jekop ogane yobuglo si debrukwa pre Israel yoba okuo aglno buglano si ke neigwa igne, ye gogono ogane yobuglo i mina paugwa i nekrikwa. Okna nekre, ede u erme ama meglkwa i, nekrikwa.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Jekop Iso tegigl yebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Ana Jekop yobama bogl konbauna ede eigo, Jekop kan eglke iro ede Iso ya yagl 400 ikra wigwa kanugwa. Ye kandre, gagiglma mano Lea ya Resel ya nigl kogon abu suo meglmara akie akie ede enaiglmedi dedugwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Ye nigl kogonmo abu suo gagroma bogl ede okna enaiglmedi dedidre, Lea gagiglma bogl okuo enaiglmedi dedidre, Resel ya Josep okuo kaima enabredi dedugwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Yegl dedidre, yene ede okna pi agigle Iso umara ogwa. Ye pi moglsre, bage bage goglko bodugl, bre magide togwa. Ege 7-pela taim yegl ersre, ede pi agigle umara magigl ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Ede magigl ogo, Iso ye tegigl yenabugledi muku di ede pi Jekop umara pidre, ye nugo kugro, pauna si nogo, ye kai eribrika.<verse eid="GEN 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Ana Jekop ya Iso kai eribriko, Iso kan iro ede, abu 4-pela i gagroma bogl meglkwa kanugwa. Ye kandre, Jekop di pre, Yoba ene akie wigwa i, ira meglme? dugwa. Dugo, Jekop di ikne ede, God na aragan ere narumara gak wagle i, na ene nigl kogonen yoba moglka i, narumiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Yegl dugo, nigl kogon abu suo gagroma bogl magigl udre, goglkono bodugl, bitno magide teigwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Yegl eriko, Lea ama gagiglma bogl magigl udre, goglkono bodugl, bitno magide teigwa. Ye yegl eriko, Resel ya Josep mokonomugl udre, ye ama goglkono bodugl, bitno magide tebrika.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Abu gagroma bogl mudu u goglkono bodugl, bitno magide teigo, Iso ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Na konbo bage u kaniga, yoba ene aglnen buglanen mere kide mage i ede okna eigo, kaniga. Ene mabuno siragl pre dedinga eime? dugwa. Dugo, Jekop di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade yo, ene na wakai kanatnga pre na aglna buglana i ene teiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Jekop yegl dugwa ba Iso aglke kor dugwa, Agra yo, na agl bugla pra kuglka. Aglnen buglanen enene kuratniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Dugo, Jekop di ikne ede, Mane dugwa. Ene na wakai kan, na aglna buglana ene teiga i, inatniwa. Na ene motnara wigo, ene ka wakai di natnga pre na ene guman dran erme kaniga i, God guma dra kan, gun yenaglmere mere yegl ene guman dran kan, gun yeiga <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Te, God na ere wakai ere naruko, taragl mere kuglka pre na taragl tau ene teiga i, inatniwe dugwa. Ana Jekop ka giglede dugwa pre Iso taragl ikra pra yugwa.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Ana Iso ere mogl, Nono akie ede omno! dugwa. Na ede okna ebo, ene na mokonamugl wio! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Yegl dugwa ba Jekop di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade yo, na gagra kebra yobuglno kogl paikrukwa ya aglna buglana tau gagro am te meglkwa, na pre yubun deiga i, ene ama pre kan etnga. Na ege swara ta tabre ede enaiglmedi magibo, aglna buglana goraiglkwa pamiwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Yegl pre yagl kade yo, ene yobanma bogl ede okna pio. No okuo kie kiede unamga. Na aglna buglana mage i wiga i ya gak kebra wigwa i akie konbauna ta unaiglmere yegl mere u, ene dumo makan Seir kipai motnara unamniwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Jekop yegl dugo, Iso ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Ana na yobanama tau dedibo, ene agre i ede unaiglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba Jekop di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade yo, ene na wakai kan, i swara wakai kaima praglka ba ene yobanma no agre i ede unaiglkwa i, ye kogonono ta paikrumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Jekop yegl dugwa pre Iso ade swara i mina ede ikne Seir kipamara enagledi ede ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Ede ogo, Jekop ede dumo ta Sukot we dimara pidre, yugu ta kipaugwa. Yugu ta kipadre, ye aglmo buglamo yugu teka si edugwa. Yegl pre yoba ere mogl, dumo i Sukot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Sukot mabuno paugwa, yugu teka sugwa.</char></note> we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Ana Jekop ye dumo Mesopotemia ikra kide kodidre, ede ogwa igne i ye dumo Sukot i, pi kipadre, okuo dumo i kide kodidre, wakai wan ede pi dumo ta Sekem we dimara, dumo Kenan suna yogwa i pidre, taun bina sel yugu kipaugwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Ye kipadre, sel yugu kipamara makan i topo sugwa. Ye yagl ta kagie Hamor we digwa wama mige silva 100 tedre, makan i yugwa. Hamor wama i, swara ta kagie Sekem we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Jekop makan topo sidre, dumo igle kobuglo bogl ta kuglkwa. Kuglsre, ye kobuglo bogl i kagie God ye Israel Godno Moglkwa, kagie yegl yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Yagl Sekem ye Jekop abuglo Daina mabuno kide ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Ana okuo, Jekop ya Lea abro Daina ikra ere mogl, makan mam abai kipai meglmara ye kanagledi ede ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Ede ogo, yagl ta kagie Sekem we digwa ikra ye kandre, ye gudu yu, mabuno kide ere togwa. Sekem i, ye Hivi yoba Hamor wam ta moglkwa. Hamor ye yagl kade moglsre, dumo magigl Sekem i ye sugl moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Sekem ye Jekop abuglo Daina i pi mabuno kide ere tedre, ye abai i bubuno goglsre, wakai kaima kanugwa pre ye abai kina sidre, Ye na ama wakai na kanabe di, ka wakai di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Ye abai i ka wakai di tedre, ere mogl, nem Hamor di te, Ene abai i bogl i naratniwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Ana Jekop we, Sekem ye abuglo Daina mabuno kide ere togwa i yoba di teigo, prukwa. Prukwa ba ye wama mudu ede pi agl bugla ere kiglmara pi sugl meglkwa pre ye ede ikne unaiglmedi sugl moglsre, ka ta dikrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Jekop ye wama unaiglmedi sugl moglko, yagl Hamor i ye wam Sekem bogl u, Jekop ka di tenabugledi ubrika. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Ye ubriko, Jekop wama agl bugla meda sugl meglkwa i, ye yubun ta plau dugwa i digo, prisre, ede ikne wigwa. Sekem ye Jekop abuglo Daina mabuno kide ere togwa i, ye Israel yoba kagno ere kide ersre, erekrabara erukwa. Yegl pre Jekop wama kide kaima prisre, deno podo kubrikwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Jekop wama deno podo kubrikwa ba Hamor ere mogl, Jekop wama bogl yegl di togwa, Na wana Sekem ye abai Daina i wakai kaima kanugwa. Yegl pre ene ye tenaiglmedi prika. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Te, nono abro te ikne ikne edinamnedi prika. Ene abroma no noribi, no abroma ene tenamga. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Nono abroma yegl mere te ikne ikne edidre, nono akie moramga. Ene dumo wakai ta kanaiglmara kipai moglsre, makan topo si idre, no taraglno topo si idre, ene taraglno topo bogl nedre, yegl eraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Hamor yegl dugo, ye wam Sekem ama ere mogl, Jekop wama bogl yegl di togwa, Ene na wakai kadre, Abai inatne dibi, ene Yegl yegl inamne dinaiglmere mere tenaglka. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Ene abu topo siramna padraiglkwa ya te, taragl wakai siragl mere inamne dinaiglkwa i, na ene dinaiglmere mere tenaglka. Ene abai i nario! di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Sekem yegl dugo, Jekop wama ye abaro mabuno kide ere togwa i prisre, ka kibi di ikne ede, <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Hamor ya Sekem yegl di teigwa, No abaro ene tenamga i, waragine paugwa. Ene gagn puduo gagie boglkitnga pre no ye ene tomun, agai goramga. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Ana ene ye inatnga, konbo swara keme yogwa. Ene yobanma bogl yagl mudu gagno puduo gagie boraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Beglbi, no abroma ene tomun, ene abroma no noribi, nono akie mogl, yugobuno sware moramga. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Ba no Gagno puduo gagie boraiglme dumga i, ene kano i prikribi, no abaro idre, ede enamniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Ana Jekop wama ka yegl digo, Hamor ya ye wam Sekem ka i pra, wakai pribrika. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Pribriko, Sekem ye Jekop abuglo i wakai kaima kanugwa pre ye tabre pi Jekop wama dimere erukwa. Ana Sekem, ye yoba bormai swara meglmara suna yagl kade moglko, yoba ye swara mogl mitna edumedi kanigwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Yegl pre Sekem ye nem Hamor bogl akie ede pi taun kobuglo togl winabo dumara dua wagle pidre, yagl taun swara kipaigwa i di te, yegl dibrika, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />Yagl wagle i, nono kabagle mere yegl meglkwa. Nono makano podo yogwa. Yegl pre nono pra we dumun, ye nono makano wagle moglsre, nono taraglno topo si idre, ye taraglno topo bogl nedre, eraiglkwa. Nono ye abroma imun, ye nono abroma inaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Ba nono akie mogl, yugobuno swara mere moramga i, taragl swara ta orumun, ye pra we dinaiglkwa. Ta erekrumun, mane dinaiglkwa. Nono ye gagno puduo gagie beglmere yegl mere gagno puduo gagie bun, pra we dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Nono ye dimere orumun, ye pra we dibi, nono ye bogl akie mogl, ye aglno buglano ya bonaganano mudu nono inamniwe di, yegl dibrika. <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Yegl dibriko, yagl mudu taun i kipaigwa i, Hamor ya Sekem kano prisre, ye gagno puduo gagie beglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Ana yagl mudu dumo Sekem kipaigwa i gagno puduo gagie boglsre, giugl prikwa. Ye ege suota mogl, giugl pre meglko, Jekop wam suo, Simeon ya Livai, Daina agigle miurka i ere mogl, bainetno idre, ede taun suna ubrika. Yoba taun i kipai meglkwa ye no sinabredi prikriko, yagl suo ikra udre, yagl mudu si giurka. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Ye yagl mudu si goglsre, Hamor ya ye wam Sekem suo akie si giurka. Si giurko, Daina ye Sekem kipamara yugugl kra moglko, ye agigle suo u, ye idre, ede ebrika. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Ede ebriko, Jekop wama mudu ere mogl, ye abaro agai podo goglkwa pre ede u yagl geglkwa i taraglno idre, taragl taun suna yogwa i pra mudu i ede eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Ye sipsip ya meme, kau ya donki idre, taragl mudu taun suna yogwa ya taun meda yogwa ama mudu idre, <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />taragl mige podo boglkwa ya taragl mudu yugugl yogwa idre, gak kebra ya abu si kane sidre, i ede eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Jekop wama yegl ere kodigo, Jekop ye wam suo Simeon ya Livai yegl di togwa, Ene yubun podo naribrika. Makan nem magigl meglkwa i, Kenan yoba ya Peres yoba deno kubro narsre, nono no sinaiglkwa. Nono mere moglkrumga pre ye u swara pidre, nono kuda bogl noribi, nono mudu goramniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Yegl dugwa ba ye di ikne ede, yegl dibrika, Ye no abaro konbauna abu mere yegl kandre, mabuno kide ere togwa i, no kanige erabredi pitno? dibrika.<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Jekop god kibi kide kodugo, God ye di wakai yei togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Ana God ere mogl, Jekop yegl di togwa, Erme ene ede dumo Betel pi kipadre, kobuglo bogl ta kuglsre, tawa naragledi ere yeo! dugwa. Na God moglka. Ene agitn moglmara kide kodidre, teke enga igne ikra na ene motnara u plau diwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />God yegl dugwa pre Jekop ye nem agiglema ya yobama mudu akie meglkwa i di te, yegl dugwa, Nono pi, God tawa tenamga pre erme we, yoba yugobuno pere meglkwa god kibi bekigwa ene tau yeigwa i, kide kodidre, nigl padre, kugugl gagl deglbi yekrukwa edio! <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Nono ede dumo Betel enamniwa. Omun, na kobuglo bogl ta kugl, God tawa tenagledi ere yenaglka. Na okna yubun podo iga igne, God na kamage ere teiga i prisre, na dumo aglo ta eiga i ye akie pidre, na ake ple di narumiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Jekop yegl dugwa pre ye ere mogl, yoba yugobuno pere god kibi bekigwa ye tau yeigwa i, Jekop tedre, kinano ring ama teigwa. Teigo, Jekop i pi ede ok we digwa ta dumo Sekem magigl paugwa i mabunomugl maugl si paduglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Jekop taragl i maugl si paduglko, ye yobama bogl mudu ede eigo, makan nem yoba taun tau magigl kipai meglkwa i, God ye kudugl podo goraiglmedi erukwa. Eruko, ye kudugl podo geglkwa pre Jekop kuda bogl tenamnedi sika sikrikwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Ana Jekop yobama bogl ede pi dumo Lus we dimara plau digwa. Dumo Lus i, dumo podo Kenan suna yogo, yoba dumo i ama Betel we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Ye pi plau digo, Jekop kobuglo bogl ta kuglsre, dumo Betel i kagie kor ta yei te, El Betel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie El Betel i mabuno paugwa, God ye dumo Betel Godmo moglkwa.</char></note> we dugwa. Ye okna agigle moglmara kide kodidre, teke ede ogwa igne ikra, God ye dumo i Jekop moglmara plau dugwa pre Jekop kagie yegl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Ana ye dumo i meglkwa igne, nigl kogon abu ta goglkwa. Abu i okna Jekop mam Rebeka kebra moglkwa igne ye sugl moglkwa, kagie Debora we digwa. Goglko, ye dumo Betel ede ok kuri ta yoglbo paugwa i mabunomugl maugl sigwa. Yegl pre ede i, yoba kagie yeigwa, Alon Bakut<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Alon Bakut i, mabuno paugwa, kai erikwa edemo ok.</char></note> we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Ana Jekop okna ibo dumo makan Mesopotemia kide kodidre, bage bage kipai ede u erme dumo Betel i aglke kor ugwa. Ugo, abu kidagl ikra goglko, maugl sigo, mokomugl i God aglke kor ye moglmara plau didre, ogo kade ake mitna ede, di wakai yei te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Ene kagn Jekop we digwa ba yoba kagn i kide kodidre, kagn Israel we dinaiglmiwe dugwa. Yegl mere God ye kagie Israel yei togwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Ana God yegl didre, ye ama ere mogl, ka ta yegl dugwa, Na God Yobuglna Podo Paugwa moglka. Ene gak mere kide kuglo! Ene gawanma yugobuno pere ta moraiglkwa. Te, gawanma tau yugobuno pere pere meglbi, gawanma tau ama yoba kade king moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Na makan gaba Abraham ya Aisak teiga i, na ene ya ene gawanma okuo moraiglkwa tenaluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />God dumo igle Jekop ka di tedre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Ede ogo, Jekop kobuglo olto ta idre, God ye ka di tomara i yoba okuo kanaiglmedi bodugl paduglkwa. Padiglsre, ye wain nuglo God tena pre toide kobuglo bolamugl edugwa. Yegl ersre, ye kugo nuglo ama toide kobuglo bolamugl edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Edidre, God ye ka di tomara i kagie Betel we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Ana okuo ye dumo Betel i kide kodidre, ede pi dumo ta Efrata we dimara enamnedi eigwa. Ye ede pi meglko, dumo Efrata i kuri ta eglke yei pai moglko, Resel ye gak kuragledi ersre, gagie giugl podo prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Ye gagie giugl podo pre pai moglko, abu ta ye ake ple di togwa ye di te, Ene kudugl goglkro! Yagl gak ta ama kuglniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Yegl dugo, Resel goragledi ersre, yagl gak i kagie Benoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Benoni i, mabuno paugwa, na wana giugl podo prisre, kuglka mere yegl paugwa.</char></note> we dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba ye wie ere mogl, yagl gak i kagie kor yei, Benjamin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Benjamin i, mabuno paugwa, na wana yobuglo podo paugwa.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Ana Resel yagl gak i kagie Benoni yedre, goglkwa. Ye goglko, ye yobama ere mogl, konbauna ede dumo Efrata omara i, bina maugl sigwa. Dumo Efrata i, yoba erme Betlehem we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Maugl sigo, Jekop kobuglo olto ta yoba okuo kanaiglmedi ye maugl simara bodugl paduglkwa. Ye maugl simara kobuglo bodugl paduglkwa i, erme yei pai moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Ana Jekop, kagie ta Israel we digwa i, ye kobuglo i bodugl padiglsre, dumo i kide kodidre, ede ogwa. Ye ede pi dumo Eder, yugu ta kei ede mitna kaima eimara plau didre, kuri ta yade ede ido pidre, sel yugu kipaugwa.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Ana Israel dumo i kipai moglkwa igne, ye wam Ruben ere mogl, nem nigl kogonmo abu ta yugwa ikra kagie Bilha we digwa i bogl, bogl swara pabrika. Bogl swara pabriko, yoba ye Israel di teigo, prukwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 35:22">Jekop wama kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Ana Jekop ye wama 12-pela meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Ye ebie ta Lea bogl yagl gak tau kiurka, Jekop wam komono kagie Ruben we digwa. Te, Lea yagl gak tau ama kuglkwa, kagno Simeon ya Livai ya Juda ya Isakar ya Sebulun we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Te, Resel yagl gak suo kuglkwa, kagno Josep ya Benjamin we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Te, Bilha, Resel nigl kogonmo abu i yagl gak suo kuglkwa, kagno Dan ya Naptali we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Te, Silpa, Lea nigl kogonmo abu i yagl gak suo kuglkwa, kagno Gat ya Aser we digwa. Jekop wama i, ye Mesopotemia moglkwa igne kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aisak goglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Ana okuo Jekop ere mogl, ye nem dumo Mamre, Kiriat Arba, kagie ta Hebron we dimara magigl kipai moglmara ikra ogwa. Dumo i, Jekop nem Aisak kipaugwa ya te, Abraham okna kor moglkwa igne ye ama dumo i kipaugwa.<verse eid="GEN 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Ana Jekop nem Aisak we, ye bugla yugu 180 nedre, <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />kidagl kaima yedre, goglkwa. Goglko, ye wam suo Iso ya Jekop ye maugl sibrika.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Iso wama ya gawama kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Iso wama ya gawama kagno paugwa. Te, Iso ye kagie ta Idom we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Iso Kenan abu suo yugwa. Ta kagie Ada we digwa. Ye Hit yoba ta kagie Elon we digwa abuglo moglkwa. Te, ta kagie Oholibama we digwa. Ye nem kagie Ana we digwa. Te, Ana nem ye Hivi yoba ta moglkwa, kagie Sibeon we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />Te, Iso ama ere mogl, abu ta yugwa, kagie Basemat we digwa. Ye Ismael abuglo moglkwa. Te, ye agigle ta moglkwa, kagie Nebaiot we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ana Iso ebie Ada we, ye yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Elifas we digwa. Te, Iso ebie Basemat yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Ruel we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Te, ye ebie Oholibama yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Jeus ya Jalam ya Kora we digwa. Iso ye dumo Kenan suna kipaugwa igne yagl gak i kuglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Ana okuo, Iso ye ebie gagiglma ya yobama mudu idre, aglmo buglamo ya bonaganamo bogl mudu dumo Kenan suna moglkwa igne ere nogwa i idre, ye agigle Jekop moglmara kide kodidre, ede eglke dumo pere ta moragledi ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Agigle agigle suo i ye aglno buglano mere kide kiurka pre ye dumo swara kipabrika i, kugl kan kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Kuno erekrukwa pre Iso ede dumo kamun muglo yeimara, Seir we dimara pidre, kipai moglkwa. Iso, ye kagie ta Idom we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Ana Iso dumo kamun muglo yeimara Seir we dimara i kipai mogl goglko, ye gawama okuo meglkwa i, Idom yoba we digwa. Ye gawama kagno magigl i paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Ana Iso wama kagno we, Iso ebie Ada yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Elifas we digwa. Te, ye ebie Basemat yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Ruel we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Ana Iso wam Elifas we, ye ere mogl, yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Teman ya Omar ya Sefo ya Gatam ya Kenas we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Te, Iso wam Elifas i, ye niglmo kogonmo abu ta ama yugwa, kagie Timna we digwa. Timna yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Amalek we digwa. Yoba i Ada, Iso ebie ikra gawama kagno paugwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Ana, Iso wam Ruel we, ye ere mogl, yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Nahat ya Sera ya Sama ya Misa we digwa. Yoba i Basemat, Iso ebie ikra gawama kagno paugwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Te, Iso ebie Oholibama, yagl Ana abuglo moglsre, te Sibeon gawamo moglkwa i, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Jeus ya Jalam ya Kora we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Ana Iso gawama pi yagl kade mogl, yugobuno pere pere sugl meglkwa. Yagl kade meglkwa i, kagno magigl i paugwa. Iso wam komono Elifas i, ye wama yagl kade meglkwa, kagno, Teman ya Omar ya Sefo ya Kenas <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />ya Kora ya Gatam ya Amalek we digwa. Yagl kade meglkwa i Elifas dumo Idom moglkwa igne mudu kuglkwa. Ana ye mudu Iso ebie Ada gawama meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Te, Iso wam Ruel i, ye wama yagl kade meglkwa, kagno Nahat ya Sera ya Sama ya Misa we digwa. Yagl kade meglkwa i, Ruel dumo Idom moglkwa igne mudu kuglkwa. Ana ye mudu Iso ebie Basemat gawama meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Te, Iso ebie Oholibama i, ye wama ama yagl kade meglkwa, kagno Jeus ya Jalam ya Kora we digwa. Yagl kade meglkwa i, Iso ebie Oholibama, yagl Ana abuglo ikra wama meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Yoba i Iso, kagie ta Idom we digwa i, wama ya gawama yagl kade meglkwa, kagno paugwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seir wama ya gawama kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Ana Iso ede dumo Idom i ogwa igne, makan nem tau ama meglkwa. Ye Hor yagl ta kagie Seir we digwa gagiglma ya gawama meglkwa. Seir wama i, kagno Lotan ya Sobal ya Sibeon ya Ana <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />ya Dison ya Eser ya Disan we digwa. I Seir wama, Hor yoba yagl kade dumo Idom meglkwa i, kagno paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Te, Seir wam Lotan we, ye ere mogl, yagl gak suo kuglkwa, kagno Hori ya Hemam we digwa. Lotan abauglo ta ama moglkwa, kagie Timna we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Te, Seir wam Sobal we, ye ere mogl, yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Alvan ya Manahat ya Ebal ya Sefo ya Onam we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Te, Seir wam Sibeon we, ye ere mogl, yagl gak suo kuglkwa, kagno Aia ya Ana. Yagl Ana, ye aglke ta, nem Sibeon donkimo i pi kugl moglmara, dumo wau yomara edidre, nigl niga dugwa ta ogo bei ugo, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Te, Ana ere mogl, yagl gak ta kuglsre, abai gak ta kuglsre, erukwa. Yagl gak i kagie Dison we digwa. Te, abai gak i, Oholibama ikra moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Te, Seir wam Dison we, ye ere mogl, yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Hemdan ya Esban ya Itran ya Keran we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Te, Seir wam Eser we, ye ere mogl, yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Bilhan ya Savan ya Akan we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Te, Seir wam Disan we, ye ere mogl, yagl gak suo kuglkwa, kagno Us ya Aran we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29-30" />Ana Hor yagl Seir we digwa i wama meglkwa i, ye yagl kade mogl, dumo makan Seir suna i yugobuno pere pere sugl meglkwa. Ye yagl kade i meglkwa, kagno Lotan ya Sobal ya Sibeon ya Ana ya Dison ya Eser ya Disan we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idom king kagno paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Ana okna ibo king ta Israel sugl moglkrukwa igne, king tau dumo makan Idom i suna mogl, yoba sugl meglkwa. Ye kagno magigl i paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />King ta Idom yoba sugl moglkwa i, kagie Bela we digwa. Ye Beor wam moglsre, dumo Dinhaba kipai moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Ana okuo Bela goglko, yagl ta dumo Bosra nem moglkwa, kagie Jobap we digwa i, ye agaimo idre, king moglkwa. Ye yagl ta Sera we digwa wam moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Ana Jobap ere mogl, goglko, yagl ta Husam we digwa, Teman yoba dumono kipaugwa i ere mogl, agaimo idre, king moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Ana okuo yagl Husam i ere mogl, goglko, yagl ta Hadat we digwa, Bedat wam i ere mogl, agaimo idre, king moglkwa. Ye dumo Avit kipai moglkwa. Te, Hadat i, ye aglke ta amimo bogl ede Moap yoba meglmara pidre, Midian yoba kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Ana Hadat ere mogl, goglko, yagl ta Samla we digwa, dumo Masreka kipai moglkwa i, ere mogl, agaimo idre, king moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Ana Samla ere mogl, goglko, yagl ta Saul we digwa, dumo Rehobot kipai moglkwa i, ere mogl, agaimo idre, king moglkwa. Dumo Rehobot i, nigl Yufretis bina yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Ana Saul ere mogl, goglko, yagl ta Balhanan we digwa, Akbor wam moglkwa i, ere mogl, agaimo idre, king moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Ana Balhanan, Akbor wam i ere mogl, goglko, yagl ta Hadar we digwa, dumo Pau kipai moglkwa i, ere mogl, agaimo idre, king moglkwa. Hadar i, ebie kagie Mehetabel we digwa. Te, Mehetabel ye Matret abuglo moglsre, Mesahap gawamo moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Ana Iso gawama tau yagl kade mogl, dumo pere pere pi kipai mogl, yugobuno pere pere sugl meglkwa. Yagl kade meglkwa i, kagno Timna ya Alva ya Jetet <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />ya Oholibama ya Ela ya Pinon <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />ya Kenas ya Teman ya Mipsar <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />ya Makdiel ya Iram we digwa. Ye mudu yagl kade moglsre, Idom yoba, Iso gawama okuo mere kide meglkwa i, sugl meglkwa. Ye dumuno Idom suna mogl, dumo kebra pere pere kipai, yugobuno pere pere sugl meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Josep agiglema ye deno kubro teigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Ana Jekop we, ye dumo Kenan suna i, ye nem okna yoba pere makano wagle wan mogl, kipamara i, ye ama kipai moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, Jekop ya ye gawama kano paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Jekop wam Josep we, ye kumugl mogl, bugla yugu 17 nogwa igne, ye aglke ta agigle tau bogl neno sipsipmo ya mememo akie sugl meglkwa. Agiglema tau bogl akie sugl meglkwa i, ye nem ebie suo Bilha ya Silpa ikra wanoma meglkwa. Sipsip ya meme sugl meglko, Josep agiglema i mabuno kide eriko, Josep kandre, ede nem moglmara pi di togwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Ana Jekop, kagie ta Israel we digwa i, ye wama mudu wakai kanugwa ba ye kidagl yei kodugwa igne Josep kuglkwa pre Josep swara ye wakai kaima kanugwa. Wakai kaima kanugwa pre ye ere mogl, ir gagl olto ta wakai kaima si bogl, Josep togwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Ana Jekop ye Josep swara wakai kaima kandre, wam tau wakai kaima kankrukwa i, Josep agiglema kanigwa. Kandre, ye deno kubro Josep tedre, ka wakai ta di tekrikwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Te, aglke ta Josep ugl kubu ta kandre, ye agiglema di togwa. Di togo, ye prisre, deno podo kubro teigwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Josep ugl kubu kandre, agiglema boglo si te, yegl dugwa, Na agrama wagle, na ugl kubu ta kaniga di tenariwa. Prio! <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Na ugl kubu kaniga i, nono yoba kugl mogo ere yaiglmara mogl, kugl si kodigwa nono makai sidre, koglo sumga. Koglo sumgo, na kugl koglo siga i, suna adigl paugo, ene kugl koglo sigwa i bina adigl winabo di, na kugl koglo siga i bitno magide teigo, kaniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Yegl dugo, ye agiglema ere mogl, Josep yegl di prikwa, Ene kaima king moglsre, bitno mere mogl, no sugl moragledi pitno? di, yegl digwa. Yegl didre, ye ugl kubu kanumara ya ye di tomara ye deno podo kubro Josep teigwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Te, okuo Josep aglke kor ugl kubu ta kandre, agiglema boglo si te, yegl dugwa, Na agrama wagle, ene prio! Na aglke kor ugl kubu ta kaniga. Na ugl kubu kaniga i, ade ya ba ya kugl kuri 11-pela ere mogl, bitno magide nariko, kaniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Ye agiglema yegl di tedre, nem ama di togwa. Nem di togo, nem ye ka te, yegl dugwa, Ene ugl kubu siragl mere kane? Na ene man ya agiglnma bogl ka kaima ene moratnara u goglkono bodugl, bitno magide makan mina padigl tenamno? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Yegl dugo, Josep agiglema deno muduno u kide ogwa ba Josep nem ere mogl, Josep ka dugwa i pre moglsre, kina gudu prukwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ismael yoba Josep topo si, Isip yoba boino panabedi topo bogl neigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Ana aglke ta Josep agiglema ere mogl, neno sipsipmo ya mememo i pi dumo Sekem kugl nenaiglmedi edidre, sugl meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />I pi sugl meglko, Israel ere mogl, ye wam Josep yegl di togwa, Ene agiglnma dumo Sekem mogl, sipsip ya meme sugl meglkwa. Ene pi kanatnedi priwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Josep Na enagle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Josep yegl dugo, ye nem aglke kor yegl di togwa, Ene ede pi agiglnma ya sipsip ya meme siragl mere meglkwa i kandre, aglke ede ikne u, na di naratniwe dugwa. Josep nem ye yegl mere dedugo, Josep dumo Hebron auduno yomara kipai meglkwa i kide kodidre, ede pi dumo Sekem plau dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Josep ede pi dumo Sekem plau didre, kugl moglmara doko wan moglko, yagl ta ye kandre, Ene siragl taragl doko motne? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Di pruko, Josep di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na agrama ye sipsip ya meme sugl meglkwa i, dokiga. Ye aglo meglkwa i, ene ta kano? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Dugo, yagl i dugwa, Ye kamin kade ede eigwa. Ye Ede dumo Dotan we dimara enamne digo, na prie di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre Josep ede pi dumo Dotan we dimara pidre, ye agiglema kanugwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Ana Josep ye agiglema kandre, meglmara enagledi pi moglko, ye eglke mogl ugwa i, kanigwa. Ye Josep kandre, eglke u moglkwa igne ye si goramnedi di kogl yeigwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Ye yegl digwa, Ugl kubu kanugwa yagle ikra umiwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Nono ye si goglsre, ogo gagie maugl nigl magigl i perimara pia si atne edinamniwa. Yegl ersre, nono yoba di te, Taragl are ta ye si nomiwe dinamga. Yegl oromun, ye ugl kubu kanugwa ikra pai inabo? di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21-22" />Josep agiglema yegl digwa ba ye agigle komono Ruben ka digwa i prisre, ye agiglema Josep si goglkraiglmedi ka yegl dugwa, Nono ye ta si goglkramniwa. Dumo wau yomara magigl i, maugl nigl perimara ikra pia si atne edinamga ba ye ta si goglkramniwe dugwa. Ruben yegl dugwa i, ye okuo Josep i meda edidre, agre i ede pi neno moglmara tenagledi prisre, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Ana Ruben yegl dugwa pre Josep ede agiglema meglmara ugo, ye agiglema ir gaglmo wakai yogwa ikra ake gudu idre, <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" /><figure style="fig" alt="Joseph thrown into pit" file="FM 055 Joseph Thrown in a Pit_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="37.24" />Josep i pi maugl nigl ikra wagle pia si atne edigwa. Maugl nigl i, nigl daruko, yoko yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Ye Josep si maugl mina atne edidre, kaya mokna nenamnedi ame digwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:25">Ye kaya mokna ne moglsre, kan iro ede, Ismael yoba tau dumo makan Gileat kide kodidre, ede kantri Isip enamnedi konbauna u meglko, kanigwa. Ismael yoba i kamel wagle ede nuglo tau demene erukwa i pi Isip topo bogl nenamnedi padigl yuigwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Josep agiglema yegl kanigo, Juda ye di te, yegl dugwa, Nono agro ta si goglsre, teke padun, siragl taragl inamne? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Nono bormai swara munga pre nono agro si goglkre, yegl eramga, Ismael yoba wigwa i, nono agro topo bogl nenamniwe dugwa. Dugo, ye agiglema kamo i prisre, pra we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Yegl digo, Ismael yoba dumo Midian nem meglkwa i wigo, Josep agiglema ye ake gudu i meda edigo, Ismael yoba i ye mige silva 20-pela tedre, Josep idre, ede dumo Isip eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Ana Ruben we, ye agiglema ere mogl, Josep topo bogl neigwa igne i ye moglkrukwa. Ye okuo ede ikne maugl nigl ikra perimara pidre, Josep pai moglkruko, kanugwa. Kandre, ye mirie gogl, kuguglmo gaglmo ake argla dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Kuguglmo gaglmo ake argla didre, ye ede ikne agiglema meglmara pidre, yegl dugwa, Josep maugl nigl perimara ikra pai moglkrukwa! Na erme siragl eragle? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ruben yegl dugo, ye agiglema meme kumugl ta si goglsre, bormai koglsre, Josep ir gaglmo ikra bormai moglmara ede atne edigwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Yegl ersre, ye ir gagl wakai ikra i pi neno obuno di tedre, yegl digwa, No ir gagl i konbo bage yogo, kan yumga. Ene ir gagl kano! I ene wan gaglmo yomo mo yekrumada? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Yegl digo, Josep nem gagl i kandre, Owo, i na wana ir gaglmo yomiwe dugwa. Taragl are ta Josep si paglke nogwa pamiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Yegl didre, ye Josep mirie goglsre, kuguglmo gaglmo ake argla didre, te, mirie goglkwa pre ye ama lap kagigle yaglkwa ta idre, dem tuba sugwa. Yegl ersre, ye ege olto kai ere moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Kai ere moglko, ye wama ya abugloma ye moglmara u, ka tau ye kina torua sinabuka pre digwa. Yegl digwa ba ye kide prisre, yegl dugwa, Na wana pre kai ere mogl, goglbo, yoba na maugl sinaiglmiwe dugwa. Didre, kai ere moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Te, Josep we, Midian nem ikra ye i pi dumo Isip kane pai, nigl kogon yoba morabedi topo beglko, yagl ta kagie Potifar we digwa ye topo sugwa. Yagl Potifar i, ye Isip king yobamo kade ta moglkwa. Ye soldia tau king yugumo sugl kan meglkwa i, bitno mere mogl, ye sugl moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Juda ya Tamar kano paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Ana igne i Jekop wam Juda ere mogl, agiglema meglmara kide kodidre, yagl ta dumo Adulam we dimara kipaugwa kanagledi ede ogwa. Yagl i kagie Hira we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Juda ede pi dumo Adulam i pidre, Kenan abai ta kanugwa. Abai i yagl ta Sua we digwa abuglo moglkwa. Ye abai i kandre, ere mogl, yugwa. Yugo, ye bogl swara pabriko, <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />ye dane paugwa. Dane paugo, okuo yagl gak ta kuglkwa. Kuglko, Juda ye kagie Er we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Te, okuo Juda ebie aglke kor yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Onan we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Te, okuo ye dumo Kesip we dimara moglkwa igne, ye yagl gak ta ama kuglkwa, kagie Sela we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Ana okuo Juda wam komono Er i kade moglkwa igne, Juda ye abu ta bogl i wam togwa, kagie Tamar we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Abu i bogl i togwa ba Juda wam komono Er i, Yawe gumuglo wagle yoba kide moglkwa pre Yawe ye si goglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Yawe ye si goglko, Juda ere mogl, wam Onan yegl di togwa, Ene agitn goglkwa pre ene ye ebie inatnga paugwa. Ene in, ye gagiglma tau kuran, gagiglma i ene agitn goglkwa i gagiglma meglme dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Yegl dugwa ba Onan prukwa, Ye gak ta kuran, gak kurabuka i na gagrama ta moglkraiglme di prukwa. Yegl pre ye bogl swara pabrika igne, abu i ye wie goglkwa ikra gagigle ta kuglkrabedi, Onan niglmo yoko makan mina edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Yegl erukwa i, Yawe gumuglo wagle mabuno kide boglkwa pre Yawe ye ama si goglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Yawe ye si goglko, Juda ye wam okuo Sela abu i inabuka kudugl goglsre, ye agigle suo giurere ama gogl dinabedi prukwa. Yegl prukwa pre ye ere mogl, ebiamo Tamar yegl di togwa, Ene we, ene ede ikne nen moglmara pidre, na wana Sela kade morabedi sugl mogl, abu werai moratniwa. Ye okuo ene inabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre Tamar ede ikne nem moglmara ogo, nem bogl pai miurka.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Ana bugla yugu tau ede ogo, Juda ebie goglkwa. Juda ebie i, yagl Sua abuglo ikra goglko, yoba kai erikwa. Kai ere kodigo, Juda ere mogl, ye yagl kabagle Hira, Adulam nem ikra bogl ede pi Juda nigl kogonmo yoba sipsipmo yugo baiglmara ede ebrika. Ye sipsip yugo baiglmara i, dumo Timna we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Ye ede ebriko, yoba tau ere mogl, abu Tamar moglmara pi, ye di te, yegl digwa, Ene yuan yagl ede Timna pi sipsipmo yugo baragledi ede ome digwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Ana Tamar kanugwa, Juda wam okuo Sela ikra kade moglkwa ba ye Tamar ikrukwa. Yegl pre yoba Tamar ka di teigwa i ye prisre, abu werai kuguglmo gaglmo i gugl edidre, kugugl gagl pere tau edugwa. Edidre, lap ta idre, ye guma dra yoba kan dinaiglmedi guma dra si kegl didre, ye ede pi konbauna ta ede dumo Enaim suna omara konbauna nogagle bina ame di moglkwa. Konbauna nogagle i, konbauna ede dumo Timna omara yogwa.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Ana Juda ede u konbauna nogagle ikra udre, abu i kanugwa. Ye guma dra si kegl dugwa pre Juda ye kandre, konbauna abu ta moglmedi kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Ye ebiamo moglmedi kankre, konbauna abu ta moglmedi kanugwa pre ye ede pi abu i moglmara pidre, Nono bogl swara panabugle dugwa. Dugo, Tamar di ikne ede, Ene topo siragl mere natn, nono bogl swara panabugle? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yegl di pruko, Juda yegl dugwa, Na meme tau kuglka. Na yoba ta dedibo, ye meme nagigle ta yu, ene tenabiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, abu aglke kor yegl di prukwa, Ana na taraglnen ta ake moglbo, meme i yu natn, taraglnen te ikne edenagle di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yegl dugo, Juda ye di pre, Ene siragl taragl inatne? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Tamar di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ring ta toginga, ene kagn ring i mina beglkwa i narsre, te, muglbonen nare etn, ake moragle dugwa. Yegl dugo, Juda ye taragl i togo, bogl swara pabrika. Bogl swara pabriko, Tamar ye dane paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Ana, ye bogl swara pai kodibrika igne, Tamar aglke ede ikne pi, ye kipamara pidre, lap wagle guma dra si kegl dugwa ikra gugl edidre, abu werai kuguglmo gaglmo i aglke kor edugwa.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Ana okuo Juda ere mogl, kabaglemo Hira, Adulam nem ikra meme nagigle abu i tenagle dugwa ikra ye tedre, Juda taraglmo ama ikne edenabedi dedugo, ogwa. Ogwa ba ye abu i kankrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Abu kankrukwa pre ye ere mogl, makan nem yagl tau yegl di prukwa, Okna konbauna abu ta dumo Enaim konbauna bina moglkwa i, ye ede aglo ome? dugwa. Dugo, ye di ikne ede, Konbauna abu magigl i ta moglkrume digwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Yegl digwa pre Hira ede ikne Juda moglmara pidre, yegl dugwa, Na abu i doko eiga ba kankrika. Te, makan nem yagl dumo i meglkwa ama konbauna abu magigl i ta moglkrume dimiwe di, Hira yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yegl dugo, Juda di ikne ede, Ana kodo dugwa. Abu i na taraglnana ake morabuka. Nono meme nagigle ikra na ye di temere tenabugledi erubuglka ba abu i moglkrukwa. Nono ede ikne pi, dokubugl, yoba nono gauglno eribi, agai gorabugle dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Ana ba suota ede ogo, yoba tau ede Juda moglmara udre, ye yegl di teigwa, Ene ebian Tamar we, ye konbauna abu erimere yegl ersre, dane pamiwe digwa. Yegl digo, Juda dem boglko, yegl dugwa, Ene abu i yuio! Yuibi, nono ye si gagl tege eun, gorabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Dugo, yoba tau ede pi Tamar yunamnedi eigo, Tamar ere mogl, Juda taraglmo ikra yoba i tedre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene taragl i, i pi yuana yagl obuno di tedre, ka yegl dio! dugwa. Tamar we, dane paugwa i, yoba ta taragl i kan nogwa, yoba i bogl pabriko, dane paugwa. Yegl pre ene ring kan paduglkwa i ya muglbo i kan pogl sin, taragl i nem bogl pabriko, dane pame di pratniwe di, yegl dio! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Dugo, yoba i yegl eriko, Juda yene taraglmomo yogwa kanugwa. Kandre, yegl dugwa, Ye mabuno kide boglkrukwa. Na ye i pi wana Sela tekrika pre nana mabuno kide boluwe dugwa. Didre, ye okuo Tamar bogl, bogl swara paikribrika.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Ana Tamar ere mogl, gak kuglkwa igne, ye yagl gak pikagl suo kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Ye emnai kuragledi eruko, yagl gak swara ta ogo i meda edugwa. I meda edugo, abu ta Tamar ake ple dugwa i kan kebra gogl ta idre, ogo wagle toguma sidre, gak i komono moglme dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Yegl dugwa ba yagl gak i aglke kor ogo ake ikne edugo, ye agigle ta ede meda ugwa. Ede meda ugo, abu ikra Aya! dugwa. Ene siragl mere etne? Yoba kobuglo togl si buko didre, ede meda wimere mere yegl ede meda uniwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl pre yoba yagl gak i kagie Peres<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Peres i, mabuno paugwa, si buko di, ede meda ugwa mere yegl paugwa.</char></note> we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Peres ede meda ugo, okuo ye agigle ikra, abu kan gogl ta idre, ogo wagle toguma sugwa i ede meda ugwa. Yagl gak i, kagie Sera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Sera i, mabuno paugwa, gogl.</char></note> we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Potifar Josep nigl kogona morabedi sopo sugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Ana Ismael yoba ikra ye Josep i pi kantri Isip suna pidre, nigl kogon yoba morabedi topo bogl neigo, Isip nem ta kagie Potifar we digwa ikra ye topo sugwa. Yagl Potifar i, ye Isip king yobamo kade ta moglkwa. Ye soldia tau king yugumo sugl kan meglkwa i, bitno mogl, ye sugl moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Isip nem i ye Josep topo sugo, Josep ye sugl moglkwa yagl kipamara moglsre, nigl kogonmo ere togwa. Nigl kogonmo ere togwa i, Yawe ye moglmara mogl, ye ake ple di togwa pre ye kogon erukwa i, u wakai keme ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Kogon erukwa i, u wakai ogo, ye sugl moglkwa yagl ikra kanugwa. Kandre, yegl prukwa, Yawe Josep moglmara mogl, ake ple di tedre, kogon siragl mere erukwa i, u wakai enabedi erumiwe di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Yegl prisre, Josep ye nigl kogon wakai ere tomara i pre Josep wakai kandre, nigl kogonmo yoba mudu ya taraglmo mudu Josep swara sugl morabedi edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Edugwa igne, Josep Potifar taraglmo ya kogonmo mudu sugl moglkwa pre Yawe ye Potifar kogonmo mudu u wakai enabedi ere edugwa. Ye nigl kogonmo yoba kogonmo yugugl erikwa ya te, kaya mokna ere yaiglkwa mudu u wakai ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Yegl pre ye taraglmo mudu Josep sugl morabedi edidre, pre yubun dekre, kanige erukwa. Josep kogon wakai erukwa pre Potifar ye siragl kaya mokna nenabuka i keme pre moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Te, Josep we, ye guma dra wakai koglsre, ogo nagie wakai koglsre, erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Eruko, Potifar ebie ere mogl, Josep wakai kandre, Nono bogl swara panabugle dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Yegl dugwa ba Josep ere mogl, mane didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na sugl moglkwa yagl i, taraglmo mudu na sugl moraglka pre narukwa. Narsre, ye yugumo wagle kogon siragl mere paugwa i, pre yubun dekre, kanige erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Te, na ye nigl kogonmo yoba mudu bitno mere yegl edugo, na ye mudu sugl moglka. Sugl moglko, ene win ere mogl, taragl pra pra narukwa keme yogwa. Ene swara ye ebie motnga pre ene ta narekrukwa. Yegl pre na ene kunogl nenaglo? Yegl ta erekraglka. Mabuno i, mabuno kide kaima, God mane dumara pamiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Yegl dugo, abu i ege ege Josep kina sidre, Bogl swara panabugle dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba Josep ye kamo i prikre, ye moglmara ama magigl pikrukwa.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Ana aglke ta Josep ere mogl, kogon eragledi ede Potifar yugumo yugugl ogwa. Yugugl ogo, nigl kogon yoba tau ama yugugl moglkrikwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Yugugl moglkriko, Potifar ebie ere mogl, Josep moglmara u, ye gaglmo suna ake gi didre, Nono bogl swara pabuglo! dugwa. Dugo, Josep ye gaglmo suna i gugl kide kodidre, teke ede meda ogo, abu i ye gaglmo suna ake moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Ana Josep gaglmo suna gugl kide kodidre, teke ede meda ogo, abu i kandre, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14-15" />ye nigl kogonmo yagl agle dugo, wigwa. Wigo, ye yegl di togwa, Na gagl suna ake moglka i kanio! Na wina Hibru yagl ta nigl kogon yoba morabedi yugwa i, na wina ye mabuno kide ere norabuka pre yugwa pamiwa. Ye na moglmara u, na gudinagledi erukwa ba na grigle diga. Na grigle diga pre ye gaglmo suna erme ake moglka i, gugl kide kodidre, teke ede meda omiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 39:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Ana Potifar ebie ka yegl didre, ye Josep gaglmo suna ikra ye wie okuo ede ikne kipamara u kanabedi magigl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Yogo, ye wie okuo ede ikne ugo, ye ere mogl, yegl di togwa, Ene Hibru yagl ta nigl kogon erabedi yunga ikra erme na moglmara u mabuno kide ere naragledi erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Yegl erukwa ba na grigle diga. Grigle digo, ye gaglmo suna magigl i gugl kide kodidre, teke ede meda omiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Ana Potifar ebie ye Potifar di te, Ene nigl kogon yagl yunga i yegl erume dugo, Potifar kamo i prisre, dem podo boglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Dem podo boglko, ye Josep si ake, i pi kane yugu, king yoba si kane sumara dumo edugwa. Edugo, Josep kane yugu moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Josep kane yugu moglkwa ba Yawe ye Josep moglmara mogl, ye ake ple di tedre, ye ere wakai ere togwa. Yegl ersre, ye ama yagl ta kane yugu sugl moglkwa i, ye Josep wakai kanabedi ere edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Ere edugo, yagl i ere mogl, Josep kane yoba mudu ya kogon siragl mere kane yugu ta paugwa i, ye sugl morabedi edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Edugo, Yawe ye Josep moglmara mogl, kogon siragl mere erukwa i, mudu u wakai enabedi ye ake ple di togwa. Yegl pre yagl ta kane yugu sugl moglkwa i, kogon tau Josep togwa i, okuo pre yubun dekre, kanige erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yagl suo ugl kubu kanibriko, Josep mabuno di nogugl ede togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1-2" />Ana okuo Isip king yobamo kade suo ere mogl, king gumuglo wagle aglau ta eribrika. Aglau eribriko, king dem boglkwa. Yagl kade ta yoba nigl wain bekidre, i pi king suru teigwa i, ye sugl moglkwa. Te, yagl ta yoba bret gaglsre, i pi king teigwa i, ye sugl moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />King dem boglko, ye yagl suo i si kane sidre, i pi Josep kane yugu pai moglmara ikra edugwa. Ana soldia tau king yugumo sugl kan meglkwa ikra, yagl ta ye bitno mogl, sugl moglkwa ikra we, kane yugu i, ye yugomugl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />King yagl suo si kane yugu ikra edugo, yagl soldia bitno moglkwa ikra ere mogl, Josep ye yagl suo i sugl morabedi edugo, Josep ye sugl moglkwa. Josep ye sugl moglko, ege olto dagl kane yugu pai miurka. <verse eid="GEN 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Pai moglsre, yagl nigl wain king suru togwa ikra ya yagl king bretmo gagl togwa ikra ere mogl, eduer ege swara igne ugl kubu pere pere kanibrika. Yagl swara ta ugl kubu kanugwa i, mabuno ta paugwa. Te, yagl ta ugl kubu pere ta kanugwa i, mabuno pere ta paugwa.<verse eid="GEN 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6-7" />Ana Josep ya yagl suo i, ye akie Josep sugl moglkwa yagl ikra yugomugl mina kane pai meglko, yagl suo i ugl kubu kanibriko, Josep tagna mogl ye Isip king yobamo kade suo i miurara udre, nomane podo sibriko, kanugwa. Kandre, ye di te, Ene nomane sibredi kanie dugwa. Didre, ye ama yegl di prukwa, Ene siragl eruko, nomane si miure? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Yegl di pruko, yagl suo i di ikne ede, Josep yegl di tebrika, No eduer ugl pai, kubu pere pere kanubuglka ba yoba igle ta mabuno di nogugl ede norabuka ta moglkrukwa pre nomane si mugle dibrika. Dibriko, Josep aglke kor dugwa, Yoba ugl kubu kanigwa i, God yene ere mogl, yoba ugl kubu mabuno i di tenaiglmedi i nogugl ede tenan, yoba ugl kubu kanigwa i mabunomo di tebi, praiglkwa. Ene ugl kubu kanibrika i, di nariro! di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Joseph in prison" file="FM 057 Joseph in Prison_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="40.9" />Ana Josep ka yegl dugwa pre yagl ta yoba nigl wain bekidre, i pi king suru teigwa ye sugl moglkwa i ere mogl, ugl kubu kanugwa ikra Josep di togwa. Ye yegl dugwa, Na ugl kubu kaniga i, ede wain ta kaniga. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Ede wain i mina yogagle suota sugwa. Sugo, yogagle i yaudo sugwa. Yaudo sugwa igne i kie ama tabre sidre, wain mogo kogl, bogl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Bogl yogo, na king kapmo akidre, wain mogo i nuglo duko ede king kapmo mina atne edidre, kap i pi king ogo mina ede teye di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yagl i ka yegl di kodugo, Josep ye di te, Ene ugl kubu kanga i, mabuno yegl pame dugwa. Ede wain yogagle suota i, ege suota mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />King ege suota mogl, ene i meda edidre, kogon okna etnga i, aglke kor eratnedi edenabuka. Edinan, ene okna nigl wain king kapmo wagle kogl i pi king tenere yegl mere aglke kor eratnga. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Ba ene motnara taragl wakai yegl plau dinan we, ene na mitna goglsre, na kana i pi king di ten, ye na ama i meda edenabedi prika. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Na okna Hibru yoba kipaimara moglka ba yoba tau na kunogl kane si yu, na nigl kogon yoba morabedi mige bogl neigwa. Te, na dumo Isip magigl i moglka igne, na ama aglau ta erekrika. Ye mabuno paikrumara na si kane sidre, kane yugu edimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Ana Josep ka yegl dugo, yagl ta yoba bret gaglsre, i pi king teigwa ye sugl moglkwa i, ye mabuno wakai ta di nogugl edugwa i prisre, ye ere mogl, Josep yegl di togwa, Na ugl kubu kaniga i, degigl gagl suota kaniga. Degigl gagl suota i mina bret grikwa, atne moglkwa. Ana na degigl gagl suota i, i tebe tebe ede, bitna wagle padiglka. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Bitna wagle padiglko, degigl gagl ta tebe kaima padiglka i mina bret ya bisket kane kane king pre gaiglkwa i grikwa, atne moglkwa. Atne moglko, kua tau u bret ya bisket i ere nemiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yagl i ka yegl di kodugo, Josep ye di te, Ene ugl kubu kanga i, mabuno yegl pame dugwa. Degigl gagl suota i, ege suota mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />King ege suota mogl, ene i meda edidre, nugun gare edenabuka. Yegl eran, ene ogn nagn i pi ede mina wedigl yenan, kua u, ogn nagn mie nenaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Ana ege suota ede ogo, king mam ye kuglkwa igne egemo yogwa. Yegl pre ye ere mogl, yobamo kade Kaya mokna podo nenaiglmiwa wio! dugo, wigwa. Udre, ne meglko, king ama yagl suo ikra ye wain nuglo ya bret sugl miurka i, i meda ede, ye yobamo kade kanaiglmedi edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Edidre, ye yagl ta yoba nigl wain bekidre, i pi king suru teigwa ye sugl moglkwa i, kogon okna erukwa i aglke kor erabedi edugo, ye aglke kor wain i pi king togwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Te, yagl ta yoba bret gaglsre, i pi king teigwa ye sugl moglkwa i, Josep ye yagl suo i di nogugl ede tomere yegl mere king ye si goglsre, ede mina wedigl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugwa ba yagl ta nigl wain i pi king suru togwa i, ye Josep kamo king di tenabuka i, di tekre, kina torua sugwa.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Isip king ugl kubu ta kanugo, Josep mabuno di nogugl ede togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Ana okuo bugla yugu suo ede ogo, Isip king ere mogl, ugl kubu ta kanugwa. Ye ugl kubu kanumara i, kanugwa, ye nigl Nail we dimara i, nigle bina adigl moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Ye nigle bina adigl moglko, kau 7-pela nigl Nail mina plau didre, ede mitna u kugl nigle bina moglmara ne meglkwa. Kau 7-pela i, podo mogl, wam podo beglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Ye kugl ne meglko, kau 7-pela kor nigl Nail mina plau didre, ede mitna wigwa. Kau 7-pela kor wigwa i, wam paikre, yobuglno mogigwa. Ye ede mitna udre, kau wakai 7-pela ikra meglmara pi magigl meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Magigl moglsre, ye ere mogl, kau 7-pela wakai i mudu si neigwa. King ugl kubu yegl kandre, aduglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Ana Isip king aglke kor ugl padre, ugl kubu kor ta kanugwa. Ye ugl kubu ta kanugwa i, kugl mogo edie swara ta adigl paugo, kanugwa. Ana kugl mogo edie swara i, piglade si, bage 7-pela koglkwa. Te, kugl mogo koglkwa i, podo kogl, wakai kaima keglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Koglko, kan moglko, okuo edie swara i mina bage 7-pela aglke kor koglkwa. Koglkwa ba kugl mogo okuo koglkwa i, ir niga dugwa ta ade umara u sugwa pre kebra keglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Ana kan moglko, kugl mogo bage 7-pela kebra keglkwa i ere mogl, kugl mogo bage 7-pela komono kana podo keglkwa ikra mudu si neigwa. King ugl kubu yegl kandre, aduglkwa. Aduglkwa igne, ye ugl kubu kaniedi pre pogl sugwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Ana king tagna mogl aduglkwa igne, ye nomane sugwa pre ye kumo giai yoba ya yoba nomane podo paugwa dumo Isip meglkwa i mudu agle dugo, wigwa. Wigo, king ugl kubu suo kanugwa i ye di togwa ba ye pre pogl sikrikwa pre mabuno di nogugl ede tekrikwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Ana king ugl kubu kanugwa i, yoba swara ta mabuno di nogugl ede tekriko, yagl ta yoba nigl wain bekidre, i pi king suru teigwa ye sugl moglkwa ikra ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Aya, na aglau erika. Na ka ta okna ene di tenaglka paugwa ba na ene di tekrika. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Ene aglke ta na den kubro narsre, yagl ta yoba bret gaglsre, yu ene teigwa ye sugl moglkwa i, den kubro tedre, etnga. Yegl ersre, ene no si kane si i pi kane yugu edinga. Kane yugu i, yagl ta soldia tau ene yugun sugl kan meglkwa ye bitno moglkwa i, yugomugl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Ene no si kane si i pi kane yugu edingo, no suo akie eduer ege swara mina ugl kubu pere pere kanubuglka. Ugl kubu kanubuglka i, mabuno pere pere paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Ana kane yugu i mina Hibru yagl kulu ta ama moglkwa. Ye yagl ta soldia tau sugl moglkwa ikra nigl kogonmo yagl moglkwa. No ugl kubu pere pere kandre, yagl i di tobuglka. Di tobuglko, ye ugl kubu kanubuglka i mabuno pere pere paugwa i, di nogugl ede norukwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Di nogugl ede noruko, ye dumere pai yugwa. Ene na kogon okna erika aglke kor eratnedi dedidre, yagl ta bret sugl moglkwa ikra si gogl, ede mina wedigl yeniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Yagl wain sugl moglkwa i ka yegl dugo, king ye yoba tau Josep yunaiglmedi dedugwa. Dedugo, ye ede pi Josep tabre kane yugu i meda edigwa. I meda edigo, ye pauna yugo guglidre, kugugl gagl kor edidre, ede pi king moglmara ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Ye ede king moglmara ogo, king ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na ugl kubu ta kaniga ba yoba ta mabuno di nogugl ede naraiglkwa kuno erekrukwa. Yoba ta di nogugl ede narekrikwa ba yoba ta di nare, yegl dugwa, Yoba ugl kubu kanigwa i, Josep prisre, mabuno di nogugl ede kanumiwe di, yegl dugo, prie di, king yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />King yegl dugo, Josep di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Nana di nogugl ede tenaglka kuno erekrabuka. Ba God we, ye mabuno di nogugl ede tenabuka. Tenan, ene den mudn aragan erabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Josep ka yegl dugwa pre king ere mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Na ugl kubu kaniga i, na nigl Nail bina adigl moglka. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Adigl moglko, kau 7-pela nigl Nail mina plau didre, ede mitna u, kugl nigle bina moglmara ne meglkwa. Kau 7-pela i, podo mogl, wam podo beglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Ye kugl ne meglko, kau 7-pela kor nigl Nail mina plau didre, ede mitna wigwa. Kau 7-pela kor wigwa i, kide meglkwa. Ye wam paikre, yobuglno mogigwa. Kau 7-pela kide meglkwa i, na dumo Isip suna kau kide yegl ta okna kankrika. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Ana kau kide wam paikre, yobuglno mogigwa i ere mogl, kau 7-pela wakai i mudu si neigwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Mudu si ne kodigwa ba yoba ta ye kandre, taragl podo nemedi kankraiglkwa mere yegl meglkwa. Ye okna wam paikre, yobuglno mogigwa i, yegl mere mogl pai meglkwa. Na yegl kandre, adiglka. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Na adiglsre, kuri ta mogl, aglke kor ugl padre, ugl kubu kor ta kaniga. Ugl kubu kor ta kaniga i, kugl mogo edie swara ta adigl paugo, kaniga. Kugl mogo edie swara i mina bage 7-pela mogo wakai kogl, mere kide keglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Ana okuo edie swara i mina mogo aglke kor bage 7-pela koglkwa. Koglkwa ba kugl mogo bage 7-pela okuo keglkwa i, ir niga dugwa ta ade umara u sugo, mogo i kebra kogl, gigle geglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Ana kugl mogo bage 7-pela kebra kebra keglkwa i ere mogl, mogo bage 7-pela wakai keglkwa i mudu si neigwa. Na ugl kubu yegl kandre, tagna kana adiglka igne, na kumo giai yoba di teiga ba yoba swara ta mabuno i di nogugl ede naraiglkwa kuno erekrukwa. Di nogugl ede narekrimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Ana king ka yegl di kodugo, Josep ere mogl, king yegl di togwa, Ene ugl kubu suo kanga i, mabuno swara paugwa. Ugl kubu suo kanga i mina God taragl ta erarukwa i, ene i nogugl ede togwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Kau 7-pela wakai meglkwa i ya kugl mogo bage 7-pela wakai koglkwa i, bugla yugu 7-pela pre yegl paugwa. Ugl kubu suo kanga i, mabuno swara paugwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Te, kau 7-pela wam boglkre, yobuglno mogigwa, ye okuo ede mitna wigwa i ya kugl mogo bage 7-pela koglkwa, ir niga dugwa ade umara u sugwa pre kebra koglkwa i ama bugla yugu 7-pela pre yegl paugwa. Ba bugla yugu 7-pela i, kidan podo yenabuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Na ene di teiga ikra we, God taragl ta erarukwa ene i nogugl ede togwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Ene pro! Komno kana, bugla yugu 7-pela dumo Isip mudu kaya mokna podo kide panabuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30-31" />Ba bugla yugu 7-pela i dudinan, bugla yugu 7-pela ta kidan podo yenabuka. Kidan podo kide kaima yenan, dumo Isip u kide kaima enabuka pre yoba Isip meglkwa kidan podo geglbi, okna bugla yugu 7-pela kaya mokna podo paugwa i, kinano torua sinabuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Te, ene ugl kubu swara keme kankre, suo kanga i we, mabuno yegl paugwa, God ye taragl yegl plau dinabedi padigl kodidre, tabre ere edenagledi prukwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />Yegl pre ene yagl ta nomane wakai panabuka, konbauna wakai sinabuka yagl ta doko kanatnedi prika. Doko kan, yagl i dumo Isip sugl morabedi dedenatniwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34-35" />Yagl i dumo Isip sugl morabedi dedidre, yagl kade tau ama dumo Isip sugl moglsre, kugl mogo si makai sinaiglmedi dedenatnga. Dedin, ye bugla yugu 7-pela kaya mokna podo panabuka igne i yoba Isip suna kugl mogo mudu si yunaiglkwa i, br 5-pela beglbi, br swara ta inaiglkwa. Ibi, ene ka giglede ta di padigln, ye i pi ene dumonen pere pere makai sidre, yoba kunogl i dinaiglmedi soldia tau sugl kan moraiglmedi dedenaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:34-35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Ana kugl mogo si makai sinaiglkwa i we, bugla yugu 7-pela dumo Isip kidan yenabuka i mina Isip yoba ne moglsre, goglkraiglmiwe di, Josep yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">King ere mogl, Josep dumo Isip sugl morabedi dedugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Ana Josep ka yegl dugo, king ya ye yobamo kade wakai prikwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Wakai priko, king ere mogl, ye yobamo kade yegl di togwa, Yagl i we, God Murubuglomo ye moglmara suna moglkwa. Yagl ye mere yegl ta dokumun, ta kankramgo priwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />King ye yobamo kade yegl di tedre, ye ere mogl, Josep yegl di togwa, Taragl ta plau dinabuka ikra God ene swara di nogugl ede togwa. Yegl pre ene swara nomanen podo paugo, konbauna wakai singa yagle motnga. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Na kantri ta bitno mogl, sugl moglka i, ene sugl moratnga. Sugl motn, na yobanama mudu ene kanen prisre, duglo boraiglkwa. Na swara king moglka pre na ene bitn moraglka ba ene yoba mudu bitno mere yegl moratniwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Na erme ene dumo Isip mudu sugl moratnedi dediwe di, king yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />King yegl didre, ye ring ta ogo mogo mina paduglkwa gugl edidre, Josep ogo mogo mina padigl togwa. Ring i mina king kagie bogl padiglkwa. Ye ring i Josep ogo mogo mina padigl tedre, kugugl gagl kruo wakai yogwa tau ede tedre, gol bisi nugu ta nugu mina togo togwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />King yegl ersre, ye ama Josep karis mina wanabedi karismo ta togwa. King karismo suo yogwa. Karismo namba 1 mina king yene wanugwa ba ye karismo namba 2 yogwa i, Josep togwa. Togo, Josep dumo aglo mere ta ogwa i, yoba tau ede okna pi, Agai teo! digwa. King yegl ere, Josep swara ye dumo Isip sugl morabedi edugwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />King yegl ersre, ye ama Josep di te, yegl dugwa, Na swara king moglka ba Isip yoba mudu ene kanen praiglkwa. Ye siragl taragl eramnedi praiglkwa i, ene di prisre, eraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Yegl didre, king ama Josep kagie kor, Safenat Panea we dugwa. Yegl ersre, ye ama abu ta kagie Asenat we digwa i, Josep ebie morabedi Josep togwa. Asenat nem kagie Potifera we digwa. Ye dumo Isip suna taun Heliopolis we dimara moglsre, Isip yoba godno tawa togwa yagle moglkwa. King abu i Josep togo, Josep abu i yugwa. Ye abu idre, ere mogl, ede bage bage pi, dumo Isip kanugwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Ana Josep ye mabuno bogl Isip king kogonmo erukwa igne, bugla yugu 30 nogwa. Ye king moglmara kide kodidre, dumo Isip suna ede bage bage pi, kogonmo erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Josep bugla yugu 7-pela kaya mokna mere morabe dugwa ikra, Isip suna kaya mokna mere kide moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yegl pre Josep ere mogl, bugla yugu 7-pela i mina kugl mogo mere idre, i pi taun swara swarade makai sugwa. Taun swara swarade mina kugl mogo taun i bina si yuigwa i, taun i mina makai sugwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Josep yegl ersre, kugl mogo mere kide makai sugwa. Ye komono kana skel ersre, makai sugwa ba kugl mogo i, wesan mudi nigl bina mere kide moglmere yegl mere yogwa pre ye skel erabuka kuno erekrukwa. Kuno erekrukwa pre ye skel erukwa i kide kodidre, yoko si makai sugwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Ana kidan podo yenabuka igne ukrukwa pai moglko, Josep ye ebie Asenat bogl wano suo kiurka. Asenat, ye Potifera tawa togwa yagle taun Heliopolis we dimara moglkwa ikra, abuglo moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Josep ya Asenat wano komono kiurko, Josep ere mogl, yegl dugwa, God na yubun podo iga ikra kinana torua sidre, nina agrama ama kinana torua sinabedi erumiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl didre, ye wam komono kagie Manase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Manase ya torua sugwa magigl magigl pabrika.</char></note> we dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Te, ye wam okuo kuglkwa igne we, yegl dugwa, Na yubun podo imara dumo magigl i, God gak i narumiwe dugwa. Yegl didre, ye kagie Efraim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina, kagie Efraim ya gak kuglkwa magigl magigl pabrika.</char></note> we dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Ana bugla yugu 7-pela dumo Isip kaya mokna podo paugwa ikra dudugo, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Josep okna dumere kidan podo bugla yugu 7-pela yenabuka ikra ugwa. Ugo, kantri pere pere ama kidan podo yogwa ba dumo Isip suna koglo koglo i we, kugl mogo si makai sigwa ikra yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Yegl pre kidan podo yenabuka ikra ugwa igne, Isip yoba mudu kidan goglsre, king moglmara pi Bret noro! digo, king ere mogl, Ene pi Josep moglmara pio! dugwa. Josep moglmara ebi, ye ka siragl mere ene di tenabuka i, erio! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Yegl pre dumo Isip ya kantri mudu kidan podo yogwa igne i Isip yoba Josep moglmara wigo, Josep yugu pere pere kugl mogo makai sumara dua yauruko, ye kugl mogo topo sigwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Te, kantri pere mudu ama kidan podo yogwa pre yoba kantri pere mudu meglkwa ama ede Isip u Josep moglmara kugl mogo topo sinamnedi wigwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Josep agiglema kugl mogo topo sinamnedi ede dumo Isip wigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Ana okuo yoba ere mogl, Dumo Isip we, kugl mogo yomiwe digo, Jekop prukwa. Jekop prisre, ye wama yegl di prukwa, Ene siragl pre yoko mogl, kan ikne ikne ede meglme? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Jekop yegl di prisre, ye ama yegl dugwa, Ene prio! Dumo Isip we, yoba tau kugl mogo yomedi di nariko, prika. Ene ede Isip pi, kugl mogo topo si yuibi, nono ta goglkramga. Kor moramniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Jekop yegl dugo, Josep agiglema 10-pela ede nigl beye pi, kugl mogo topo sinamnedi ede Isip eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Ye ede eigwa ba Josep agigle ta mano swara moglkwa, ye kagie Benjamin we digwa i we, ye enabuka Jekop mane dugwa. Ye taragl kide ta plau dinan, Benjamin gogl dinabe di prisre, kudugl gogl, mane dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Yegl pre Jekop, kagie ta Israel, wama 10-pela i keme ede Isip eigwa. Dumo Isip kidan podo yomere yegl mere dumo Kenan ama kidan podo yogwa. Kidan podo yogwa pre yoba tau mere ede Isip pi kugl mogo topo sinamnedi ede eigo, Jekop wama akie eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Joseph's brothers bowing" file="FM 059 Joseph's Brothers Bowing_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="42.6">Josep agiglema u ye moglmara magide teigwa</figure>Ana Josep we, ye dumo Isip mudu sugl moglkwa pre Isip yoba kugl mogo topo si neigwa i, ye Josep moglmara udre, topo sigwa. Te, ye agiglema 10-pela ikra ama Josep moglmara udre, goglkono bodugl, gumano drano i pi makan mina edigwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Edigo, Josep ye gumano drano kanugwa ba ye na ye agro moglmedi kan dinaiglmedi yoba pere ta moglme dinaiglmedi ersre, ka kodo di, Ene dumo aglo mogl wime? di, yegl di prukwa. Di pruko, ye di ikne ede, No dumo Kenan munga, kugl mogo topo sina umniwe digwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Ana Josep ye agiglema gumano drano kanugwa ba ye guma dra kankre, yoba pere moglmedi kanigwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Josep ye kandre, ye okna ibo ugl kubu kanugwa ikra pre moglsre, agiglema yegl di togwa, Ene no kuda ikne meglkwa pamiwa. Ene yoba kugl mogo topo sigwa mere yegl ede Isip suna udre, okuo kuda bogl noramnedi dumo tau soldia mere moglkrimara doko daka ere kanamnedi wimiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10-11" />Josep yegl dugo, ye agiglema di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl kade yo, no ene nigl kogonen yoba mere yegl muniwa. No dumo Isip doko daka ere kandre, okuo kuda bogl tenamnedi, yegl pre ukrumniwa. No neno swara moglko, no mudu agigle agigle moglsre, ka kaima dumga yoba munga. No ka kaima kugl mogo topo sinamnedi umniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yegl digwa ba Josep aglke kor dugwa, I ta manugwa. Ene dumo tau soldia mere moglkrimara doko daka ere kanamnedi wimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Josep yegl dugo, ye agiglema ama aglke kor digwa, No ene nigl kogonen yoba mere yegl muniwa. No yagl swara gagiglma munga. No neno dumo Kenan moglkwa. Te, no agigle agigle munga i, okna 12-pela munga. No agro swara ta goglko, ta okuo kaima moglkwa i erme neno bogl akie dumo Kenan miuriwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Ana Josep agiglema ka yegl di kodigo, Josep aglke kor yegl dugwa, Na ene di te kodiga! Ene no kuda ikne moglsre, okuo kuda bogl noraiglkwa pre dumo Isip doko daka ere kanamnedi wigwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Yegl pre na ene yegl ere kanaglka. Ene agro okuo pre digwa i magigl i ta unan, na kankribo, ene ede ikne dumono pikraiglkwa. Na king kagie mina ene ka kaima di teiga. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Yegl pre ene swara ta ede ikne pi agro okuo auro yunatnga. Te, ene tau we, kane yugu panaiglkwa. Yagl swara ta agro okuo i auro yunan, na ene ka kaima dimedi prisre, ene kane yugu i meda edenaglka. Ba ye ta auro yukran, na king kagie mina ene ka kaima di teiga. Ene ka kaima kuda ikne moglsre, dumo Isip doko daka ere kanamnedi wigwa pamedi praluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Yegl didre, ye agiglema mudu i pi kane yugu edugo, ye ege suota paigwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Ana Josep agiglema ege suota kane yugu pai meglko, Josep ye mudu i meda edidre, yegl di togwa, Na we, na God kuduglmo goglka. Yegl pre ene na ka ta dinaglmere eribi, yoko moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19-20" />Ene swara ta magigl i kane yugu pai morabuka. Ba ene tau we, kugl mogo i pi neno agroma kidan paigwa i tenaiglmiwa. Ene tedre, agro okuo auro yu, na moglmara edibi, na ene ka kaima digwa yoba meglmedi pribo, ene ta goglkraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye agiglema pra we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Ana Josep agiglema ye Josep moglmara mogl pai moglsre, yene kano mina di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Nono we, nono kaima agro okuo mabuno kide ere tomga pre erme yubun podo yumga. Nono ye kudugl goglsre, nomane podo sugwa i kandre, ye Ake ple di nario di, kamage yogwa i prisre, yegl erumga ba nono ye ake ple di tekrumga. Yegl pre nono erme yubun podo yumniwe digwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Yegl digo, Ruben ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Na ene okna di teiga ikra we, Josep mabuno kide ere tekrio! diga. Na yegl diga ba ene na kana prikrikwa. Yegl pre ye okuo pi goglkwa i, nono mabuno munga pre yubun podo inamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Josep agiglema yene kano wagle yegl didre, Josep ye kano prikrumedi prikwa. Josep ye ka di togwa i, Isip ka dugo, ka yake togwa yagle ta kamo yake te, ye agiglema di togwa pre ye kano prikrumedi prikwa. Yegl prikwa ba Josep ye ka digwa i prisre, <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />kai eragledi ere, ye meglmara kide kodidre, ede pi kai erukwa. Ye kai ere kodidre, ye meglmara ede ikne udre, ka tau ama ye di togwa. Ka tau ye di tedre, ye ere mogl, ye agigle Simeon swara yugo, yoba ye si kane sigwa. Ye si kane sigo, ye agiglema tau kan meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep agiglema ede ikne dumo Kenan eigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Ana okuo Josep ere mogl, ye nigl kogonmo yoba di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl i bek yuigwa i idre, kugl mogo kau sinabedi atne edidre, mige silva norikwa i ama te ikne ede bekno mina atne edidre, te, kaya mokna tau konbauna bage nenaiglmedi ama teo! di, yegl dugo, ye nigl kogonmo yoba ye dumere erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Yegl eriko, Josep agiglema bek i donkino mokono mina padiglsre, ede eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Ye konbauna pidre, bage ta eduer panamnedi ere meglkwa. Ere meglko, yagl swara ta kugl mogo tau donkimo tenagledi bekmo yaursre, migemo silva ikra bek mina atne paugo, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Kandre, ye agiglema di te, yegl dugwa, Aya! Na mige silva kugl mogo pre topo siga i, ikne ediga. Bek mina atne pamiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye kudugl goglsre, ogono gagno nuglo didre, yene di ikne ikne ede, God siragl mere ere norume? di, yegl di prikwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Ana Josep agiglema konbauna pi moglsre, ye neno Jekop dumo Kenan moglmara plau didre, siragl taragl ye meglmara plau dugwa i ye di teigwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />Ye yegl digwa, Yagl ta dumo Isip sugl moglkwa i, no ka kodo di norsre, no kuda ikne tau dumo Isip doko daka ere kanamnedi wimedi kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Ba no ere mogl, ye yegl di tomga, No kuda ikne mogl, dumo Isip doko daka ere kanamnedi ukrumga. No ka kaima dumga yoba muniwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />No neno swara moglko, agigle agigle munga. No okna 12-pela munga ba agro swara ta goglkwa. Te, no agro okuo kaima moglkwa i, erme neno bogl dumo Kenan miuriwe di, yegl dumga. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33-34" />No yegl dumgo, ye di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene swara ta magigl i moran, ene tau kugl mogo i pi neno agroma kidan paigwa i tenaiglmiwa. Tedre, agro okuo auro yu, na moglmara obuno dibi, na ye kandre, ene kuda ikne mogl, dumo Isip doko daka ere kanamnedi ukrimedi praglka. Ene ka kaima dimedi prisre, ene agro swara ta magigl i morabuka i te ikne edibo, ene praiglmere wan mogl, kugl mogo topo sinaiglmiwe di, yagl i yegl dumiwe digwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:33-34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Ana okuo Josep agiglema i ere mogl, kugl mogo i meda edinamnedi bek mudu yaurikwa. Yaursre, migeno silva mudu bek kebra wagle bek mina atne paugo, ye neno bogl kanigwa. Kandre, ye kudugl geglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Ye kudugl geglko, ye neno Jekop ye yegl di togwa, Ene na gagrama mudu wau boraiglmedi erikwa. Josep goglko, Simeon magigl i moglkruko, Benjamin ama idre ede enamnedi prikwa. Na moglmara taragl kide keme plau dumiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Yegl dugo, Ruben ere mogl, ye nem yegl di togwa, Na Benjamin idre, ede Isip pi, ta agre i ede ikne ukribo, ene na wana suo si goratniwa. Na ye suglmo morabedi dedin, na ye sugl moglsre, agre i ede ikne unaluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Yegl dugwa ba Jekop mane dugwa. Na wana Benjamin ene bogl pikraiglkwa. Ye agigle komono goglko, ye swara moglkwa. Ye ene bogl ede Isip ebi, konbauna bage ta goran, na kidagl yedre, bitna ikan ugwa pre ene ye idre, eimara i mirie goglsre, goraluwe di, Jekop yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Josep agiglema ere mogl, Benjamin idre, ede ikne dumo Isip eigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Ana dumo Kenan suna i, kidan podo yei pai moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Yei pai moglkwa pre Jekop wama kugl mogo dumo Isip topo sidre, yuigwa i, ye yobama bogl ne kodigwa. Ne kodigo, ye neno di te, Ene ede ikne pi, kugl mogo tau nono nenamga topo sio! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Yegl dugwa ba Juda di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl ikra ka kaima no di noro, Ene agro okuo ta agre yukribi, ene na gumana ta kankraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Yegl pre ene no agro okuo bogl akie enaiglmedi dedin, no pra, kugl mogo topo sinamnedi enamga. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Ba ene ta dedikitn, ta pikramga. Yagl ikra no di noro, Agro okuo ene bogl akie ukribi, ene na gumana ta kankraiglmiwe dugwa ikra pre pikramniwe di, Juda yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Juda ka yegl dugo, ye nem di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene ere mogl, yagl ikra di te, Agro okuo ta ama moglme digwa i, na mabuno kide ere narimiwe dugwa. Ene siragl pre dime? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ye ere mogl, Agro okuo agre yuio! dugwa i, ye yegl dinabedi prikrumga. Yene no di pre, Ene neno kor moglmo? didre, Agro ta ama moglmo? dugwa. Ye dugo, no yoko ka tau di prukwa i di ikne edumniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Ye yegl di kodigo, Juda ama ere mogl, ye nem Israel yegl di togwa, Na ene wan Benjamin sugl morabedi dedin, no ede enamga. Ta manan, no ene bogl ya gak kebra kunga i bogl mudu goramga. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Wan Benjamin dedin, na ka kaima ye sugl moraglka. Aglau ta panan, nana mabuno moraglka. Te, na ye i ede ikne u ene motnara ta edekribo, na aimadi kamin mabuno moraglka. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />No ta ene pra we dinatnedi sugl kan moglrumna, no ege suo ede Isip pidre, ede ikne u kodumgo we di, Juda yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Ana Juda ya ye agiglema neno Israel ere mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Konbauna pere ta yekran, ene yegl erio, taragl wakai kaima magigl i paigwa tau yagl i tenamnedi bek mina gre i ede enaiglmiwa. Ede nuglo tau demene wakai erukwa ya brume nuglo ya te, ede pistasio mogomo ya ede amon mogomo idre, ede enaiglkwa pre diga. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Te, mige silva we, Isip yoba ene te ikne edinamnedi primo mo prikrimo mo i ta kiurumga pre ene mige i, i pi tedre, mige tau kugl mogo kor topo sinamnedi i pidre, yegl eraiglmiwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Te, ene agro okuo ama idre, ede pi yagl i moglmara enaiglmiwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Ene ede ebi, God Yobuglo Podo Paugwa ye yagl i ene mitno gorabedi ere edenan, ye ene mitno goglsre, agro komono Simeon ya agro okuo Benjamin ene bogl akie ede ikne unaiglkwa pre pra we dinabiwa. Te, ye ta giur, na ye mitno goraglka mere yegl ta panan, yegl panabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Ana ye neno Israel ka yegl dugwa pre Josep agiglema taragl wakai tau ye tenamnedi idre, mige tau okna teigwa i ya mige tau kugl mogo aglke kor topo sinaiglkwa pre idre, agro okuo Benjamin ama idre, ede dumo Isip eigo, Josep agiglema mudu ye moglmara pidre, adigl meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Josep moglmara adigl meglko, Benjamin ye ama moglko, Josep kanugwa. Kandre, ye nigl kogonmo yagl ta ye yugumo sugl moglkwa i di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl magigl meglkwa i, ene ye i pi na yuguna yugugl edidre, agl bugla ta si keo! No belo igne kaya mokna akie nenamniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Josep yegl dugo, ye nigl kogonmo yagl i ye dumere ere, Josep agiglema agre i ede pi Josep yugumo yugugl edenagledi ogwa.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Ana Josep nigl kogonmo yagl i ye Josep agiglema agre i ede pi Josep yugumo yugugl edenagledi ogo, ye kudugl goglsre, ka di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Nono okna umga igne, migeno noro ikne ede, bek mina atne edigwa ikra pre nono yugugl edenabuka pamiwa. Ye mige i Ene kunogl nemiwe didre, nono nigl kogon yoba moraiglmedi no si kane sidre, donkinono ama inabuka mere pamiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Yegl didre, ye ede Josep yugumo pi yugugl enamnedi erikwa igne, Josep nigl kogonmo yagl ikra dua wagle adigl moglko, Josep agiglema ye moglmara magigl pidre, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />yegl digwa, Yagl kade yo, no okna ege swara ta ede dumo Isip magigl i kugl mogo topo sinamnedi umga. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />No u, kugl mogo topo sidre, ede ikne omga igne, no bage ta eduer ugl panamnedi ersre, bekno yaurumga, no swara swarade mige tomga i, mudu yagl swara swarade bekno mina atne paugo, kanumga. Yegl pre no mige i, idre, ede ikne umga. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Te, no mige pere ama kugl mogo aglke kor topo sinamnedi idre, umga. Ira no migeno gre ikne bek mina atne edugwa i, no ta kankrumniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Josep agiglema ka yegl digo, Josep nigl kogonmo yagl ta ye yugumo sugl moglkwa i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene nomane sikre, kudugl goglkrio! Ene Godno, ene neno Godmo ama moglkwa i, mige ikra ene tenagledi bekno mina atne edugwa pai dumiwa. Ene mige tau kugl mogo topo sinamnedi teigwa i, na i kodiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl didre, ye ede Simeon kane yugu moglmara pi, i meda edidre, agre i ede u Josep agiglema meglmara edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Edidre, ye Josep agiglema mudu agre i ede pi Josep yugumo yugugl edidre, ye kaglno nigl koraiglmedi nigl kogl togo, kaglno nigl keglkwa. Nigl keglko, Josep nigl kogonmo yagl i ama kugl tau i pi donkino nenaiglmedi togwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Te, Josep agiglema we, Josep, Belo igne kaya mokna akie nenamne dume digo, prikwa pre ye taragl tau ye tenamnedi yuigwa ikra i meda ede, ye tenamnedi ere wakai ere yeigwa.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Ana okuo Josep ede yugumo yugugl ugo, ye agiglema taragl tau ye tenamnedi yugugl yeigwa ikra tedre, goglkono bodugl, gumano drano makan mina edigwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Yegl eriko, Josep ere mogl, Ene wakai meglmo? didre, te, Ene neno kidagl pre digwa ikra we, pra moglmo? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Yegl di pruko, ye Owo digwa. No neno kidagl, ene nigl kogonen yoba mere yegl moglkwa i, wakai moglmiwe di, yegl didre, ye Josep pre i mitna edinamnedi goglkono aglke kor bodugl, gumano drano makan mina edigwa.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Ana Josep agiglema yegl eriko, Josep ere mogl, ye agigle okuo Benjamin, mano swara moglkwa i kandre, ye agiglema di prukwa, Ene agro okuo kaima ta moglme digwa ikra we, magigl i moglmo? di, yegl di prukwa. Yegl di pruko, ye Owo digo, Josep ere mogl, Benjamin yegl di togwa, Wana yo, God ene ere wakai ere tenabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Yegl didre, ye agigle okuo muduo prisre, kai nugu sugwa. Kai nugu sugwa pre ye tabre agiglema meglmara kide kodidre, dumo ta mogl, kai eragledi dokidre, ede kiule pamara pi, kai erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Ye kai ere kodidre, guma dra nigl koglsre, ede ikne agiglema meglmara ugwa. Ye ede ikne udre, aglke kor kai erabuka pai dugo, ye Na muduna prika i kan dinaiglme di kai erekre, ye nigl kogonmo yoba di te, Kaya mokna yu norio! dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Yegl dugo, ye nigl kogonmo yoba kaya mokna yu, yubu si teigwa. Ye yubu si teigwa i, kaya mokna tau Josep yene pere mogl nenabedi tedre, tau Josep agiglema pere mogl nenaiglmedi tedre, Isip yoba tau ege ege Josep yugumo mogl, kaya mokna neigwa i pere mogl nenaiglmedi tau tedre, erikwa. Isip yoba ye Hibru yoba bogl akie mogl, kaya mokna nenaiglkwa i, kide kaima prikwa pre erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Ana Josep nigl kogonmo yoba ye kaya mokna yubu si tenamnedi erikwa igne, Josep agiglema ye Josep gumamugl swara swarade aglo mere ame dinaiglkwa i ama obuno di teigwa. Ye obuno di teigwa i, Josep agiglema bugla yugu nemere obuno di teigwa. Ye agigle komono kaima moglkwa i, komono kana ame dinabedi obuno di tedre, ede pi ye agigle okuo kaima moglkwa i, okuo kaima ame dinabedi obuno di teigwa. Yegl eriko, Josep agiglema ye nagino koglsre, kan ikne ikne edigwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Josep nigl kogonmo yoba ye agiglema aglo mere ame dinaiglkwa i obuno di te kodidre, ye kaya mokna Josep tebolmo wagle idre, agiglema swara swarade nenaiglmedi yubu si teigwa. Ye yubu si teigwa i, Josep agiglema mudu ye yoba swara nenabere mere yegl yubu si teigwa ba ye agigle okuo Benjamin we, yoba 5-pela nenaiglmere mere yegl yubu si teigwa. Yubu si teigo, Josep agiglema ye Josep bogl kaya mokna mere nedre, wain nuglo mere nedre, erikwa.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep ye nigl kogonmo yagl ta dedugo, ye kapmo dokugwa</para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Ana Josep ya ye agiglema kaya mokna ya wain nuglo ne kodigo, Josep ere mogl, ye nigl kogonmo yagl ta ye yugumo sugl moglkwa i, yegl di togwa, Yagl wagle i bek tau yuigwa i, ene kugl mogo bek mina atne ede, si kau suo! Te, ye migeno ama gre ikne ede bek mina atne padiglsre, <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />na kapnana, silva mina bekigwa i, ye agro okuo bekmo mina ye migemo bogl akie bek mina atne gre padiglo! di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye nigl kogonmo yagl i ye dumere erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Eruko, Josep agiglema eduer ugl padre, kamun tagugwa igne adiglkwa. Adiglko, Josep nigl kogonmo yoba ye dedigo, ye donkino idre ede eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Ye ede taun bina pidre, eglke pikriko, Josep ere mogl, ye nigl kogon yagl ta ye yugumo sugl moglkwa i, yegl di togwa, Ene yagl wagle i sika si ede po! Sika si ede pi ene ye eimara pi ake idre, yegl dinatniwa, Na yaglna kade ene ere wakai ere togwa. Ene siragl pre ye ere kide ere teime? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Ene siragl pre kapmo kunogl ime? Kap i mina na yaglna kade wain nuglo ya ki toide nogwa. Te, ye ama kap i mina taragl tau okuo plau dinabuka i, i nogugl ede kanugwa. Ene kunogl igwa i, aglau podo erimiwe di, ene yegl dinatniwe dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Ana Josep ye ka yegl di kodugo, ye nigl kogonmo yagl i ye agiglema sika si pidre, ye eimara pi ake yugwa. Ye eimara pi ake idre, Josep ye Ka yegl dinatniwe dugwa i, ye di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Ye yegl di togo, Josep agiglema di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ene siragl pre ka yegl dine? No taragl yegl ta erekramga. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />No okna umga igne, mige tau bekno wagle atne paugo, kanumga ikra we, no te ikne edinamnedi yumga. Ene pitnga, no yegl ersre, yaglnen kade golmo mo silvamo yugugl yogwa i no kunogl nemedi pitno? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Yagl kade yo, ene kap i doko kano! Yagl swara ta kunogl yugwa panan, yagl i si goratniwa. Yagl i si gogln, no mudu ene nigl kogonen yoba moramniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Yegl digo, Josep nigl kogonmo yagl i yegl dugwa, Ana prawa, ene dimere yegl eraglka. Ene swara ta kunogl yunga panan, yagl i na niglna kogona yagl moran, ene tau yoko ede enaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Yegl dugo, Josep agiglema tabre bekno i atne edidre, yaurikwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Yauriko, Josep nigl kogonmo yagl i bek swara swarade mina atne kanugwa. Ye Josep agiglema bugla yugu nemere nemere bekno mina atne kan ogwa. Josep agigle komono bekmo, komono kana kandre, ede pi okuo kaima Benjamin bekmo mina kanugwa. Benjamin bekmo atne kanugo, kap ikra yogo, kanugwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Kanugo, Josep agiglema kide prisre, kuguglno gaglno ake argla didre, bekno aglke kor donkino wagle padiglsre, aglke ede ikne taun suna wigwa.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Ana Juda ye agiglema bogl aglke ede ikne taun suna udre, ede Josep yugumo eigo, ye yugugl mogl pai moglkwa. Mogl pai moglko, ye agiglema mudu ye moglmara pidre, kudugl goglsre, yage kobragai paigwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Ye makandigle kobragai paigo, Josep ye yegl di prukwa, Ene mabuno kide ere narikwa i, siragl pre erime? Yagl kade na moglmere yegl meglkwa i, yoba kunogl neigwa ya ki kan i nogugl edigwa i, ene prikrimo? di, yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yegl di pruko, Juda di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade yo, no Kunogl ikrumne dinamga i, siragl mere dinamne? God no tadaglmeno i nogugl edugwa. Yegl pre no agro okuo ene kapnen ake moglkwa ya te, no mudu ama erme ene nigl kogonen yoba muniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Juda yegl dugwa ba Josep di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ene mudu ta si kane sikraglka. Yagl swara ta kap ake moglko, kanigwa i, ye swara na nigl kogona yagl morabuka. Ba ene tau we, ene deno muduno wida dinan, ede ikne pi, neno moglmara ede enaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda ye Benjamin agaimo inagle dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Ana Josep ka yegl di kodugo, Juda ye moglmara magigl pidre, aglke kor yegl dugwa, Yagl kade yo, ene king moglmere yegl motniwa. Na ene nigl kogonen yoba moluwa. Na ka ta dibo, ene kubrokro. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Ene okna no di pre, Ene neno kidagl mo agro ta moglmo? dinga. <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Dingo, no di ikne ede, yegl dumga, No neno kidagl moglkwa. Te, no agro okuo kaima ta ama moglkwa. No agro okuo i, no neno, kidagl yei kodugwa igne kuglkwa. Ye agigle ta mano swara kuglkwa i, goglkwa pre erme ye wam swara i moglkwa. Ye neno kidagl muduo suna moglmiwe di, yegl dumga. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />No yegl dumgo, ene no di noro, Na ene agro okuo i kanaluwe dinga. Ene agre yu, na moglmara edio! di, yegl dinga. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Ene yegl dingo, no aglke kor dumga, No agro okuo i, nem moglmara kide kodokrabuka paugwa. Ye ta kide kodidre, ede unan, ye nem gorabiwe di, yegl dumga. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />No yegl dumga ba ene aglke kor dinga, Ene agro okuo i, ene bogl akie ukribi, ene na gumana ta kankraiglmiwe di, yegl dinga.<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Ana yagl kade yo, no okna ede ikne pi, no neno, ene nigl kogonen yagl mere yegl moglkwa i, moglmara omga igne, no ene dinere i ye di tomga. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />No di tomgo, ye ere mogl, okuo no di noro, Ene ede ikne pi, kugl mogo kuri ta nono nenamga pre topo sio! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Yegl dugwa ba no di ikne ede, No ta pikramniwe dumga. No agro okuo bogl akie enaiglmedi dedin, enamga. Ba ta manan, yagl ikra guma kankramniwe di, yegl dumga. <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Yegl dumgo, no neno, ene nigl kogonen yagl mere yegl moglkwa i, aglke kor dugwa, Na ebina wana suo keme kuglkwa i, ene pre kan erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Swara ta ede pi ikne ukruko, na Agl bugla are ye si paglke neigwa pame di, yegl diga. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Te, ta yoko moglkwa i, ene ye idre, ede Isip ebi, ye konbauna bage ta goran, na kidagl yedre, bitna ikan ugwa pre na ene ye idre, eimara i mirie goglsre, goraluwe di, neno yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30-31" />Yagl kade yo, no erme ede ikne pi, no neno moglmara ta omun, ye wam okuo i ta enan kankran, yagl gak i ye nem muduo suna moglkwa pre ye nem gorabuka. Yegl pre no yagl gak i agre i ede ikne pikrumun, neno kidagl, bre ikan ugwa i, no yubun ye tomga pre gorabuka. <verse eid="GEN 44:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Te, na ama ka giglede ta nina di te, yegl diga, Na Benjamin agre i ede ikne u, ene motnara ta edekribo, ene gumugln wagle aimadi kamin na mabuno moraluwe diga. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Yegl pre na ene erme di prika, Ene pra we din, na agra okuo i agaimo idre, ene nigl kogonen yoba moraluwa. Na ye agaimo ibo, na agra okuo agiglema bogl akie ede ikne enaiglmedi prika. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Ye no bogl akie pikrumun, na siragl mere ede ikne pi, nina moglmara enagle? Na nina mirie gogl, gorabuka i kanakrika pre die di, Juda yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Josep ere mogl, Na ene agro mole dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Ana Juda ka yegl di kodugo, Josep muduo prisre, kai nugu sugwa. Ye kai nugu sugo, ye nigl kogonmo yoba ya ki yugugl akie meglkwa i Josep kai eraglka i kan dinaiglmedi, ye ka podo di te, Ene ede meda pio! dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye ede meda eigo, Josep swara ye agiglema bogl meglkwa. Akie meglko, Josep ye ira moglkwa i ye agiglema di togwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Ye agiglema di togwa igne, ye kai podo erukwa. Kai podo eruko, Isip yoba ede meda eigwa ikra prikwa. Ye priko, ye tau ede king yugumo pi, yoba king yugumo meglkwa i ama di teigwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Ana Josep kai podo ersre, ye agiglema di te, Na Josep moliwe! dugwa. Didre, ye Nono neno kaima kor moglmo? di, yegl di prukwa. Di pruko, ye ka ta dikrikwa. Ye Yagl i ka kaima Josep moglmedi pre, kudugl podo goglsre, ka ta dinaiglkwa kuno erekrukwa.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Ana Josep ye agiglema aglke kor di te, Ene magigl ya wio! dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye ede magigl eigo, ye yegl dugwa, Na ene agro Josep moglka. Ene okna na Ismael yoba tedre, mige bogl neigo, ye na i ede u dumo Isip magigl i na nigl kogon yoba morabedi topo bogl neigwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Ene yegl erikwa ba erme we, ene na mitna goglkre, ene okna erikwa i pre yubun dekrio! God yene ere mogl, na ede okna udre, yoba ake ple dinabedi dedugwa. Na yoba ake ple di tebo, ye kor moraiglkwa pre dedugwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Kidan podo yogwa i, erme bugla yugu suo yei kodugwa ba bugla yugu 5-pela kidan podo yenabuka pai moglkwa. Bugla yugu 5-pela i wagle yoba kaya mokna ere yaglkre, si nekre, yegl eraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />God na ede okna enabedi dedugwa i, nono yugobunono kagie dudukrabedi ye taragl podo ersre, ene ake ple di tenagledi prukwa pre erukwa. Ye ene ake ple di tenan, ene kor moraiglkwa i pre diga. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Yegl pre ene na dedekrikwa. God yene ere mogl, na dedugwa. Na dedidre, na ake ple di naruko, na erme king nomane teiga yagle moglsre, ye yobama ya dumo Isip mudu sugl moglka.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Ana erme we, ene tabre ede ikne neno moglmara pidre, ye yegl di teo, Neno yo, ene wan Josep no ene Yegl di teo dugwa, God ere mogl, na dumo Isip mudu sugl morabedi edugwa. Yegl pre ene tabre na Isip moglmara ede wo! <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Ene un, ene Isip suna dumo makan ta Gosen we dimara na moglmara magigl kipanatnga. Ene gagiglnma ya gawanma bogl akie meme ya sipsip ya kau ki kiglkwa idre, bonaganano idre, ede unaiglmiwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Ene wibi, na ene sugl moraglka. Kidan podo yogwa i, bugla yugu 5-pela yei pai morabuka. Ene gagiglnma ya gawanma aglno buglano bogl kidan padre, u kide pi dinaiglmiwe di, Josep yegl di noruko, no erme ene di tomniwe di, yegl dio!<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Ene ya na agra kaima Benjamin kanigwa, na ka kaima Josep moglka. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Na erme dumo Isip magigl i yagl kade moglka te, ene taragl mudu kanigwa i, ene mudu pi neno di tedre, ye tabre agre i ede unaiglmiwe di, Josep yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Josep ka yegl di kodidre, ye agigle okuo Benjamin nugu kugro, kai erukwa. Yegl eruko, Benjamin ye ama nugu kugruko, ye kai akie eribrika. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Kai ere kodibriko, Josep ere mogl, agiglema swara swarade nuguno kugro, paunano si nedre, kai erukwa. Yegl ere kodugo, ye agiglema okna kudugl gogl, ka dikrikwa i aragan eruko, ye ka digwa.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Ana yoba tau Isip king yugumo pi, king ya ye yobamo kade di te, Josep agiglema wimiwe digo, ye wakai prikwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Wakai priko, king ere mogl, Josep yegl di togwa, Ene agiglnma di ten, ye yegl eraiglmiwa, ye bekno i pi donkino mokono bolamugl padiglsre, ede dumo Kenan enaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />Ye ede dumo Kenan pidre, ye neno ya ebinoma gagroma idre, aglke ede ikne u, na moglmara unaiglmiwa. Ye wibi, na dumo makan Isip suna wakai kaima ta yogwa, makan nuglo podo moglmara i ye tebo, ye kaya mokna wakai ere yagl ne moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Te, ene agiglnma ama di ten, ye hos karis tau magigl i idre, ede enaiglmiwa. Ye ede ikne unaiglkwa igne, ye ebino gagroma hos karis mina unaiglkwa pre diga. Te, ye neno kidagl ama idre, ede unaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Te, na taragl tau Isip suna wakai kaima tau yogwa i, ye tenaglka pre ye bonaganano tau kide kodidre, ede unaiglkwa i, pre yubun dekraiglmedi di to! Isip king ye Josep yegl di togwa.<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Ana Josep agiglema we, ye king dumere erikwa. Josep ere mogl, king ye di tomere hos karis tau i pi agiglema tedre, kaya mokna tau konbauna bage nenaiglmedi togwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Tedre, ye ama agiglema swara swarade kugugl gagl kor bagl togwa. Yegl erukwa ba ye agigle okuo Benjamin i, kugugl gagl 5-pela bagl tedre, mige silva 300 ama togwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Tedre, ye donki kumugl 10-pela idre, donki abai 10-pela idre, agiglema i pi nem kidagl tenaiglmedi togwa. Donki kumugl 10-pela i mina ye taragl wakai tau dumo Isip suna yogwa i, ye agiglema i pi nem kidagl tenaiglmedi donki mokono bolamugl paduglkwa. Te, donki abai mina ye nem kidagl ede ikne unabuka igne bret ya kugl mogo ya kaya mokna kane kane konbauna bage nenabedi i pi donki mokono bolamugl paduglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Josep yegl ersre, ye agiglema i, Ede pio! di togo, ye ede enamnedi erikwa. Ye ede enamnedi eriko, Josep ye di te, Ene konbauna bage kigl nonga erekrio! di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Ana Josep agiglema dumo Isip kide kodidre, ede pi ye neno dumo Kenan moglmara ede eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Ye ede pi neno moglmara plau didre, ye yegl di teigwa, Josep ta goglkrukwa. Ye erme yagl kade dumo Isip mudu sugl moglmiwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl digwa ba ye neno nagie koglsre, kibi dimedi prukwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Neno Jekop ye kibi dimedi prukwa ba ye wama ere mogl, Josep ka siragl mere dugwa i mudu di teigo, ye prukwa. Ka i prisre, Josep ye hos karis mina unabedi hos karis tau agiglema togwa i ama kandre, dem muduo aragan erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Ye neno Israel dem muduo aragan eruko, ye yegl dugwa, Ana prawa, ene na wana Josep kor moglme digwa i, kaima digwa pamiwa. Na pi ye kandre, okuo goraluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Israel ye yobama bogl ede dumo Isip eigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Ana yegl pre Israel ere mogl, ye taragl ere kuglkwa ya bonaganamo mudu idre, ede Isip enagledi ogwa. Ye ede pi dumo Berseba we digwa i plau didre, ye ere mogl, tawa tau ye nem Aisak Godmo togwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Ye God tawa tedre, ye eduer gumuglomugl eruko, God ye ka ta dugo, prukwa. God agle di, Jekop yo dugo, Jekop We, na mogliwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Jekop yegl dugo, God ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na God, ene nen Godmo moglka. Ene ede Isip enatnga i, kudugl goglkro! Ene en, ene gawanma dumo i meglbi, na ye mere kide moglsre, yugobuno pere ta moraiglmedi ere edenaglka. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Ene ede Isip enatnara i, na ene bogl akie obugl, ene sugl moraglka. Te, okuo na ene gawanma agre i ede ikne unaglka. Te, ene goratnga igne, ene Josep bogl akie miur, goratniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Ana God ka yegl di kodugo, Jekop yobama bogl ere mogl, dumo Berseba i kide kodidre, ede eigwa. Ede eigwa igne, ye wama ere mogl, ye ebino gagro ya ye neno Jekop i hos karis mina edidre, ede eigwa. Hos karis i, Isip king ye Jekop hos karis mina unabedi Jekop wama togwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Ye ebino gagro ya neno Jekop i hos karis mina edigo, Jekop ye gagiglma ya gawama bogl mudu ye aglno buglano ya bonaganano dumo Kenan mogl, yuigwa i, idre, ede Isip pi plau digwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Jekop ye wama ya abugloma mudu idre, ye gawama ama mudu idre, ede dumo Isip ogwa.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Ana Jekop gagiglma ya gawama mudu ede Isip eigwa i, ye kagno magigl i paugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:8">Jekop wam komono i, kagie Ruben we digwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Ruben yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Hanok ya Palu ya Hesron ya Karmi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Te, Jekop wam ta Simeon we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Jemuel ya Jamin ya Ohat ya Jakin ya Sohar ya Saul. Saul i, ye mam Kenan abu ta moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Te, Jekop wam ta Livai we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Gerson ya Kohat ya Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Te, Jekop wam ta Juda we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Er ya Onan ya Sela ya Peres ya Sera. Ba Er ya Onan suo akie dumo Kenan mogl, giurka. Ana Juda wam Peres ye ama yagl gak suo kuglkwa, kagno Hesron ya Hamul. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Te, Jekop wam ta Isakar we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Tola ya Puva ya Iop ya Simron. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Te, Jekop wam ta Sebulun we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Seret ya Elon ya Jalel. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Yagl i Jekop ya Lea dumo Mesopotemia mogl, yagl gak kiurka i kagno paugo, yagl gak i wanoma ama kagno paugwa. Te, ye ama abai gak ta kiurka, kagie Daina we digwa. Lea gagiglma ya gawama i swara ede, 33 meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Ana Jekop wam ta Gat we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Sifion ya Hagi ya Suni ya Esbon ya Eri ya Arodi ya Areli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Te, Jekop wam ta Aser we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Imna ya Isva ya Isvi ya Beria. Te, ye abai gak ta ama kuglkwa, kagie Sera. Ana Aser wam Beria ere mogl, yagl gak suo kuglkwa, kagno Heber ya Malkiel. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />I Jekop ebie Silpa wama kagno paugo, ye gawama ama kagno paugwa. Silpa i, Laban okna ye abuglo Lea nigl kogonmo ere tenabedi togwa. Ye wama ya gawama i swara ede, 16-pela meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Ana Jekop ebie Resel we, ye Josep ya Benjamin kuglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Ana Josep dumo Isip moglkwa igne, ye ere mogl, abu Asenat yugo, ye yagl gak suo kiurka, kagno Manase ya Efraim. Asenat, ye Potifera abuglo moglkwa. Potifera i, ye dumo Heliopolis moglsre, Isip yoba godno tawa togwa yagle moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Te, Jekop wam okuo Benjamin we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Bela ya Beker ya Asbel ya Gera ya Naman ya Ehi ya Ros ya Mupim ya Hupim ya Art. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />I Jekop ebie Resel wam suo kagno paugo, ye gawama ama kagno paugwa. Ye wam suo ya gawama i swara ede, 14-pela meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Ana Jekop wam ta Dan we, ye yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Husim. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Te, Jekop wam ta Naptali we, ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa, kagno Jasel ya Guni ya Jeser ya Silem. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />I Jekop ebie Bilha wama kagno paugo, ye gawama ama kagno paugwa. Bilha i, Laban okna ye abuglo Resel nigl kogonmo ere tenabedi togwa. Ye wama ya gawama i swara ede, 7-pela meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Ana Jekop gagiglma ya gawama, yoba bormai swara meglkwa mudu ede Isip eigwa i, yoba 66 eigwa. Yoba 66 i mina Jekop ebiama kere i suna edekrikwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Te, Josep dumo Isip moglkwa igne, ye yagl gak suo kuglkwa. Yegl pre Jekop ye wama ya gawama bogl akie ede Isip eigwa i swara ede, 70-pela meglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep Isip makan buglo bogl togo, ye kipai meglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Ana Jekop yobama bogl ede Isip pi plau digo, Jekop ere mogl, Juda ede okna pidre, Josep moglmara enabedi dedugwa. Ye ede pi Josep moglmara pidre, siragl konbauna duglo beglbi, ede Gosen enaiglkwa i, di prabedi dedugwa. Dedugo, ye ede ogo, Jekop yobama bogl ye mokomugl u, dumo makan Gosen we dimara wigwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Te, Josep we, ye karismo ere wakai ersre, ede dumo Gosen pi ye nem Israel kanagledi ede ogwa. Ye pi nem kidagl moglmara plau didre, ye nugo kugro, ege olto kai erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Kai ere kodugo, Israel ere mogl, ye wam Josep yegl di togwa, Na ene kam kuade goglnedi prika ba erme ene kor motngo, na ene guman dran kaniga. Yegl pre na erme goraglka i, aragan erie di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Ana Josep ere mogl, ye agiglema ya yobama mudu i yegl di togwa, Na ede pi king moglmara pidre, ye yegl di tenaglka, Yagl kade yo, na agrama ya yobanama mudu dumo Kenan kipaigwa i, ede u na moglmara wigwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Yagl wagle i we, ye sipsip ya ki sugl meglkwa yagle meglkwa. Ye sipsipno ya memeno ya kauno ki idre, bonaganano ama mudu idre, ede wimiwe di, yegl di tenaglka. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Ana king ere mogl, ene wio dinan, ene ede ebi, ye ene di pre, Ene siragl kogon erikwa, meglme? di, yegl dinan, <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />ene di ikne ede, yegl dinaiglkwa, No ene nigl kogonen yoba mere yegl muniwa. No kumugl munga igne ede u erme munga i pra, no kowano awano erimere ere, sisip ya ki sugl muniwe di, yegl dinaiglmiwa. Ene yegl dibi, ene dumo makan Gosen magigl i kipai moraiglkwa i, king prawa dinabuka. Isip yoba mudu ye sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba kide kanigwa pre ene ye meglmara moglkre, dumo Gosen magigl i kipai moraiglmiwe di, Josep yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Ana Josep ere mogl, Isip king moglmara pi, ye yegl di togwa, Na nina ya agrama we, ye dumo Kenan kide kodidre, ede u erme dumo Gosen meglkwa. Ye sipsip ya meme kiglkwa idre, kauno kiglkwa idre, bonaganano mudu idre, ede wimiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Josep yegl didre, ye ere mogl, agiglema 5-pela agre i ede pi king ye kanabedi king moglmara ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3-4" />Ogo, king ye di pre, Ene siragl kogon erikwa, meglme? dugwa. Dugo, ye di ikne ede, yegl digwa, No kowano awano erimere ere, sipsip ya ki sugl munga. No ene nigl kogonen yoba mere yegl muniwa. No okna dumo Kenan kipai munga ba dumo Kenan i ade podo dogo, no aglno buglano kugl nenaiglkwa ta paikrukwa. Ta paikrukwa pre no ege sugunagle ta moramnedi ede dumo Isip umga. Yegl pre erme we, ene pra we din, no Isip suna i, dumo Gosen we dimara moramniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 47:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Ana Josep agiglema 5-pela ka yegl di kodigo, king ere mogl, Josep yegl di togwa, Ana ene nen agiglnma erme ene motnara wigwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Ene dumo Isip mudu yomara suna i, dumo wakai kaima ta yomedi kanatnara i, ene nen agiglnma kipai moraiglmedi i pi edinatnga. Ene ye dumo Gosen kipai moraiglmedi pitn, moraiglkwa. Te, ye meglmara suna tau agl bugla wakai kaima kiglkwa ta kan, ye na aglna buglana sugl moraiglmedi edinatniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Isip king yegl di kodugo, Josep pi, ye nem kidagl ama agre i ede u king ye kanabedi king moglmara ugwa. Ugo, Jekop ye Isip king di wakai yei togwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Di wakai yei togo, Isip king ye di pre, Ene bugla yugu siramna nene? dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yegl dugo, Jekop di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na bugla yugu 130 wan mogl, dumo pere pere kipaiga. Na bugla yugu mere nekre, yubun mere iga. Na nina ya yagl awana ki okna meglkwa i, ye bugla yugu mere kide wan mogl, dumo pere pere kipaimere yegl mere erekrie di, Jekop yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Jekop yegl didre, ye aglke kor Isip king di wakai yei tedre, ye moglmara kide kodidre, ede ogwa.<verse eid="GEN 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Ana Josep we, ye king dumere ere, Isip suna dumo makan wakai kaima ta yogwa i, nem agiglema togo, ye kipai meglkwa. Ye kipai meglkwa i, dumo Gosen ikra suna taun Rameses okuo yenabara magigl i kipai meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Ki pai meglko, Josep ege ege ye nem agiglema kugl mogo yubu si togwa. Ye yoba ya gak kebra siramna meglkwa i kersre, kugl mogo nebi, kuno erabere mere yegl yubu si te moglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dumo Isip kidan podo yogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Ana kidan ikra podo kaima yogwa pre dumo magigl i, kaya mokna ta paikrukwa. Kidan podo kaima yogwa i pre dumo Isip ya dumo Kenan suo akie u kide ebrika. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Ana dumo Isip ya dumo Kenan suna i kaya mokna ta paikrukwa pre yoba kugl mogo swara topo sidre, ne meglkwa. Ne meglko, Josep ye migeno mudu idre, i pi king yugumo edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Yegl ere meglko, Isip yoba ya Kenan yoba migeno mudu dudugwa. Dudugo, Isip yoba mudu ere mogl, Josep moglmara udre, yegl digwa, Kugl mogo yoko noro! Ene ta norokre, yoko kan motn, no goramniwa. No migeno dudumiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yegl digo, Josep di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene migeno dudinan, ene aglno buglano wagle kugl mogo topo sinaiglkwa. Ene aglno buglano yu naribi, kugl mogo tenaluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Josep yegl dugo, yoba aglno buglano yu tedre, kugl mogo i neigwa. Ye hos, ya donki, ya sipsip, ya meme, ya kau yu tedre, bugla yugu swara i wagle kugl mogo i neigwa.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Ana bugla yugu ta we, Isip yoba aglke kor Josep moglmara udre, yegl digwa, Yagl kade yo, no yubun podo yumga i, teke padiglkramga. No migeno mudu dudugo, ene no aglno buglano ama mudu inga. Taragl ta tedre, kugl mogo inamga, ta yekrukwa. No ogono nagino ya makano i keme tenamga yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Ene kugl mogo notn, no makano king tedre, ye nigl kogonmo yoba moramga. Ta manan, no goramga. No gun, makano ama wau yenabuka. Ene kugl mogo nenamga pre norsre, ere yaramga pre ama tau noro! Yegl etn, no ta goglkrumun, makan ama wau yekrabiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Ana Isip yoba yegl digwa pre Josep makano mudu idre, ye kugl mogo togwa. Kidan podo kaima yogwa pre Isip yoba mudu yegl ere, makano king makanmo aimadi yenabedi teigwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Ana Josep ye Isip yoba makano idre, kugl mogo tedre, Isip yoba mudu koglo koglo meglkwa i taun moraiglmedi edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Ba ye makan tau ikrukwa i, ye Isip yoba godno tawa teigwa yoba meglkwa i, makano ikrukwa. Isip king ye kugl mogo yubu si togwa pre ye pra nedre, makano tekrikwa.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Ana Josep ere mogl, Isip yoba yegl di togwa, Erme we, na ene ya ene makano mudu topo si idre, king teiga. Ene kugl mogo ere yaramne digwa i, na ene tenaglka. Tebo, ene i pi yaraiglmiwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />I pi yaraiglkwa ba okuo, kugl mogo koran, ene kugl mogo br bage 5-pela bogl, bage swara ta king tenaiglkwa. Te, kugl mogo br 4-pela boraiglkwa i, enene pre yenabuka. Ene tau aglke kor ere yaglsre, tau neno agroma ya gagroma bogl nenaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Josep yegl dugo, yoba di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl kade yo, ene no ake ple di notnga pre no ta goglkramga. Ene no wakai kan, ene dinere yegl no king nigl kogonmo yoba moramniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Yoba yegl digo, Josep ere mogl, yoba kugl mogo bage 5-pela edidre, bage swara ta king tenaiglme dugwa i, ka giglede aimadi yegl panabedi di paduglkwa. Yegl di paduglko, ka giglede di paduglkwa i, erme pai moglkwa. Tawa teigwa yoba makano i keme king ikrukwa pre yegl ta tekrikwa.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep nem ka kaima di te padigl, Ene gogln, na ene i pi dumo Kenan kobuglo mur yenagle dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Ana Israel yoba we, ye dumo Isip suna i, dumo Gosen makan idre, kipai meglkwa. Kipai moglsre, ye gagro mere kiglko, pare wai digwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Te, Jekop we, ye bugla yugu 17-pela dumo Isip suna i moglkwa. Yegl pre ye bugla yugu siramna nogwa i swara ede, 147 nogwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Ye bugla yugu 147 nedre, gorabuka igne magigl ugwa. Magigl ugo, ye wam Josep agle dugo, ugwa. Josep ugo, ye nem ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Ene na wakai kan, erme ogon na bikina wagle atne padiglsre, na ere wakai ere narsre, mabuno du ere narantnga i pre ka kaima di nare padratnedi prika. Na goglbo, ene dumo Isip magigl i na maugl sikratnga i pre diga. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Na nina ya yagl awana giurere goglbo, na ogona gagna idre, dumo Isip kide kodo, ede pi ye kobuglo mur yeimara yenatniwe di, yegl dugo, Josep ye di te, Ene dinere yegl eraluwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Josep yegl dugo, ye nem aglke kor ye di te, Ene ka giglede di nare padiglo! dugwa. Yegl dugo, Josep di ikne ede, Ka giglede di te padiluwe dugwa. Josep yegl dugo, ye nem kidagl Israel i, bogl mina mogl, bre magididre, God kamage ere togwa.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Jekop ye Efraim ya Manase di wakai yei togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Ana okuo, yoba ta Josep moglmara u, ye di te, Nen kidagl kide sumiwe dugwa. Dugo, Josep wam suo Manase ya Efraim agre idre, ede pi nem kidagl wam suo kanabedi agre i ogwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Agre i ogo, yoba ta Jekop di te, Ene wan Josep ene motnara umiwe dugo, ye yobuglo i padiglsre, ugl pai moglkwa i kodo, adigl bogl mina ame dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Ana Josep ede u nem kidagl moglmara ugo, Jekop ere mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Na okna dumo Kenan suna dumo kebra Lus we dimara moglka igne, God Yobuglo Podo Paugwa na moglmara plau didre, di wakai yei nare, <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />yegl dugwa, Na ene gawanma mere kide moglsre, yugobuno pere pere moraiglmedi ere edenaglka. Ere edibo, na ene ya ene gawanma dumo makan magigl i ene makano aimadi kamin yenabedi tenaluwe di, God yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Ana na ede Isip magigl i ukrika igne, ene wan suo kuglnga, kagno Efraim ya Manase we dinga. Ana wan suo i we, ye na wana kaima mere yegl morabrika. Ruben ya Simeon na wana kaima miurere yegl mere na wana kaima morabrika. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Te, ene gak tau okuo kuratnga i, ene gagiglnma kaima moraiglkwa. Ye makan ya ki inaiglkwa i, ye agro komono Efraim ya Manase wama mere yegl moglsre, ye kagno mina inaiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Te, na dumo Mesopotemia kide kodidre, ede dumo Kenan suna wiga igne, ene man Resel goglko, na mirie podo goglka. No ede dumo Efrata we dimara enamnedi kuri ta magigl magigl omgo, ye goglkwa. Ye goglko, na konbauna bina maugl siwe di, yegl dugwa. Ana ye dumo Efrata pre dugwa i, yoba erme Betlehem we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8-10" />Ana Josep nem kidagl Israel i, kidagl kaima yogwa pre ye gumuglo kin yenagledi erukwa. Eruko, ye Josep wam suo magigl miurka kan pogl sikrukwa pre ye ere mogl, Yagl gak suo i, ira miure? dugwa. Dugo, Josep di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, I na wana suo, na dumo Isip magigl i moglka igne God narukwa ikra miuriwe dugwa. Josep yegl dugo, ye nem aglke kor dugwa, Ene ye agre i ede u na moglmara magigl edinatnedi prika. Magigl edin, na ye di wakai yei tenaluwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Josep ye agre i ede pi nem moglmara edugo, nem ye yagl gak suo i nuguno kugro, paunano si nogwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:8-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Yegl ersre, ye Josep di te, yegl dugwa, Na okna ene guman dran aglke kor ta kankragledi prika, ba erme we, God na ere wakai ere naruko, na ene kandre, ene wan suo ama kaniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Israel ka yegl dugo, Josep ye wam suo Israel bikie wagle ame di miurka i, i eglke edidre, ye goglko bodugl, bre magide guma dra makan mina edugwa.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Ana Josep kuri ta mogl, wam suo aglke kor agre i pi nem kidagl moglmara edugwa. Ye wam Efraim, Israel ogo koda kra morabedi ogo wo mina akidre, wam Manase Israel ogo wo kra morabedi ogo koda mina akidre, agre i ede pi nem kidagl moglmara edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Yegl erukwa ba Israel ere mogl, ogo topo suade erse, ogo wo Efraim bre mina akidre, ogo koda Manase bre mina akugwa. Manase ye Josep wam komono moglkwa pre Israel ogo wo ye bre mina akenabuka paugwa ba yegl ta erekrukwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15-16" />Israel ogo gak suo bitno mina akidre, ye Josep di wakai yei te, yegl dugwa, God ye yagl gak suo i ere wakai ere tenabiwa. Na God we diga i, na nina Aisak ya na yagl awana Abraham God kamo duglo biurka God i pre diga. Te, God, ye sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba mere yegl mogl, na gak kebra moglka igne ede u erme pra na sugl moglkwa, God i pre diga. Te, taragl kane kane na ere kide eramnedi erikwa igne, God ye angelo mere yegl u, na ege ege ere yugwa God i pre diga. Ye yagl gak suo i ere wakai ere tenan, ye gawano u mere kide enaiglmiwa. U mere kide pi meglbi, na ya na nina Aisak ya na yagl awana Abraham, no kagno ta dudukrabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 48:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Ana Josep nem ka yegl di kodugo, Josep ye ogo wo Efraim bre mina akugwa ikra ake i pi Manase bre mina akenabedi erukwa. Josep ye nem ogo wo Efraim bre mina akididre, ogo koda Manase bre mina akugwa i kandre, kide prukwa pre yegl erukwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Ye nem ogo wo ake i pi Manase bre mina akenabedi ersre, nem yegl di togwa, Ene ogon wo gak i bre mina akekratniwa. Gak ta moglkwa i, na wana komono moglkwa pre ene ogon wo gak i bre mina akenatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Yegl dugwa ba ye nem ere mogl, Mane dugwa. Wana yo, ira komono moglkwa i, na pre kan erika. Ene wan komono yagl kade ta morabuka. Yagl kade moran, ye gawama yugobuno ta moraiglkwa. Ba ene wan okuo we, ye yagl kade mogl, wan komono tenabuka. Yegl moran, ye gawama mere kide moglsre, yugobuno mere moraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Israel ka yegl di kodidre, ye ere mogl, Josep wam suo di wakai yei te, yegl dugwa, Israel yoba okuo moraiglkwa we, ye yoba di wakai yei tenamnedi pribi, yegl dinaiglkwa, Ene we, ene Efraim ya Manase wakai miurere yegl moratniwe di, yegl dinaiglmiwe dugwa. Efraim ye okuo moglkwa ba Israel ere mogl, Efraim ya Manase we dugwa i, ye Efraim i komono mere edugwa. <verse eid="GEN 48:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Ye ka yegl didre, ye ama wam Josep di te, yegl dugwa, Ene pro! Na goraglka igne magigl ugwa. Na goraglka ba okuo we, God ene moraiglmara mogl tedre, ene auro i pi, dumo Kenan, ene kowano awano meglmara edenabuka. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Dumo Kenan suna i, na bainet ya kibr yer idre, Amor yoba kuda bogl tedre, muglo meglbi ta iga. Na dumo tau ene agiglnma makano yenabedi obuno di teiga ba muglo meglbi i, na ene agiglnma tekre, ene swara teie di, Israel yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Jekop ere mogl, ye wama mina siragl taragl okuo plau dinabuka i, di nogugl ede togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Ana Jekop ere mogl, ye wama mudu di makai sidre, yegl dugwa, Na ene wagle siragl taragl okuo plau dinabuka i, di nogugl ede tenaglka. Ene u magigl mogl, praiglma wio! <verse eid="GEN 49:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Na kagna Jekop we didre, Israel we ama digwa. Ene na wanama meglkwa i, ede magigl ya udre, ka dinaglka i prio!<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Ana Ruben we, ene na wana komono motnga. Na kulu moglka igne, na yobuglna wagle ene kuglka. Na ene kuglko, ene u kade pidre, yagl kade mogl agiglnma mudu tedre, yobuglo ere agiglnma mudu ama tenga. <verse eid="GEN 49:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Yegl etnga ba ene ka prikitnga. Nigl podo sugwa igne, yoba Yegl moglo dibi, kuno erabo? Ta manugwa. Nigl i yoba ta kano prikrumere ene ama ka prikitnga. Ene ka prikre, na boglna wagle ebina ta bogl, bogl swara pabrika. Ene na agai goraglka mabuno etnga pre ene erme yagl komono mere moglkratniwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Te, Simeon ya Livai we, ene komono okuo miurka. Ene bainet idre, yoba gua gua si giurka. <verse eid="GEN 49:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Ene deno kubro, yoba si goglsre, enene wakai pribrere kau kaglno gogono si keglu sibrika. Yegl pre ene atne teke mogl, ka di padrabrara i, na moglkribo, ene ka di padrabrika i, na dena mudna ama yei tekraglka. <verse eid="GEN 49:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Ene deno podo kubrsre, yoba mitno goglkre, si giurka pre enene u kide enabrika. Na erme di padiglka i, ene gawanoma dumo swara moglkre, Israel yoba mudu kipai moraiglmara suna bage bage kipai moraiglmiwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Te, Juda we, ene agiglnma ene debin sidre, bitno magide ene tenaiglmiwa. Te, ene kuda ikne kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo eratniwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Ene laion yobuglno podo pamere yegl yobugln podo paugwa. Laion ere mogl, taragl ere sidre, neigwa. Ne kodidre, ye ede ikne ugl paimara dumo pi, ugl paigwa. Ye ugl paigwa igne, yoba ta ere mogl, uglno yokinaiglkwa, kudugl geglkwa. Ene ama yobugln podo yegl mere paugwa pre yoba mabuno gua gua ene ere tenaiglkwa i, ye ama kudugl goraiglkwa pre diga. <verse eid="GEN 49:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Te, ene gawanma we, ye aimadi king muglbono ake moglsre, yoba kingno moraiglkwa. Yegl ere meglbi, okuo gawan swara ta udre, muglbo akidre, king kaima morabuka. Ye king moran, yoba yugobuno pere pere moraiglkwa i, ye kamo duglo boraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Ana ene we, u wakai en, edenen wain mere kide panaiglkwa. Mere kide panaiglkwa pre ene donkinen ede wain mina kane kogln, tau nenabuka i pre yubun dekratniwa. Te, wain nuglo i we, mere kide moran, ene tau kogl i pi kugugl gaglnen wain nuglo mina nigl edinatnga, i ama kuno erabuka. <verse eid="GEN 49:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Wain nuglo mere kide morabuka pre ene nen, gumugln u gogl enabuka. Te, kau ame nuglo ama mere kide duko idre, nen, sign u kruo kaima enabiwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Te, Sebulun we, ene gawanma mudi nigl bina kipai moraiglmiwa. Ki pai meglbi, ye dumono yoba sipno u panaiglkwa pre wakai yenabiwa. Te, ye makano Numa ta we, taun ta Saidon we dimara yenabuka.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Te, Isakar we, ene gawanma donki ta yobuglo podo paugwa ba yoba bek ya ki donki moko bolamugl edigo, donki i yoko dane wagle ugl pai moglkwa mere yegl moraiglkwa. Yobuglno podo panabuka ba ye oglka eraiglmiwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Oglka eraiglkwa ba okuo ye makano ya kipanaiglmara wakai kandre, dumo i moramnedi donki ta kogon erukwa mere yegl yoba pere niglno kogono ere tenaiglmiwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Te, Dan we, ene gawanma Israel yoba kotno pre yubu sinaiglkwa. Te, ye Israel yoba suna i yugobuno swara ta moraiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Ye kudano ikne ye toki kide no sugwa mere yegl meglmedi kanaiglkwa. Toki kide ta konbauna bina moglsre, yoba ta hos au sidre ugwa igne ye hos kagle mina sugo, yoba hos au sugwa i ye moko wagle yage maginagle sugwa, ene gawanma ye kudano ikne yegl mere sinaiglkwa pre die di, Jekop yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Jekop ka yegl didre, ye ere mogl, Yawe God ka yegl di togwa, Yawe yo, ene na ere inatnga pre sugl moluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Ye ka yegl didre, ye aglke kor wama di te, yegl dugwa, Ana Gat we, kunogl yoba ene gawanma moraiglmara u kuda bogl tenaiglmiwa. Kuda bogl tenaiglkwa ba ene gawanma ye sika sidre, kuda bogl te ikne edinaiglmiwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Te, Aser we, ene gawanma makano wagle kaya mokna wakai kaima borabuka. King kaya mokna wakai kaima neimere yegl borabiwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Te, Naptali we, ene dia are ta yene prumere wan moglsre, gagigle kuglkwa yoba wakai kaima kanigwa kuglmere mere yegl motniwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Te, Josep we, ene ede mogo koglkwa mere yegl motniwa. Ede ta nigl ogo beimara bina ere yaiglko, yogagle ede u eglke pidre, togl erimara ede meda pidre, mogo mere koglkwa mere yegl motniwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Te, kuda yoba tau deno kubro ene tedre, kibr kogl, ene sinamnedi erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Yegl erikwa ba ene kibrnen ake gi didre, ogon nuglo dikre, teke pikitnga. Na Godna Yobuglo Podo Paugwa i, ene yobugln panabedi ene ake ple di togwa pre yegl etnga. God, ye sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba mere yegl Israel sugl moglsre, ye kugl bogl te moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Na Godna, God Yobuglo Podo Paugwa i, ye ene ake ple di tedre, ere wakai ere togwa. Ye ene kaya mokna ere yaglnara kamun sinabedi dedidre, nigl makan atne moglkwa ama makan ake tomunabedi dedidre, ene ebin gak kuraiglmedi dedugwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />God na kowana awanama ere wakai ere togwa ba ye na ka kaima ere wakai ere narukwa. Na siragl mere ye na ere wakai ere narabedi prika i, ere narukwa. Ana God na ere wakai ere narumere ene ama ere wakai ere tenabiwa. Ene agiglnma meglmara suna i, ene swara yagl kade motniwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Te, Benjamin we, ene agl are podo, taragl are ere sugwa mere yegl motniwa. Ene tagna mogl kuda ikne si goglsre, eduer ye taraglno yoba tenagledi yubu siniwe di, Jekop ka yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Ana Jekop wama 12-pela i, ye gawama ama okuo kagie Israel mina atne yugobuno 12-pela meglkwa. Jekop siragl taragl okuo plau dinabuka ye wama di togwa i, ye wama swara swarade ka ta di tenabuka kuno erabere yegl di togwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jekop goglko, ye i pi kobuglo mur yeigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Ana Jekop ye wama swara swarade siragl taragl ye meglmara okuo plau dinabuka i di tedre, ye ama ere mogl, ye wama yegl di togwa, Na kuri kaima ta mogl, goraglka. Na goglbo, na i pi, na nina ya yagl awana kobuglo mur atne yeimara yeo! Kobuglo mur i, okna Hit yoba Efron makanmo wagle yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />Makan i, dumo Kenan suna, dumo kebra ta Makpela we dimara yogwa. Te, Makpela i, dumo Mamre we dimara ta magigl yogwa. Abraham okna Hit yoba Efron ikra mige tedre, dumo makan i, ye giglmo pene yenabedi topo sugwa. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Kobuglo mur i, yoba Abraham ya ye ebie Sara yedre, Aisak ya ye ebie Rebeka ama yeigwa. Te, na kobuglo mur i wagle ebina Lea ama yeiga. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Dumo makan i ya kobuglo mur i, okna Hit yoba makano yogwa ba Abraham topo sumiwe di, Jekop yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Jekop ye wama ka yegl di te kodidre, ye bogl mina ugl moko kra pai mogl, goglkwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Ana Josep nem kidagl goglko, Josep ye nugo kugro, pauna si nedre, kai ere togwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Yegl ersre, ye ere mogl, nem kidagl ogo nagie bugl dinabedi ye doktamo tau marasin ya ki ogo nagie mina akenaiglmedi dedugwa. Dedugo, ye dumere yegl erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Yoba geglko, ogono nagino bugl dinaiglmedi marasin akigwa i, ege ege 40-pela de mere yegl ere meglkwa pre Josep dokta dedugo, ye ama ege 40-pela de ere meglkwa. Dokta yegl ere meglko, Isip yoba ege 70-pela de kai ere teigwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Kai ere tedre, gaba buko digo, Josep ere mogl, Isip king yobamo kade tau di te, yegl dugwa, Ene we, ene na wakai kanibi, na ka ta ene di tenarika i, ene i pi king di teo! <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />Na nina kidagl kor moglkwa igne, ye yegl di narukwa, Na we, na kuri ta mogl, goraglka. Na goglbo, ene na i pi dumo Kenan suna kobuglo mur ta nana wakai ere perika i yomara yenatniwa. I pre na ka giglede di nare padiglo! di, nina kidagl yegl dugo, na ye dumere ka giglede di te padiglka. Yegl pre king ta pra we dinan, na nina kidagl goglkwa i pi dumo i kobuglo mur atne yedre, ede ikne unaluwe di, Josep yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Josep yegl dugo, king yobamo kade i, ede pi king di teigo, king ye Josep di te, Ene nen kidagl ka giglede di nare padratne dumere yegl ere, nen kidagl goglkwa i, i pi kobuglo mur atne yeo! di, king yegl dugwa.<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Ana king yegl dugwa pre Josep ye nem kidagl goglkwa i, i pi kobuglo mur atne yenagledi ede ogwa. Te, Isip king yobamo kade ama akie eigwa. Ye yobamo kade tau king nomane teigwa yeigo, tau dumo Isip sugl meglkwa i yeigo, mudu Josep bogl akie eigwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Te, Josep agiglema ya yobama ya ye nem kidagl nem agiglema ama Josep bogl akie eigwa. Ye mudu eigwa ba ye gagro kebra ya kau ya meme ya sipsip kiglkwa i ta i pikre, dumo Gosen kanige erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Te, Isip soldia karis mina wanigwa i ya hos au sidre wanigwa i ama tau akie eigwa. Yoba mere kide kaima Josep bogl akie eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Yoba i mudu ede pi dumo ta Atat we dimara eigo, Josep ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na nina kidagl goglkwa pre nono dumo magigl i ege 7-pela de kai ere tenamne dugo, ye mirie goglsre, ege 7-pela de kai podo ere meglkwa. Dumo Atat i, nigl Jordan umara magigl yedre, yoba kugl mogo ugla peglmara dumo yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Ana yoba Josep bogl akie eigwa i kai ere meglko, Kenan yoba magigl kipaigwa i kandre, yegl digwa, Yoba ta goglkwa pre Isip yoba i, mirie podo goglsre, kai erime digwa. Yegl pre ye dumo nigl Jordan umara magigl yogwa i kagie kor yei, Abel Misraim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Hibru mina kagie Abel Misraim i, mabuno paugwa, Isip yoba kai erikwa.</char></note> we digwa.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Ana Jekop kor moglkwa igne, ye wama di tomere mere erikwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Ye ogo nagie boglo ere ede pi dumo Kenan suna pidre, kobuglo mur ta dumo Makpela we digwa yomara atne yeigwa. Kobuglo mur i Abraham okna ye giglmo pene yenabedi Hit yoba ta Efron we digwa mige tedre, makan magigl i yogwa ya kobuglo mur akie topo sugwa. Makan i, dumo Mamre we dimara magigl yogwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Ana Josep ya ye agiglema ya yoba mudu ye bogl akie ye nem kidagl goglkwa i pi kobuglo mur yenamnedi eigwa i, ye i pi kobuglo mur atne yedre, aglke ede ikne Isip eigwa.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep agiglema ye mabuno kide ere teigwa i, gugl ede togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Ana Josep agiglema we, ye neno kidagl goglkwa pre ye kudugl goglsre, yegl digwa, Nono okna mabuno kide kaima ta Josep ere tomga. Ana erme we, Josep dem ta kubro pai moran, nono mabuno kide ere tomnara ere noro ikne edenabiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Yegl didre, ye ka ta Josep prabedi dede, yegl digwa, Josep yo, no neno kidagl goragledi erukwa igne, ye yegl di norukwa, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />Na ka ta dinarika i, ene i pi Josep di tenaiglmiwa. Na yegl diga, Josep yo, ene agiglnma we, ye tadaglme ersre, mabuno kide ene ere teigwa. Yegl erikwa ba na ene di prika i, ye tadaglmeno gugl edinatnedi priwe di, neno kidagl yegl dugwa. Ana erme we, no neno Godmo nigl kogonmo yoba munga i, ene no tadaglmeno gugl edinatnedi prumniwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl digo, yoba ta kano i pi Josep di togo, ye prisre, kai erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Ana okuo Josep agiglema ede u ye moglmara udre, goglkono bodugl, bitno magide, gumano drano makan mina edidre, ye di te, No ene nigl kogonen yoba muniwe digwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Yegl digwa ba Josep di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene kudugl goglkrio! Na God moglkrika pre na ene mabuno kide erimara ere ikne ede tekraglka. <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Ene na mabuno kide ere naramnedi prikwa ba God ye taragl wakai ta plau dinabedi kanige erukwa. Taragl wakai ta plau dinabedi prukwa i, nono erme kamga. Yoba mere kide goglkre, kor meglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Yegl pre ene kudugl goglkrio! Na ene ya ene gagroma sugl moraluwe di, yegl dugwa. Ye ka wakai yegl di togo, deno muduno aragan erukwa.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josep goglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Ana Josep ya ye nem kidagl nem agiglema mudu dumo Isip kipai mogl pai meglkwa. Pai meglko, Josep bugla yugu 110 nogwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Ye wam Efraim gak tau kuglkwa i, Josep kanugo, Efraim gagiglma i ama kade mogl, abu i, gak kiglko, ye kor mogl, kanugwa. Te, Josep wam Manase we, ye yagl gak ta kuglkwa, kagie Makir we dugwa. Makir yake kade moglkwa igne, ye ama ere mogl, yagl gak tau kuglkwa. Ye yagl gak tau kuglkwa i, yoba i pi Josep teigo, ye bikie wagle padigl, kugro moglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Josep ye bugla yugu mere kide nedre, ye ere mogl, agiglema yegl di togwa, Na we, na gorarika. Na gorarika ba God ye ene sugl moglsre, okuo ye ene dumo Isip magigl i moglkraiglmedi agre i ede pi dumo Kenan edenabuka. Dumo Kenan i, ye Abraham ya Aisak ya Jekop ka kaima di te, Ene ya ene gawanoma tenaluwe dumiwe di, Josep yegl dugwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Ye yegl didre, ya ama ere mogl, ye agiglema yegl di togwa, God ene ka kaima sugl morabuka. Te, ene Israel yoba dumo magigl i kide kodidre, ede dumo Kenan ebi, ene na yobuglna ama i pi dumo Kenan maugl sinaiglmiwa. I pre ka kaima di nare padilo! di, yegl dugo, ye ka giglede di te padiglkwa. <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Ana Josep bugla yugu 110 ikra nedre, goglkwa. Goglko, yoba ye ogo nagie bugl dinabedi marasin ya ki akidre, ogo nagie kofin boks wagle atne edidre, dumo Isip suna i yeigwa.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>